<node id="目标函数">
  <data key="d0">目标函数</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">目标函数是优化问题中用于量化并评估候选解优劣的核心函数，其值通常需要通过算法求解过程被最小化或最大化。在萤火虫算法等启发式方法中，萤火虫的亮度直接由目标函数值决定，从而引导搜索方向。在调度优化领域，目标函数常被定义为最小化最大完工时间C_max，例如柔性作业车间调度问题变体FJSP‑JPC‑TST的优化目标即为f=min(C_max)；也有模型将其构造为最小化所有工件带优先级的延误天数总和，即min ∑_j α(P_j) T_j，以体现工期重要性。在混合整数线性规划（MILP）模型中，目标函数不仅包含主要优化项，还可能加入惩罚项以处理约束违反。对于多目标优化问题，目标函数则表示一组需要同时优化的性能指标函数。在实验评估中，通常会报告目标函数在多次运行中取得的最小值和平均值，以反映算法性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
