<node id="算法1">
  <data key="d0">算法1</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Firefly Algorithm的伪代码，描述了算法的基本步骤。&lt;SEP&gt;FLMA中文化基因搜索与反馈学习的主循环算法&lt;SEP&gt;描述了开发搜索阶段主要过程的算法伪代码，输入为种群P和外部档案E，输出为更新后的外部档案E。&lt;SEP&gt;名为Initilization的算法，实现了负载均衡初始化规则，输出初始种群pop-st。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854070</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(13)">
  <data key="d0">方程(13)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">吸引力的广义单调递减函数形式：β(r)=β0 e^{-γ r^m}。&lt;SEP&gt;表示插入标准之一的最大运算公式，定义当前工件加工开始时间T_a的计算方式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(14)">
  <data key="d0">方程(14)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(13)的近似形式：β(r)=β0/(1+γ r^2)。&lt;SEP&gt;表示插入标准的另一个不等式，确保工件加工在空闲时间段的结束时间之前完成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(15)">
  <data key="d0">方程(15)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">两个萤火虫之间的笛卡尔距离公式：r_ij=||x_i-x_j||。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(16)">
  <data key="d0">方程(16)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">萤火虫位置更新公式，包含吸引力项和随机化项：x_i = x_i + β0 e^{-γ r^2} (x_i - x_j) + α ε_i。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="当前全局最优">
  <data key="d0">当前全局最优</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">萤火虫算法在每次迭代中寻找的当前最优解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
