<node id="A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints">
  <data key="d0">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">研究论文，提出了一种混合整数线性规划模型和离散萤火虫算法，用于解决带有可用性约束的扩展柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ICAISC 2018">
  <data key="d0">ICAISC 2018</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">2018年人工智能与软计算国际会议，本论文发表于此会议论文集。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSP)">
  <data key="d0">柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种扩展的作业车间调度问题，假设一个工序可以在多台机器上加工。&lt;SEP&gt;一种经典的单工厂调度问题，工件在多台机器上加工，需分配工艺流程并排序，所有工序在同一工厂完成。近年来被广泛研究。&lt;SEP&gt;一种经典的调度问题，工序可在多台机器上选择加工，并考虑工件优先级和多种时间因素。&lt;SEP&gt;一种生产调度问题的变体，通过优化操作顺序和机器分配来缩短生产周期。&lt;SEP&gt;标准柔性作业车间调度问题，eGA算法的应用领域。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业车间调度问题(JSP)">
  <data key="d0">作业车间调度问题(JSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">经典的调度问题，每个工序只能在一台机器上加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器选择子问题(MS)">
  <data key="d0">机器选择子问题(MS)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSP的子问题，涉及为每个工序选择合适的机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工序排序子问题(OS)">
  <data key="d0">工序排序子问题(OS)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSP的子问题，涉及确定工序的加工顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可用性约束">
  <data key="d0">可用性约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在生产系统中，机器不可用的时间段，可能由预防性维护、轮班模式等引起。&lt;SEP&gt;作业车间调度中的可用性约束，指由于已知的维护任务等导致机器不可用的情况，Aggoune首先对此进行了研究。&lt;SEP&gt;指在柔性作业车间调度问题中，机器可能因为维护、故障等原因不可用的约束条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="固定可用性约束">
  <data key="d0">固定可用性约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器的不可用时间段在固定时间点开始。&lt;SEP&gt;维护活动的开始时间是固定的，即最早开始时间等于最晚开始时间。&lt;SEP&gt;机器维护任务的开始时间固定的约束，不允许在时间窗内调整。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-031</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="非固定可用性约束">
  <data key="d0">非固定可用性约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器的不可用时间段没有固定的开始时间。&lt;SEP&gt;维护活动的开始时间可以在一个预定义的时间窗口内选择。&lt;SEP&gt;机器维护任务的开始时间和持续时间不固定的约束，允许在时间窗内调整。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-031</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可跨越约束">
  <data key="d0">可跨越约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">允许工序在不可用时间段内被中断和恢复的约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="不可跨越约束">
  <data key="d0">不可跨越约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">不允许工序被中断的可用性约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可恢复操作">
  <data key="d0">可恢复操作</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">当机器从不可用时段恢复后，工序可以继续加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="不可恢复操作">
  <data key="d0">不可恢复操作</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">当机器从不可用时段恢复后，工序必须重新加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253366</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工业4.0">
  <data key="d0">工业4.0</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">以智能工厂为核心的第四次工业革命。&lt;SEP&gt;驱动制造业全球化和分布式制造发展的工业趋势。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="智能工厂">
  <data key="d0">智能工厂</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">采用先进技术的自动化制造设施，工业4.0的关键组成部分。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="混合整数线性规划模型(MILP)">
  <data key="d0">混合整数线性规划模型(MILP)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出的用于解决FJSP-FCR的数学模型。&lt;SEP&gt;为解决DRFJSP-OJP而开发的混合整数线性规划模型。</data>
