  <data key="d0">SMF</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">SMF是表格中的一种算法，其对应行包含数值12、8、32、2.6、14、12、77、39.5、11、10、62、109.5、7、6、42、39.1、11、10、93、864.6，无缺失数据。&lt;SEP&gt;仿真建模方法，在Pentium IV 2.4 GHz、512 MB RAM、Matlab环境下实现，在Kacem实例上进行了比较。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PSO + SA">
  <data key="d0">PSO + SA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">PSO + SA是一种混合元启发式算法，用于求解扩展的柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSP-FCR)。在所展示的表格中，该算法在五个实例上的性能数据显示部分实例结果缺失，三个实例有记录。&lt;SEP&gt;混合粒子群优化与模拟退火算法，在Kacem实例上进行了比较。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table 5">
  <data key="d0">Table 5</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">展示多种算法在五个Kacem实例上比较结果的表格，使用了权重系数λ1=0.5, λ2=0.3, λ3=0.2。&lt;SEP&gt;论文中的表5，展示了操作数少于100的实例的计算结果。&lt;SEP&gt;FJSSP-nfa结果表，按实例规模(少于100个操作)列出。&lt;SEP&gt;表格5，报告了每个实例规模F|m|n下各算法的平均RPD值。&lt;SEP&gt;表格5，展示了MA、NNIA和NSGA-Ⅲ的IGD比较数据。&lt;SEP&gt;报告计算结果的表格，包含实例名称、超热作业数、平均X-factor、最大X-factor、热作业和正常作业的结果以及CPU时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Weight Coefficients Set 1">
  <data key="d0">Weight Coefficients Set 1</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在Brandimarte实验中使用的权重系数：λ1=1.0, λ2=0.0, λ3=0.0。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Weight Coefficients Set 2">
  <data key="d0">Weight Coefficients Set 2</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在Kacem实验中使用的权重系数：λ1=0.5, λ2=0.3, λ3=0.2。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="W. Tessaro Lunardi et al.">
  <data key="d0">W. Tessaro Lunardi et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">本文作者，提出了DFA算法和MILP模型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Kacem">
  <data key="d0">Kacem</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Kacem等人，提出了五个多目标灵活作业车间调度问题实例。&lt;SEP&gt;Kacem等人(2002)提出的FJSSP实例集，含4个实例，操作数12-56，机器数5-10，全灵活性(任何操作可由任何机器加工)，加工时间取决于机器&lt;SEP&gt;一组经典的调度问题测试实例，常用于评估算法性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(2)">
  <data key="d0">约束(2)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">支持目标函数(1)的约束条件之一。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(2)确保C_max值大于最后一个完成的操作的完成时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(3)">
  <data key="d0">约束(3)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">支持目标函数(1)的约束条件之一。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(3)确保每个操作都被分配到一个机器上。&lt;SEP&gt;保证每个作业分配到一个工厂和一台机器</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(4)">
  <data key="d0">约束(4)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">确保工序的持续时间，考虑其加工时间和经过的所有不可用时段。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(4)是作业操作顺序约束，确保同一作业的操作按正确顺序进行。&lt;SEP&gt;禁止虚拟作业作为前驱</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(5)">
  <data key="d0">约束(5)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">防止两个工序在同一机器上重叠的约束之一。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(5)与约束(6)共同要求维护任务在其对应的时间窗口内被调度。&lt;SEP&gt;限制每个工厂每台机器上第一个作业的数量</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(6)">
  <data key="d0">约束(6)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">防止两个工序在同一机器上重叠的约束之一，与约束(5)配合。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(6)与约束(5)共同要求维护任务在其对应的时间窗口内被调度。&lt;SEP&gt;将x_{j l} 表示为y的线性求和</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(7)">
  <data key="d0">约束(7)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">确保工序不与机器不可用时段重叠，若重叠则增加操作时间。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(7)对每对操作强制一个在另一个之前调度，以防止同一机器上的操作重叠。&lt;SEP&gt;强制同一工件内的作业在同一工厂加工</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(8)">
  <data key="d0">约束(8)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">与约束(7)共同确保工序与不可用时段不重叠。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(8)与约束(9)共同防止同一机器上操作与维护任务之间的重叠。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(9)">
  <data key="d0">约束(9)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">确保同一工件内工序的先后顺序约束。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(9)与约束(8)共同防止同一机器上操作与维护任务之间的重叠。&lt;SEP&gt;期望意义下机器上连续作业的加工顺序约束，使用期望算子处理随机加工时间</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(10)">
  <data key="d0">约束(10)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">要求每个工序只能从可用机器集合中选择一台机器加工。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(10)与约束(11)共同限制变量v_{ij i' j'} 的值，确保如果两个操作在同一台机器上调度，它们不能同时处理。&lt;SEP&gt;期望意义下同一工件内作业的优先约束，使用期望算子处理随机加工时间</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(11)">
  <data key="d0">约束(11)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">强制当工序不在某机器上加工时，其开始时间为零。&lt;SEP&gt;约束(11)与约束(10)共同限制变量v_{ij i' j'} 的值，确保如果两个操作在同一台机器上调度，它们不能同时处理。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(12)">
  <data key="d0">约束(12)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">强制当工序不在某机器上加工时，其完工时间为零。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变量s_{ijk}">
  <data key="d0">变量s_{ijk}</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件i的第j道工序在机器k上的开始时间变量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变量c_{ijk}">
  <data key="d0">变量c_{ijk}</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件i的第j道工序在机器k上的完工时间变量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变量v_{ijk}">
  <data key="d0">变量v_{ijk}</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二进制变量，取值1当且仅当工件i的第j道工序在机器k上加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变量z_{ijhgk}">
  <data key="d0">变量z_{ijhgk}</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二进制变量，用于确定同一机器上两个工序的先后顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变量y_{ijkr}">
  <data key="d0">变量y_{ijkr}</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二进制变量，用于处理工序与机器不可用时段的相对位置。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="参数L">
  <data key="d0">参数L</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">一个上界参数，为最大加工时间与不可用时间之和的上界。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="参数p_{ijk}">
  <data key="d0">参数p_{ijk}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工件i的第j道工序在机器k上的加工时间参数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785253367</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="参数su_{kr}">
  <data key="d0">参数su_{kr}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器k上第r个不可用时段的开始时间参数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
