<node id="Genetic Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Genetic Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">遗传算法，来自先前工作[7]，用于与DFA进行性能比较，使用C++编写。&lt;SEP&gt;遗传算法，在参考文献82中提出了两种新的鲁棒遗传算法用于解决流水车间调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;遗传算法，模拟自然选择过程的元启发式方法，广泛应用于调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;遗传算法是一种模拟自然进化过程的优化算法，广泛应用于调度问题求解。&lt;SEP&gt;一种基于自然选择和遗传学机制的优化算法，在调度研究中被广泛引用或使用。&lt;SEP&gt;一种智能优化算法，Dai等将其应用于生产调度问题，Gao等将其与禁忌搜索结合形成混合算法。&lt;SEP&gt;遗传算法，一种基于自然选择和遗传机制的进化算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
