  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">β步中使用的操作机制，通过在OS字符串中执行成对交换操作，使当前解向最优解靠拢。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d9df397d18c928b6ad43dd34f3f76716-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model and a Firefly Algorithm for an Extended Flexible Job Shop Problem with Availability Constraints-2289591f.pdf</data>
