<node id="Aggoune">
  <data key="d0">Aggoune</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Aggoune是首个在作业车间调度问题中考虑可用性约束的研究者，但未研究柔性作业车间情况，为后来的FJSSP-nfa研究提供了基础。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gao et al.">
  <data key="d0">Gao et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Gao等人于2006年首次引入了带有非固定可用性的柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSSP-nfa)，并提出混合遗传算法进行求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wang and Yu">
  <data key="d0">Wang and Yu</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Wang和Yu于2010年进一步探索了FJSSP-nfa，考虑了受限维护资源，并提出过滤波束搜索启发式算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rajkumar et al.">
  <data key="d0">Rajkumar et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Rajkumar等人于2011年使用贪婪随机自适应搜索过程算法求解FJSSP-nfa，并与文献进行比较。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Li and Pan (2012)">
  <data key="d0">Li and Pan (2012)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Li and Pan (2012)提出化学反应优化算法求解FJSSP-nfa，同时考虑多预防性维护任务，以最小化完工时间、总工作负载和最大工作负载。&lt;SEP&gt;Li和Pan于2012年发表的论文，研究了带机器维护的柔性作业车间调度问题，提出了离散化学反应优化算法以最小化最大完工时间、总负荷及关键机器负荷。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Li et al. (2014)">
  <data key="d0">Li et al. (2014)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Li et al. (2014)提出离散人工蜂群算法求解FJSSP-nfa，同样考虑多预防性维护和多目标优化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
