  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大工作负载">
  <data key="d0">最大工作负载</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">调度优化目标之一，指所有机器中的最大工作负载，在多目标FJSSP-nfa优化中被考虑。&lt;SEP&gt;工厂中机器的最大工作负载，作为调度问题的优化目标之一&lt;SEP&gt;机器或工人在生产过程中承受的最大负荷，用于平衡资源利用率和防止过载。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IFAC PapersOnLine">
  <data key="d0">IFAC PapersOnLine</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">国际自动控制联合会的在线会议论文期刊，本文发表于此期刊的2023年第56卷第2期，页码5388-5393。&lt;SEP&gt;该研究论文发表的学术期刊，卷期信息为56-2 (2023) 5388–5393。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Aggoune (2004)">
  <data key="d0">Aggoune (2004)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Aggoune (2004)首次在作业车间调度问题中考虑了可用性约束，但未研究柔性作业车间情况，为后来的FJSSP-nfa研究提供了基础。&lt;SEP&gt;该论文研究了具有机器可用性约束的流水车间调度问题，目标为最小化最大完工时间，考虑了维护开始时间固定或灵活两种情形，并应用基于GA和TS的算法求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gao et al. (2006)">
  <data key="d0">Gao et al. (2006)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Gao et al. (2006)首次引入了带有非固定可用性约束的柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSSP-nfa)，并提出混合遗传算法进行求解。&lt;SEP&gt;一篇2006年的研究论文，作者为Gao等人，采用了混合遗传算法求解柔性作业车间调度问题，本文与其进行了性能比较。&lt;SEP&gt;一篇引用的研究文献，提出了某种调度方法。&lt;SEP&gt;一项2006年的研究工作，隐式假设拥有充足的维修资源来处理维修活动。&lt;SEP&gt;Gao等人于2006年发表的关于柔性作业车间调度问题的研究文献，作为比较基准。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wang and Yu (2010)">
  <data key="d0">Wang and Yu (2010)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Wang and Yu (2010)进一步探索了FJSSP-nfa，考虑了受限维护资源，并提出过滤波束搜索启发式算法。&lt;SEP&gt;该研究提出了一种基于过滤束搜索的启发式算法，用于求解具有机器可用性约束的柔性作业车间调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;Wang和Yu于2010年发表的论文，研究了考虑机器维护的柔性作业车间调度问题，目标为最小化最大完工时间、机器总负荷及最繁忙机器负荷。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rajkumar et al. (2011)">
  <data key="d0">Rajkumar et al. (2011)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Rajkumar et al. (2011)使用贪婪随机自适应搜索过程算法求解FJSSP-nfa，并与文献结果进行了比较。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ziaee (2014)">
  <data key="d0">Ziaee (2014)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Ziaee (2014)设计了一种基于构造过程的启发式算法，用于快速产生考虑维护约束的FJSSP-nfa问题的良好解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="El Khoukhi et al. (2017)">
  <data key="d0">El Khoukhi et al. (2017)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">El Khoukhi et al. (2017)考虑了固定间隔的机器不可用时间段，使用双重蚁群算法求解FJSSP-nfa。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Jing et al. (2017)">
  <data key="d0">Jing et al. (2017)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Jing et al. (2017)研究了基于概率的预防性维护FJSSP-nfa变体，即当机器故障概率达到特定阈值时执行预防性维护，并使用多目标遗传算法求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job-Shop Scheduling Problem">
  <data key="d0">Job-Shop Scheduling Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业车间调度问题，Aggoune (2004)首次在其中考虑了可用性约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling Problem">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题，是FJSSP-nfa的基础问题。&lt;SEP&gt;一种灵活的作业车间调度问题，允许作业在多台机器上选择加工路径。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Classical FJSSP Benchmarks">
  <data key="d0">Classical FJSSP Benchmarks</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">现有文献中广泛使用的柔性作业车间调度问题标准测试实例集，本文据此生成了新的基准实例。&lt;SEP&gt;经典的柔性作业车间调度基准实例集，被用于生成FJSSP-nfa的小型和大规模基准。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000</data>
