<node id="Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem (FJSSP)">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem (FJSSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种作业车间调度问题的泛化，允许工序在限定的机器集合上调度，首次由Brucker和Schlie在1990年提出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Purpose Machine">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Purpose Machine</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">实际工业应用中的多功能机器，允许工序在受限的机器集合上调度，是柔性作业车间调度问题建模的核心特性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assignment Sub-Problem">
  <data key="d0">Assignment Sub-Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题的子问题之一，负责将每一道工序分配至一台符合条件的机器上。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Scheduling Sub-Problem">
  <data key="d0">Scheduling Sub-Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题的子问题之一，负责在选定的机器上对工序进行排序，以优化目标值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NP-hard">
  <data key="d0">NP-hard</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">计算复杂性类，表示问题至少与NP中最难的问题同等困难；柔性作业车间调度问题及作业车间调度问题均属NP-hard。&lt;SEP&gt;计算复杂性理论中的概念，表示在最坏情况下难以在多项式时间内求解的问题。&lt;SEP&gt;計算複雜度類別，表明生產排程等問題在最壞情況下難以在多項式時間內找到最優解。&lt;SEP&gt;NP难问题，一类计算复杂性问题，DHFJS被归类为此。&lt;SEP&gt;非确定性多项式难度，表示该计算问题在多项式时间内无法求解最优解</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Objective Value">
  <data key="d0">Objective Value</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优化目标的值，在调度子问题中需要通过排序操作来优化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
