</node>
<node id="Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种制造调度问题，涉及在机器上分配作业，其中机器具有灵活性，本文考虑的是带可用性约束的变体。&lt;SEP&gt;柔性作业车间调度问题，在参考文献62和64中被灰狼优化和化学反应优化算法解决。&lt;SEP&gt;传统的柔性作业车间调度问题，是DFJSP的基础。&lt;SEP&gt;柔性作业车间调度问题是制造业中的关键调度问题，涉及工件在机器上的分配和排序，具有多种变体，如分布式、带运输资源等。&lt;SEP&gt;柔性作业车间调度问题，一种复杂的生产调度问题，涉及多台机器和多种工艺路线，是经典作业车间调度的扩展。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Availability Constraints">
  <data key="d0">Availability Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由于机器维护任务而导致的机器不可用限制，是柔性作业车间调度问题的一个扩展约束。&lt;SEP&gt;机器可用性约束，指机器因维护等活动而不可用的时间段，影响调度决策。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maintenance Tasks">
  <data key="d0">Maintenance Tasks</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">导致机器不可用并引入可用性约束的维护活动。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Meta-heuristic Methods">
  <data key="d0">Meta-heuristic Methods</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">前期研究中用于求解带可用性约束的柔性作业车间调度问题的启发式算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mixed Integer Model">
  <data key="d0">Mixed Integer Model</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文开发的用于高效求解带可用性约束的柔性作业车间调度问题的数学规划模型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="New Benchmark">
  <data key="d0">New Benchmark</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">基于经典FJSSP基准问题生成的新实例集，包含超过2000个实例，用于测试求解方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Computational Study">
  <data key="d0">Computational Study</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">在提出的新基准上对混合整数模型进行的计算实验和分析。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
