</node>
<node id="A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints">
  <data key="d0">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇研究论文，提出了一个混合整数模型来解决带可用性约束的柔性作业车间调度问题，并介绍了一个新的基准实例集。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-280a2bbe5a4ddcb1cceaa7130f5769df-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A Mathematical Model for the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem With Availability Constraints-e4585d89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785254417</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Permutation Flowshop Scheduling Problem (PFSP)">
  <data key="d0">Permutation Flowshop Scheduling Problem (PFSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种生产调度问题，目标是确定作业在机器上的最优加工顺序以最小化完工时间。&lt;SEP&gt;一種廣泛研究的生產排程問題，要求所有工件以相同的順序在機器上加工，在文獻和實際製造中有廣泛應用。&lt;SEP&gt;置换流水车间调度问题，本文研究的集成调度问题是其一种变体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Predictive Maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Predictive Maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">基于设备实际状况的智能维护策略，通过预测剩余使用寿命来安排维护。&lt;SEP&gt;一種基於設備退化資訊預測維護需求的維護策略，旨在透過預測剩餘使用壽命來安排維護活動。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Joint Optimization of Production and Maintenance Scheduling">
  <data key="d0">Joint Optimization of Production and Maintenance Scheduling</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">同時最佳化生產排程與維護排程以提升整體成效的整合方法，近年來受到廣泛研究關注。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PHM (Prognostics and Health Management)">
  <data key="d0">PHM (Prognostics and Health Management)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">預測與健康管理，提供設備退化資訊以支援預測性維護決策的一套方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mixed Integer Linear Model (MILP)">
  <data key="d0">Mixed Integer Linear Model (MILP)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一種用於解決PFSP與預測性維護整合排程問題的精確數學規劃方法，能夠最佳化最小化完工時間與維護延遲的總和，但僅適用於小規模問題。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local Search Method">
  <data key="d0">Local Search Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一種用於解決大規模PFSP與預測性維護問題的啟發式方法，被證明比MILP更具擴展性和有效性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Genetic Algorithm (GA)">
  <data key="d0">Genetic Algorithm (GA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一種演化式演算法，用於解決PFSP與預測性維護問題，透過模擬自然選擇機制來搜尋最佳排程方案。&lt;SEP&gt;遗传算法，一种基于自然选择和遗传机制的启发式优化方法，在本综述文献中广泛用于求解调度与维护集成问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fuzzy Logic">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy Logic</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一種處理PHM資訊不確定性的方法，用於解決PFSP與預測性維護問題，透過模糊邏輯建模不確定的PHM輸出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Machine Learning Algorithms">
  <data key="d0">Machine Learning Algorithms</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用於處理感測器數據並預測剩餘使用壽命(RUL)的演算法，從而支援預測性維護的排程決策。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sensor Data">
  <data key="d0">Sensor Data</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">從機器設備收集的即時監測數據，用於透過機器學習演算法預測剩餘使用壽命。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Remaining Useful Life (RUL)">
  <data key="d0">Remaining Useful Life (RUL)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">设备在故障发生前可以继续运行的时间估计。&lt;SEP&gt;預測的設備剩餘使用壽命，為預測性維護提供關鍵資訊以安排維護時機。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Discrete Event Simulation">
  <data key="d0">Discrete Event Simulation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一種模擬方法，用於整合預測性維護約束至生產排程過程中，以最小化完工時間。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metaheuristic">
  <data key="d0">Metaheuristic</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一類啟發式演算法，透過模仿自然現象來解決大規模最佳化問題，在求解NP-hard排程問題上表現有效。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Artificial Bee Colony (ABC) Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Artificial Bee Colony (ABC) Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一種群體智慧演算法，最初於2005年提出用於連續最佳化問題，後被擴展至約束最佳化問題，並被應用於不同版本的PFSP問題中。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Swarm Intelligence Algorithms">
  <data key="d0">Swarm Intelligence Algorithms</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">模仿動物群體活動的一類演算法，如粒子群最佳化、蟻群最佳化等，屬於元啟發式演算法的一種。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Evolutionary Algorithms">
  <data key="d0">Evolutionary Algorithms</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">模仿人類或動物演化行為的元啟發式演算法，如遺傳演算法、生物地理最佳化等。&lt;SEP&gt;进化算法是一类基于种群优化的随机搜索方法，具有并行计算和搜索能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Production Scheduling">
  <data key="d0">Production Scheduling</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">将生产作业分配给机器并排序以优化一个或多个目标的过程。&lt;SEP&gt;製造業中的關鍵決策過程，涉及將工作任務分配給機器並安排時間，被證明為NP-hard問題。&lt;SEP&gt;在制造业中，为作业分配机器资源和时间，以优化性能指标的过程&lt;SEP&gt;生产计划与调度领域，涉及制造过程中的资源分配和任务安排。&lt;SEP&gt;生产调度问题，自Jackson等引入科学方法后逐渐标准化和理论化，研究包括传统启发式策略和新兴智能优化方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Particle Swarm Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Particle Swarm Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一種群體智慧演算法，透過模擬鳥群或魚群的社會行為來搜尋最佳解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ant Colony Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Ant Colony Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一種群體智慧演算法，模擬螞蟻覓食行為以解決組合最佳化問題。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Conventional Preventive Maintenance (PM)">
  <data key="d0">Conventional Preventive Maintenance (PM)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一種傳統的維護策略，通常基於固定時間間隔或使用次數進行預防性維護，不考慮設備即時的退化狀態，與預測性維護形成對比。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexible Unavailability Periods">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Unavailability Periods</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在流程型排程問題中，因預測性維護活動而導致的機器不可用時段，這些時段根據設備退化狀態靈活安排，而非固定不變。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nominal and Sub-nominal Production Modes">
  <data key="d0">Nominal and Sub-nominal Production Modes</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">機器在生產過程中的兩種運作模式：名義模式(正常速度)和次名義模式(降低速度以避免早期失效)，後者會延長工件處理時間但增加設備剩餘使用壽命，用於MILP方法中的排程決策。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ABC算法">
  <data key="d0">ABC算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于蜂群智能的元启发式算法，用于解决调度问题，包含雇佣蜂、跟随蜂、侦察蜂三种人工蜂类别和探索与开发机制，仅使用三个控制参数。&lt;SEP&gt;一种优化算法，用于解决生产调度问题，包含雇佣蜂、观察蜂和侦察蜂阶段。&lt;SEP&gt;一种模拟蜜蜂采蜜行为的群体智能优化算法，用于解决优化问题，包含雇佣蜂、旁观蜂和侦查蜂等角色。&lt;SEP&gt;人工蜂群算法，提出用于解决集成调度问题的元启发式方法&lt;SEP&gt;一种人工蜂群算法，用于生产作业与维护的协调调度，旨在优化生产完工时间和维护ET。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="VNS算法">
  <data key="d0">VNS算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">变邻域搜索算法，来自文献[44]的对比方法，用于解决相同的集成调度问题</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="集成调度问题">
  <data key="d0">集成调度问题</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指将生产作业排序与柔性维护活动同时考虑的联合调度问题，针对排列流水车间环境。&lt;SEP&gt;生产作业与预测性维护的协调调度问题，包含两种维护模式</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="维护模式1">
  <data key="d0">维护模式1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">集成调度问题的一种维护模式，用于评估算法性能&lt;SEP&gt;一种维护场景，在此模式下VNS在维护平均ET最小化上优于ABC。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="维护模式2">
  <data key="d0">维护模式2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">集成调度问题的另一种维护模式，用于评估算法性能&lt;SEP&gt;另一种维护场景，此模式下C_max偏差增加，但维护平均ET保持稳定。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RPD">
  <data key="d0">RPD</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">相对百分比偏差（Relative Percentage Deviation，简称RPD）是评估算法性能与解质量的常用指标，主要用于衡量算法所生成的解与已知最优解或理论下界之间的相对差距。该指标通过量化当前解相对于最佳参考值的偏离程度，来反映算法的优化能力。在调度优化与人工蜂群算法（Artificial Bee Colony，ABC）等研究场景中，RPD常被用来比较所得Makespan与理论下界（LB）的偏差，数值越小说明算法解越接近最优水平，性能越好。其标准计算公式为：RPD = (Alg_sol − Best_sol) / Best_sol × 100%，其中Alg_sol表示当前算法获得的解，Best_sol为已知最优解或下界值。实际应用中，诸如ABC算法在多数测试实例上取得了平均约2.56%的RPD，体现出较强的求解质量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844658</data>
