</node>
<node id="退化阈值Δ">
  <data key="d0">退化阈值Δ</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器完全退化的临界值，设为100%，当累积退化量达到该值时需安排维护。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="预测性维护干预">
  <data key="d0">预测性维护干预</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">在机器退化达到阈值时安排的维护操作，可插入到当前作业之前或之后以优化最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器M_1">
  <data key="d0">机器M_1</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">流水车间中的第一台机器，在示例中用于加工作业序列并累积退化。&lt;SEP&gt;示例问题实例中的一台机器，计划加工操作O_{5,1}，需要准备时间TR_{5,1,1}^{setup}。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业J_1">
  <data key="d0">作业J_1</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">生产序列中的第一个作业，在机器M_1上加工，产生退化值δ_11。&lt;SEP&gt;示例问题实例中的一个作业，是作业J_5的前置作业，其最后操作为O_{1,3}。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业J_3">
  <data key="d0">作业J_3</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">生产序列中的第三个作业，在机器M_1上加工，产生退化值δ_13。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业J_8">
  <data key="d0">作业J_8</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">生产序列中的第八个作业，在机器M_1上加工，产生退化值δ_18。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业J_5">
  <data key="d0">作业J_5</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">生产序列中的第五个作业，在机器M_1上加工时导致累积退化量超过阈值，触发维护决策。&lt;SEP&gt;示例问题实例中的一个作业，其前置作业为J_1和J_2，第一个操作为O_{5,1}。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="搜索过程">
  <data key="d0">搜索过程</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">人工蜂群算法中的迭代搜索过程，包括雇佣蜂、跟随蜂和侦察蜂三个阶段。&lt;SEP&gt;多目标进化算法与评估方法相互交互的迭代过程，用于寻找有利个体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="雇佣蜂阶段">
  <data key="d0">雇佣蜂阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法中雇佣蜂执行邻域搜索的阶段。&lt;SEP&gt;搜索过程中的一个阶段，雇佣蜂负责开采食物源并分享信息。&lt;SEP&gt;ABC算法中的一个阶段，负责搜索过程的探索，在解未改进时增加试验计数，其行为在观察蜂阶段中被提及作为相似参考。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="跟随蜂阶段">
  <data key="d0">跟随蜂阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法中跟随蜂基于概率选择食物源并进行搜索的阶段。&lt;SEP&gt;搜索过程中的一个阶段，跟随蜂根据雇佣蜂的信息选择食物源。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="侦察蜂阶段">
  <data key="d0">侦察蜂阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法中侦察蜂抛弃未改善食物源并随机生成新解的阶段。&lt;SEP&gt;搜索过程中的一个阶段，侦察蜂随机搜索新的食物源。&lt;SEP&gt;ABC算法中的最后一个阶段，侦察蜂抛弃那些超过允许最大阈值的食物源并生成随机新解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="流水车间">
  <data key="d0">流水车间</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">生产环境，包含多台机器，作业按顺序经过各机器加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="置换流水车间调度问题(PFSP)">
  <data key="d0">置换流水车间调度问题(PFSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种生产调度问题，其中作业按排列顺序在一系列机器上处理，以最小化最大完工时间为常见优化目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="蜂群智能">
  <data key="d0">蜂群智能</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">蜂群通过采集环境信息并自适应调整行为，从而高效搜索解空间的群体智能原理。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="探索与开发">
  <data key="d0">探索与开发</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优化算法中探索新解区域和开发已有优质解区域的两个关键机制，ABC算法内在地平衡两者。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NEH启发式方法">
  <data key="d0">NEH启发式方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于解决置换流水车间调度问题、以最小化最大完工时间为目标的著名构造性启发式方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="改进的NEH启发式方法">
  <data key="d0">改进的NEH启发式方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">对NEH启发式方法的变体，同样表现出良好性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="雇佣蜂">
  <data key="d0">雇佣蜂</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法中负责停留在食物源并检查其邻域的人工蜂类别。&lt;SEP&gt;与观察蜂共享食物源信息的智能体，其信息用于指导观察蜂的选择。&lt;SEP&gt;ABC算法中负责在食物源附近搜索的蜜蜂角色，其数量等于食物源数量SN。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="跟随蜂">
  <data key="d0">跟随蜂</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法中根据雇佣蜂提供的信息分配到食物源的人工蜂类别。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="侦察蜂">
  <data key="d0">侦察蜂</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法中当食物源在指定周期内未改善时，用新随机食物源替换旧食物源的人工蜂类别。&lt;SEP&gt;在侦察蜂阶段负责抛弃试验次数超过阈值的食物源并生成新随机解的智能体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="食物源">
  <data key="d0">食物源</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在ABC算法中代表搜索空间内的候选解，其花蜜量对应解的适应度值。&lt;SEP&gt;代表问题的一个解，包含作业序列和相应的调度方案，具有适应度值。&lt;SEP&gt;ABC算法中表示候选解的实体，其数量由参数SN控制。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="初始化过程">
  <data key="d0">初始化过程</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法中生成初始种群的两步过程，包括生成生产序列的NEH启发式和随机方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大完工时间(Makespan)">
  <data key="d0">最大完工时间(Makespan)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">调度问题中完成所有作业的总完成时间，是本研究的优化目标函数。&lt;SEP&gt;生产调度中的一个优化目标，表示完成所有作业所需的最短时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="种群大小(SN)">
  <data key="d0">种群大小(SN)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法的一个控制参数，表示种群规模(食物源数量)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大循环次数(MCN)">
  <data key="d0">最大循环次数(MCN)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法的一个控制参数兼停止准则，规定算法的最大循环次数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="放弃解的最大迭代次数(limit)">
  <data key="d0">放弃解的最大迭代次数(limit)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法的一个控制参数，规定食物源在多少次迭代未改善后被抛弃。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大未改善迭代次数(max_improv)">
  <data key="d0">最大未改善迭代次数(max_improv)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法的一个停止准则，规定最优解在多少次迭代未改善后算法终止。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="集成生产与柔性维护调度问题">
  <data key="d0">集成生产与柔性维护调度问题</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">结合了生产作业排序和机器维护操作规划的综合调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="两域结构">
  <data key="d0">两域结构</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于表示集成调度问题候选解的二维结构，包含一个表示生产作业序列的排列和一个表示各机器上维护操作位置的二进制矩阵。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="置换流水车间">
  <data key="d0">置换流水车间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种特定的制造布局，其中一组生产作业按照预定顺序依次通过一系列机器，且不允许改变作业在机器间的顺序，即只允许置换调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="生产作业">
  <data key="d0">生产作业</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在置换流水车间中需要加工的任务，总数记为n，所有作业在零时刻可用，不允许抢占，每个作业在各机器上的处理时间已知。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="预测性维护活动">
  <data key="d0">预测性维护活动</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">基于PHM输出安排的维护干预，导致机器不可用时段。维护活动时间间隔和次数是决策变量，适应生产调度以最小化总完成时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="退化值">
  <data key="d0">退化值</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">当机器加工作业时，机器所承受的退化度量值，与加工时间及剩余使用寿命相关，范围在0到100%之间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="剩余使用寿命">
  <data key="d0">剩余使用寿命</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">由PHM过程提供的机器剩余可用寿命指标，用于计算退化值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="累计退化">
  <data key="d0">累计退化</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器已加工作业的退化值累计之和，当达到最大阈值100%时，必须执行维护干预。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="整合调度计划">
  <data key="d0">整合调度计划</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">包括n个作业和每台机器上至少一个柔性维护活动的综合序列，表现为生产块和预测性维护操作的交替。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PHM过程">
  <data key="d0">PHM过程</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">提供机器剩余使用寿命预测的预后与健康管理过程。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="柔性维护">
  <data key="d0">柔性维护</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种维护规划策略，允许维护时间间隔和次数可变，以最小化对生产调度的干扰。&lt;SEP&gt;一种非计划性的、灵活的维护策略，维护间隔和次数不固定，本文将其集成到调度模型中。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="生产块">
  <data key="d0">生产块</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">整合调度计划中，机器上一段连续加工的作业子集，在生产块之间安排有预测性维护操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大退化阈值">
  <data key="d0">最大退化阈值</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">设定的累计退化上限，值为100%，当机器累计退化达到此阈值时，必须执行维护干预。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops">
  <data key="d0">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇提出使用人工蜂群算法解决置换流水车间中生产调度与柔性维护协调问题的学术论文。&lt;SEP&gt;一篇研究论文，提出了一种人工蜂群算法，用于协调调度排列流水车间中的生产作业和柔性维护，以最小化完工时间，并与变邻域搜索方法进行了比较。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
