  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm (ABC)">
  <data key="d0">Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm (ABC)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于蜜蜂群体智能行为的元启发式算法，用于解决优化问题。&lt;SEP&gt;一种模拟蜜蜂采蜜行为的群体智能算法，本文针对置换流水车间调度问题设计，通过平衡搜索的勘探与开发来最小化总完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexible Maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种允许维护干预间隔灵活可变的维护策略。&lt;SEP&gt;一种维护概念，允许在指定的时间窗口内灵活安排维护活动，在多个参考文献中被提及&lt;SEP&gt;灵活维护，维护活动的开始时间可在一定范围内灵活安排的维护策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integrated Scheduling of Production and Maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Integrated Scheduling of Production and Maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">同时考虑生产调度和维护计划的集成调度方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Preventive Maintenance (PM)">
  <data key="d0">Preventive Maintenance (PM)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">为防止机器故障而计划性的维护活动。&lt;SEP&gt;预防性维护，指在机器发生故障前进行的维护活动，以确保生产连续性和降低故障风险。&lt;SEP&gt;基于计划的维护活动，在OM层次中以值0编码表示，在操作后执行。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Prognostics and Health Management (PHM)">
  <data key="d0">Prognostics and Health Management (PHM)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">通过分析设备健康状态来预测故障并制定维护决策的过程。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Post-Prognostic Decision (PPD)">
  <data key="d0">Post-Prognostic Decision (PPD)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">基于预测信息进行决策的过程，如集成预测维护计划和生产调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Makespan (Cmax)">
  <data key="d0">Makespan (Cmax)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">所有作业完成加工所需的总时间，是调度问题中的常见优化目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deterministic Scheduling with Unavailability Intervals">
  <data key="d0">Deterministic Scheduling with Unavailability Intervals</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">考虑机器因计划性维护等确定性原因存在不可用区间的调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Interrelated Model">
  <data key="d0">Interrelated Model</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">将维护视为约束而非决策的建模方式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Integrated Model">
  <data key="d0">Integrated Model</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">同时考虑生产调度和维护决策的建模方式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Machine Scheduling Problems in Production (MSPP)">
  <data key="d0">Machine Scheduling Problems in Production (MSPP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">生产中的机器调度问题，旨在优化作业顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Metaheuristic Algorithms">
  <data key="d0">Metaheuristic Algorithms</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">用于解决复杂优化问题的高级启发式方法。&lt;SEP&gt;元启发式算法，包括灰狼优化、粒子群优化和遗传算法等，常用于解决NP难问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Combinatorial Optimization">
