<node id="Artificial Bee Colony (ABC)算法">
  <data key="d0">Artificial Bee Colony (ABC)算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于蜂群智能的元启发式算法，本文提出用于求解排列流水车间中生产作业与柔性维护的集成调度问题，以最小化完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
