</node>
<node id="观察蜂阶段">
  <data key="d0">观察蜂阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">ABC算法中的一个阶段，负责搜索过程的开发，通过观察蜂选择有前景的食物源并进行局部搜索。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="观察蜂">
  <data key="d0">观察蜂</data>
  <data key="d1">creature</data>
  <data key="d2">在观察蜂阶段根据雇佣蜂共享的信息选择食物源，并通过局部搜索生成新解的智能体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="适应度">
  <data key="d0">适应度</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">评估食物源质量的指标，定义为最大完工时间的倒数，即1/C_max。&lt;SEP&gt;衡量个体或种群解质量的数值，包括个体最佳适应度与种群平均适应度。&lt;SEP&gt;适应度是解质量的度量，具体为解所获得的最大完工时间；适应度越小越好。&lt;SEP&gt;衡量个体优劣的数值，定义为1/C_max，值越大表示调度方案越好。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="选择概率">
  <data key="d0">选择概率</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在轮盘赌选择中，每个食物源被选中的概率，与其适应度成比例。&lt;SEP&gt;根据局部密度计算的用于选择子区域进行强化的概率值&lt;SEP&gt;进化过程中为不同解分配的概率，用于控制操作算子的应用频率。&lt;SEP&gt;WOA算法中的参数，为[0,1]区间的随机数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="局部搜索方法">
  <data key="d0">局部搜索方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种改进解的算法，通过移除和重新插入作业来优化序列，基于构造/破坏机制和NEH启发式。&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于在解空间进行精细化搜索的方法，在高维多目标模因算法中与改进的NSGA-III结合使用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
