<node id="A review and classification of heuristics for permutation flow-shop scheduling with makespan objective">
  <data key="d0">A review and classification of heuristics for permutation flow-shop scheduling with makespan objective</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">发表于《J. Oper. Res. Soc.》2004年卷55第1243-1255页的一篇综述论文，对以最大完工时间为目标的置换流水车间调度启发式方法进行了回顾和分类。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-014</data>
