  <data key="d0">Multi-objective permutation flow shop scheduling problem: Literature review, classification and current trends</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">发表于《Omega》2014年卷45第119-135页的一篇综述论文，对多目标置换流水车间调度问题进行了文献回顾、分类和当前趋势分析。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
