  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A new vision of approximate methods for the permutation flowshop to minimise makespan: State-of-the-art and computational evaluation">
  <data key="d0">A new vision of approximate methods for the permutation flowshop to minimise makespan: State-of-the-art and computational evaluation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">发表于《Eur. J. Oper. Res.》2017年卷257第707-721页的一篇论文，提出了关于置换流水车间最小化最大完工时间的近似方法的新视角，包括最新技术和计算评估。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
