  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Scheduling flowshops with condition-based maintenance constraint to minimize expected makespan">
  <data key="d0">Scheduling flowshops with condition-based maintenance constraint to minimize expected makespan</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">发表于《Int. J. Adv. Manuf. Technol.》2010年卷46第757-767页的一篇论文，研究了在基于条件的维护约束下，以最小化期望最大完工时间为目标的流水车间调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A hybrid method for flowshops scheduling with condition-based maintenance constraint and machines breakdown">
  <data key="d0">A hybrid method for flowshops scheduling with condition-based maintenance constraint and machines breakdown</data>
