<node id="Employed Bees Phase">
  <data key="d0">Employed Bees Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">人工蜂群算法的第一个搜索步骤，雇用的蜜蜂在各自食物源的邻域内探索新的可能更好的解决方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Employed Bee">
  <data key="d0">Employed Bee</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">人工蜂群算法中的一种蜜蜂类型，每个雇佣蜂与种群中的一个食物源相关联，负责在食物源邻域搜索新解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785255634</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
