  <data key="d0">Double-Insertion Based Neighborhood</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种邻域结构，对生产序列连续执行两次插入操作以生成新解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-2b3dfd7b5cbfa2a90ef71347e70c15cc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm for Coordinated Scheduling of Production Jobs and Flexible Maintenance in Permutation Flowshops-1bbea6e8.pdf</data>
