<node id="Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering">
  <data key="d0">Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">《Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering》是一本国际性学术期刊，主要聚焦于计算机技术与工业工程交叉领域的研究，发表内容涵盖工业工程及计算机应用方面的前沿成果。该刊曾在2010年第59卷第436页至447页上刊登了一篇由S. Wang与J. Yu撰写的论文，该研究围绕柔性作业车间调度问题中的维护活动展开，从算法层面进行了深入探讨。这一特定期次的发表记录，连同该刊的整体定位，凸显了其在推动计算机与工业工程融合发展、传播先进调度优化及智能制造方法方面的重要学术角色。&lt;SEP&gt;一个关注计算机与工业工程领域的国际期刊。&lt;SEP&gt;一本计算机与工业工程领域的学术期刊。&lt;SEP&gt;一本专注于计算机与工业工程领域的学术期刊。&lt;SEP&gt;《Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering》是一本学术期刊，发表了多篇关于作业车间调度的研究论文，包括2013年Y. Yuan和H. Xu的论文以及2020年Z. Zhu和X. Zhou的论文。&lt;SEP&gt;一本计算机与工业工程领域的学术期刊。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-035&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-045</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities">
  <data key="d0">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出的研究论文，发表于Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering期刊，提出了一种基于过滤束搜索的启发式算法用于求解带有维护活动的柔性作业车间调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;一篇学术论文，由Wang, S. 和Yu, J. 于2010年发表，提出带有维护活动的柔性作业车间调度问题的有效启发式方法，刊登在Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering期刊。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="C-4">
  <data key="d0">C-4</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
