<node id="充足维护资源">
  <data key="d0">充足维护资源</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">维护资源充足，允许多台机器同时进行维护的情形。&lt;SEP&gt;维护任务执行时资源不受限制的条件，可同时进行多项维护活动。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="表5">
  <data key="d0">表5</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">提供维护任务时间窗信息的表格，包括开始时间和持续时间。&lt;SEP&gt;一张表格，报告了各算法基于Hypervolume指标的Friedman检验的平均排名值和最终排名。&lt;SEP&gt;记录HDVMA和HDVMA-NIS在15个基准实例上的HV、IGD和Spread平均指标值的表格。&lt;SEP&gt;展示HSDE和CPLEX在实例1-20上的适应度值和计算时间的比较结果表格。&lt;SEP&gt;展示了正交表L16设计下的16组参数组合及对应的响应值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="图8">
  <data key="d0">图8</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">图8这一编号在不同的文献或章节语境下对应了多个内容各异的图形，具体包括：非固定可用性约束及充足维护资源下调度结果的甘特图，其目标值为F1=9、F2=60、F3=8；用于比较不同算法性能分布的C指标箱线图；RL切换机制的一个示例图；六个代表性基准测试（DFInstance01、DFInstance03、DFInstance05、DFMK02、DFMK05、DFMK08）上各算法生成的非支配解集图；具有最小完工时间的解S1的甘特图，横轴为加工时间，纵轴为各工厂机器，展示了最小Makespan调度方案；六种算法在实例21-40上的目标值与计算时间变化的对比图；以及可能与解码过程或其它组件相关的REC示意图。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854172</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="表6">
  <data key="d0">表6</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">将本文调度结果与Gao等人(2006)结果进行比较的表格。&lt;SEP&gt;一张表格，报告了MOEA-EM与竞争对手在Hypervolume指标上的Wilcoxon符号秩检验结果。&lt;SEP&gt;展示HSDE、DE、SDE、GA、PSO和SA在实例21-40上的运行时间和适应度值的比较结果表格。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-031&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
