<node id="Wang和Yu (2010)">
  <data key="d0">Wang和Yu (2010)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Wang和Yu于2010年在《Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering》上发表的论文，提出了一种基于过滤束搜索的启发式算法，用于求解带维护活动的柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="单一维护资源">
  <data key="d0">单一维护资源</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由于资源限制，任意时刻只能有一台机器进行维护的情形。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
