  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">由P. Brandimarte于1993年发表在《Annals of Operations Research》上的文章，研究基于禁忌搜索的柔性作业车间路径与调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;使用禁忌搜索解决柔性作业车间中的路径规划与调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;一篇关于使用禁忌搜索解决柔性作业车间路径选择与调度的研究论文，由Brandimarte, P.撰写，发表于《Ann. Oper. Res.》，1993年，第41卷，第157–183页。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-033&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
