  <data key="d2">作业1的第五个操作，可在机器1或机器4上加工，加工时间均为55，开始时间为203，前置操作为1-4，无后置操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作2-1">
  <data key="d0">操作2-1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业2的第一个操作，仅可在机器4上加工，加工时间为52，开始时间为0，无前置操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作2-2">
  <data key="d0">操作2-2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">属于工件2的工序，是操作2-3的前驱工序，在本段文本中未提供其他详细信息。&lt;SEP&gt;作业2的第二个操作，可在机器2、机器4或机器5上加工，加工时间均为16，开始时间为52，前置操作为2-1，无后置操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maintenance Activity">
  <data key="d0">Maintenance Activity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">对机器进行预防性维护的任务，具有预定义的时间窗口和持续时间，必须在调度方案中合理安排。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Regular Production Operation">
  <data key="d0">Regular Production Operation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">正常的生产工序，需要分配机器和确定加工开始时间，是调度的基本单元。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MNew_NON Procedure">
  <data key="d0">MNew_NON Procedure</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">FBS算法中的节点生成过程，根据操作类型(常规生产或维护活动)和可用维护资源数量，决定节点的分配与替换策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FBS Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">FBS Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于集束搜索的启发式算法，通过MNew_NON过程生成节点，并使用M_EET作为评价函数，求解带有维护活动的柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Modified Earliest Ending Time (M_EET)">
  <data key="d0">Modified Earliest Ending Time (M_EET)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种评价函数，优先选择结束时间最早的节点，用于FBS算法的局部和全局评价，并在平局时考虑机器负载均衡。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Branching Scheme">
  <data key="d0">Branching Scheme</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在MNew_NON过程中采用的分支策略，通过限制操作开始时间不晚于维护时间窗口上界来引导节点生成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Partial Schedule (PS)">
  <data key="d0">Partial Schedule (PS)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在FBS算法执行过程中逐步构建的部分调度方案，包含已分配的操作及其开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Beamwidth b">
  <data key="d0">Beamwidth b</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">FBS算法的输入参数，表示每一层保留的节点数量(集束宽度)，用于控制搜索广度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Filterwidth f">
  <data key="d0">Filterwidth f</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">FBS算法的输入参数，表示在局部评价时从生成节点中筛选出的较优节点数量(过滤宽度)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Time Window">
  <data key="d0">Time Window</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">为每个维护活动定义允许开始的时间区间，由下界(underline{S}_u^k)和上界(overline{S}_u^k)组成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fixed Machine Availability Constraint">
  <data key="d0">Fixed Machine Availability Constraint</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器在特定时间段不可用的硬约束，可通过设置维护时间窗口的上下界相等来建模。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Total Number of General Operations (N_0)">
  <data key="d0">Total Number of General Operations (N_0)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">FBS算法的输入参数，包括所有工件的工序总数和所有机器的维护活动总数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maintenance Resource">
  <data key="d0">Maintenance Resource</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">执行维护活动所需的人员或设备资源，其数量(特别是一个)直接影响MNew_NON过程的决策分支和步骤选择。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
