<node id="Minimizing The Makespan For The Mpm Job-Shop With Availability Constraints">
  <data key="d0">Minimizing The Makespan For The Mpm Job-Shop With Availability Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇由Zribi、Kamel和Borne于2008年发表的学术文章，刊载于《International Journal of Production Economics》第112卷第1期，页码151–160。该文研究了在具有可用性约束的MPM作业车间中最小化完工时间的问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
