</node>
<node id="Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling Problem (FJSP)">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling Problem (FJSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题，每道工序可在多台可选机器上加工，是生产调度与预防性维护集成研究的一个复杂环境。&lt;SEP&gt;柔性作业车间调度问题，是DFJSP的基础问题。&lt;SEP&gt;柔性作业车间调度问题，是集中式制造中的经典调度问题，涉及机器选择和工序排序两个子问题。&lt;SEP&gt;允许每个操作在可选的机器集合中选择一台进行加工，增加了复杂性，是经典JSP的扩展。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
