  <data key="d0">Allaoui and Artiba (2004)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究混合流水车间中具有可恢复和不可恢复作业及维护约束的调度问题，目标为基于流时间和交货期的准则，并考虑准备、清理和运输时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gao, Gen, and Sun (2006)">
  <data key="d0">Gao, Gen, and Sun (2006)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究具有机器可用性约束的柔性作业车间调度问题，不可用时段灵活且需在调度过程中确定，并提出混合遗传算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Zribi, Kamel, and Borne (2008)">
  <data key="d0">Zribi, Kamel, and Borne (2008)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究具有固定机器可用性约束的多用途机器作业车间调度问题，提出两阶段启发式方法，结合优先规则、禁忌搜索和遗传算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chan, Chung, Chan, Finke, and Tiwari (2006)">
  <data key="d0">Chan, Chung, Chan, Finke, and Tiwari (2006)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文考虑受机器维护约束的分布式柔性制造系统调度问题，维护时间与机器年龄相关，该问题也涵盖具有维护活动的柔性作业车间调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ma, Chu, and Zuo (2010)">
  <data key="d0">Ma, Chu, and Zuo (2010)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提供了关于具有可用性约束的单机和并行机调度问题的相对全面的综述。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chen and Liao (2005)">
  <data key="d0">Chen and Liao (2005)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究单机问题的确定性和概率性模型，考虑不同维护情景和可恢复作业，目标为最小化延误作业数，并应用于一家纺织公司。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cassady and Kutanoglu (2005)">
  <data key="d0">Cassady and Kutanoglu (2005)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文将2003年的集成模型扩展为基于总加权完工时间的相似模型，同时决定生产调度和预防性维护。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sortrakul, Nachtmann, and Cassady (2005)">
  <data key="d0">Sortrakul, Nachtmann, and Cassady (2005)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文针对Cassady and Kutanoglu (2005)的模型，提出了基于遗传算法的启发式方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ji, He, and Cheng (2007)">
  <data key="d0">Ji, He, and Cheng (2007)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文分析了LPT调度规则在具有不可恢复作业和定期维护的单机调度问题中的最坏情况比，目标为最小化最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chen (2008)">
  <data key="d0">Chen (2008)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了优化模型和一种启发式方法，用于具有不可恢复作业、灵活和定期维护的单机调度问题，目标为最小化最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chen (2009)">
  <data key="d0">Chen (2009)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了基于Moore算法和分支定界算法的启发式方法，用于具有定期维护和不可恢复作业的单机问题，目标为最小化延误作业数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lee and Chen (2000)">
  <data key="d0">Lee and Chen (2000)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文将Graves and Lee (1999)的工作扩展到并行机环境，考虑不可恢复作业，目标为最小化总加权完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gharbi and Haouari (2005)">
  <data key="d0">Gharbi and Haouari (2005)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究了具有可用性限制(释放时间和交货时间约束)的同型并行机调度问题，目标为最小化最大完工时间，并提出了精确的分支定界算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liao, Shyur, and Lin (2005)">
  <data key="d0">Liao, Shyur, and Lin (2005)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究了一台机器不可用的两台并行机问题，考虑不可恢复和可恢复两种情形，目标为最小化最大完工时间，采用基于TMO算法的改进方法求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lin and Liao (2007)">
  <data key="d0">Lin and Liao (2007)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文将Liao, Shyur, and Lin (2005)的问题扩展到每台机器都有固定不可用时段的情形。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lee and Yu (2008)">
  <data key="d0">Lee and Yu (2008)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文讨论了并行机调度问题，分别以最小化期望总加权完工时间和期望延误作业数为目标，研究了可恢复和不可恢复两种情形。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Liao and Sheen (2008)">
  <data key="d0">Liao and Sheen (2008)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文分析了具有机器可用性和资格约束的并行机调度问题，目标为最小化最大完工时间，将该问题转化为最大流问题并提出了二分搜索算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mellouli, Sadfi, Chu, and Kacem (2009)">
  <data key="d0">Mellouli, Sadfi, Chu, and Kacem (2009)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究了具有可用性约束的同型并行机调度问题，目标为总完工时间，提出了三种精确方法(混合整数线性规划、动态规划、分支定界)和基于SPT规则的启发式方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mauguiere et al. (2005)">
  <data key="d0">Mauguiere et al. (2005)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一个具有机器可用性约束的作业车间调度问题，作业可根据不可用时段为可恢复或不可恢复。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Kubzin and Strusevich (2006)">
  <data key="d0">Kubzin and Strusevich (2006)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究了两台机器开放式车间和流水车间问题，以最小化最大完工时间为目标，每台机器需进行预防性维护，维护时长取决于其开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Breit (2006)">
  <data key="d0">Breit (2006)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究了可抢占作业在两台机器流水车间中的调度问题，其中第一台机器在给定时间区间内不可用，目标为最小化最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ruiz, Garcia-Diaz, and Maroto (2007)">
  <data key="d0">Ruiz, Garcia-Diaz, and Maroto (2007)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文考虑了常规流水车间中的预防性维护和生产调度集成，提出并比较了六种元启发式算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Yang, Hsu, and Kuo (2008)">
  <data key="d0">Yang, Hsu, and Kuo (2008)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究了两台机器流水车间中，在完成最多固定数量作业后必须执行恒定时间维护的调度问题，目标为最小化最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Naderi, Zandieh, and Ghomi (2009)">
  <data key="d0">Naderi, Zandieh, and Ghomi (2009)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究了具有顺序相关准备时间和维护活动的作业车间调度问题，目标为最小化最大完工时间，采用了模拟退火和遗传算法求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785299060</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
