<node id="带预防性维护的分布式排列流水车间调度问题(PM/DPFSP)">
  <data key="d0">带预防性维护的分布式排列流水车间调度问题(PM/DPFSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">本文研究的调度问题，涉及在有预防性维护的情况下，将n个工件分配到F个相同工厂并排序，以最小化最大完工时间，属于NP-Hard问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300129</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多起点迭代贪婪算法(MSIG)">
  <data key="d0">多起点迭代贪婪算法(MSIG)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文针对PM/DPFSP问题提出的改进IG算法，采用多起点策略，当解连续未改进次数超过阈值时重新初始化，防止搜索停滞。&lt;SEP&gt;本文提出的元启发式算法，用于求解PM/DPFSP，包含改进的NEH2初始化、破坏与构造阶段、局部搜索、模拟退火接受准则和重启策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300129</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="迭代贪婪算法">
  <data key="d0">迭代贪婪算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种元启发式算法，每次迭代只产生一个候选解，本文算法MSIG基于此。&lt;SEP&gt;通过迭代破坏和修复解来优化问题的元启发式算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NEH2启发式方法">
  <data key="d0">NEH2启发式方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于生成初始解的启发式方法，本文通过添加丢弃操作对其进行了改进，以生成高质量且分散的初始解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300129</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="模拟退火接受准则">
  <data key="d0">模拟退火接受准则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于模拟退火思想的接受劣解的策略，以固定温度决定是否接受新解。&lt;SEP&gt;用于决定是否接受新解的准则，MSIG算法中采用此准则防止局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300129</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="重启策略">
  <data key="d0">重启策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在连续多次迭代未改进当前解时，重新初始化当前解的策略，用于防止局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300129</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="局部搜索">
  <data key="d0">局部搜索</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于三种有效算子的局部搜索过程，用于强化局部邻域解开发，集成在MSIG算法中。&lt;SEP&gt;在模因算法中扮演关键角色的局部优化组件。&lt;SEP&gt;一种元启发式优化技术，通过深入邻域搜索改进解的质量。&lt;SEP&gt;在DFJSP中增强搜索效率的局部搜索过程，包含多个专用算子。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分布式排列流水车间调度问题(DPFSP)">
  <data key="d0">分布式排列流水车间调度问题(DPFSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">经典的调度问题，涉及将n个工件分配到F个相同工厂并排序，所有机器连续可用，但本文考虑了带预防性维护的变体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300129</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="破坏阶段">
  <data key="d0">破坏阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">MSIG算法的一个阶段，使用锦标赛选择随机移除当前解中的少量工件以探索邻域解。&lt;SEP&gt;MSIG算法中的破坏阶段，通过移除d个工件来扰动当前解，产生临时序列λ_d。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="构造阶段">
  <data key="d0">构造阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">MSIG算法的一个阶段，在破坏阶段后，将移除的工件贪婪地重新插入新位置。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="锦标赛选择">
  <data key="d0">锦标赛选择</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在破坏阶段使用的一种选择策略，用于决定移除哪些工件。&lt;SEP&gt;破坏阶段采用的选择策略：随机挑选两个工厂，比较完工时间，从完工时间较大的工厂中随机移除一个工件。&lt;SEP&gt;一种选择策略，随机选取多个个体并选择最优者，用于形成交配池。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="丢弃操作">
  <data key="d0">丢弃操作</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在初始化阶段添加到NEH2启发式方法中的操作，用于生成高质量和分散的解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="初始化阶段">
  <data key="d0">初始化阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">MSIG算法的起始步骤，使用改进的NEH2方法生成初始解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="重新初始化">
  <data key="d0">重新初始化</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在重启策略中，当解未改进时，重新应用初始化方法生成新解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="修复性维护">
  <data key="d0">修复性维护</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在故障发生后进行的维护操作，与预防性维护相对。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工厂">
  <data key="d0">工厂</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">在分布式制造与调度问题的语境下，“工厂”指多工厂生产网络中执行工件加工任务的生产设施或制造单元。通常，研究假设存在多个地理位置分散的工厂，它们在调度中承担不同的角色与能力。在某些置换流水车间调度模型中，各工厂被视为完全相同的生产单元，各自维护独立的工件加工序列并独立计算完工时间。而在分布式柔性作业车间调度问题（如DFJSP-T）中，不同工厂可能具备不同的加工能力，每个工厂内部包含多台机器，所有待处理的作业需在初始阶段被完整分配至某一指定工厂，并由该工厂承担该作业的全部操作工序。更为一般化的表述将该实体定义为分布式调度环境下的一个生产工厂f，它拥有一组机器集合，专职处理分配给它的工件，并完成其所有必要的操作。综上，“工厂”在相关文献中可具体表现为F1、F2等具体生产单元，其核心属性是：作为分布式生产网络中的独立调度节点，拥有自身的机器资源，并对其所接收的工件全权负责加工。&lt;SEP&gt;生产设施，总数为f。每个工厂包含多个车间。&lt;SEP&gt;分布式柔性作业车间调度问题中的生产工厂，是最高层次的生产单位。&lt;SEP&gt;分布式制造环境中的生产设施，作业操作在此被执行，存在可用工厂集avai-fa。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854061</data>
