<node id="Pan, Q.-K.">
  <data key="d0">Pan, Q.-K.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">调度优化领域的研究人员，在分布式流水车间调度问题及迭代贪心算法方面有大量研究。&lt;SEP&gt;一位研究人员，参与了分布式置换流水车间问题有效启发式方法、分布式装配置换流水车间调度构造性启发式，以及分布式置换流水车间调度迭代贪婪方法等研究。&lt;SEP&gt;在参考文献列表中出现的作者，参与撰写了论文《An effective discrete artificial bee colony algorithm for multi-AGVs dispatching problem in a matrix manufacturing workshop》和《A distributed heterogeneous permutation flowshop scheduling problem with lot-streaming and carryover sequence-dependent setup time》。&lt;SEP&gt;该作者是《Effective Heuristics And Metaheuristics To Minimize Total Flowtime For The Distributed Permutation Flowshop Problem》的作者之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-027</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gao, L.">
  <data key="d0">Gao, L.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">调度优化领域的研究人员，合作发表了多篇关于分布式流水车间调度的论文。&lt;SEP&gt;一位研究人员，合作研究了分布式置换流水车间调度的有效启发式和元启发式方法，以及分布式装配置换流水车间调度的构造性启发式。&lt;SEP&gt;在参考文献列表中出现的作者，参与撰写了论文《An effective discrete artificial bee colony algorithm for multi-AGVs dispatching problem in a matrix manufacturing workshop》和《Sustainable scheduling of distributed permutation flow-shop with non-identical factory using a knowledgebased multi-objective memetic optimization algorithm》。&lt;SEP&gt;该作者是《Effective Heuristics And Metaheuristics To Minimize Total Flowtime For The Distributed Permutation Flowshop Problem》的作者之一。&lt;SEP&gt;Gao, L. 是遗传算法求解柔性作业车间调度的合著者。&lt;SEP&gt;研究人员，合著了论文“Review on Flexible Job Shop Scheduling”和“A New Neighbourhood Structure for Job Shop Scheduling Problems”。</data>
