<node id="带预防性维护的分布式置换流水车间调度问题(PM/DPFSP)">
  <data key="d0">带预防性维护的分布式置换流水车间调度问题(PM/DPFSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种调度问题，需将作业分配到多个工厂的多个机器上按相同路线加工，并周期性地在所有机器上进行预防性维护，以确保系统的可维护性和可靠性，目标是最小化最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="预防性维护操作(PM operation)">
  <data key="d0">预防性维护操作(PM operation)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在生产系统所有机器上定期执行的维护操作，每台机器有特定的处理间隔和处理时间，一旦开始不可中断。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分布式置换流水车间调度问题(DPFSP)">
  <data key="d0">分布式置换流水车间调度问题(DPFSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">不包含预防性维护的原始问题，仅考虑作业在分布式置换流水车间中的分配与排序，所有作业和机器在时刻0可用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="迭代贪婪算法(IG algorithm)">
  <data key="d0">迭代贪婪算法(IG algorithm)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种高性能启发式算法，循环执行破坏、构造、局部搜索和模拟退火接受准则四个操作，用于求解组合优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大完工时间(makespan)">
  <data key="d0">最大完工时间(makespan)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">调度方案的评价指标，指所有作业完成加工的总时间，目标是最小化该值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
