<node id="Wang, L.">
  <data key="d0">Wang, L.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">一位研究人员，在多篇学术论文中作为合著者，研究方向包括分布式置换流水车间调度、分布式流店节能调度和分布式装配置换流水车间调度等。&lt;SEP&gt;在参考文献列表中出现的作者，参与撰写了论文《An effective hybrid immune algorithm for solving the distributed permutation flow-shop scheduling problem》和《An ensemble discrete differential evolution for the distributed blocking flowshop scheduling with minimizing makespan criterion》。&lt;SEP&gt;该作者是《Effective Heuristics And Metaheuristics To Minimize Total Flowtime For The Distributed Permutation Flowshop Problem》、《An Effective Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm For The Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling Problem》和《A Multi-Agent Optimization Algorithm For Resource Constrained Project Scheduling Problem》等多篇论文的作者。&lt;SEP&gt;论文《Distributed Scheduling Problems in Intelligent Manufacturing Systems》和《Supplementary File of this Paper》的作者之一。&lt;SEP&gt;Wang, L. 是知识引导果蝇算法双资源约束柔性作业车间调度的合著者。&lt;SEP&gt;研究人员，合著了论文“A Cooperative Memetic Algorithm for Energy-Aware Distributed Welding Shop Scheduling Problem”。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-046</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
