  <data key="d0">PM/DPFSP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">结合了预防性维护的分布式置换流水车间调度问题，是一个较新的研究领域，现有文献中对此问题的研究较少。&lt;SEP&gt;置换制造/分布式置换流水车间调度问题，具有多个工厂，需要分配和排序工件以最小化最大完工时间。&lt;SEP&gt;带有预防性维护的分布式排列流水车间调度问题(Permutation Flowshop Scheduling Problem with Distributed Preventive Maintenance)，目标是最小化最大完工时间(Makespan)。&lt;SEP&gt;具有预防性维护的分布式排列流水车间调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;具有预防性维护的分布式置换流水车间调度问题，是本文研究的调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ruiz et al. (2007)">
  <data key="d0">Ruiz et al. (2007)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Ruiz等人于2007年发表的研究，为本实验中预防性维护(PM)相关参数的设定提供了参考。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="n">
  <data key="d0">n</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工件数量参数，是生成测试实例的组合因素之一。&lt;SEP&gt;工件数量参数，用于分类平均RPD值，在表格中取值为100、200、300、400、500。&lt;SEP&gt;n表示作业的总数。&lt;SEP&gt;待调度的作业数量，是解的长度计算(L_e = 2·n)和迭代次数计算(I_M = 2·τ·n)中的基础参数。&lt;SEP&gt;参数n，表示总作业数。&lt;SEP&gt;作业总数，定义索引i的取值范围。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="m">
  <data key="d0">m</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器数量参数，是生成测试实例的组合因素之一。&lt;SEP&gt;机器数量参数，用于分类平均RPD值，在表格中取值为5、8、10。&lt;SEP&gt;参数m，表示总机器数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
