</node>
<node id="F">
  <data key="d0">F</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工厂数量参数，是生成测试实例的组合因素之一。&lt;SEP&gt;工厂数量参数，用于分类平均RPD值，在表格中取值为2、4、6。&lt;SEP&gt;F表示异构工厂的数量。&lt;SEP&gt;工厂的总数参数</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
