<node id="Average">
  <data key="d0">Average</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">所有问题实例的平均性能指标&lt;SEP&gt;所有实例的平均值，标识为AVG，汇总了各项性能指标的平均水平。&lt;SEP&gt;所有测试实例的性能指标平均值。&lt;SEP&gt;测试实例PJS01至PJS10在各优先级级别上的平均X-factor指标及CPU时间的汇总数据：Superhot平均作业数5，平均X-factor 1.07，最大1.13；Hot平均作业数5，平均X-factor 1.30，最大1.41；Normal平均作业数10，平均X-factor 1.69，最大2.19；平均CPU时间91。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dropout操作">
  <data key="d0">Dropout操作</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">INEH2_dp中使用的操作，通过随机丢弃部分作业来避免局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="丢弃率k">
  <data key="d0">丢弃率k</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Dropout操作中的参数，控制丢弃作业的比例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-009</data>
