<node id="Total CPU Time">
  <data key="d0">Total CPU Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法运行所需的总CPU时间，衡量计算效率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Solution Diversity">
  <data key="d0">Solution Diversity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">解的多样性，在选择算法初始化方法时被考虑的因素之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="t-test">
  <data key="d0">t-test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">t检验，用于比较每对算法之间的性能差异是否显著。&lt;SEP&gt;用于比较两算法平均RPD差异的统计检验方法。&lt;SEP&gt;一种统计显著性检验方法，置信水平α=0.05，用于比较算法性能。在表中以'−'表示对比算法显著劣于KTCE，'='表示无显著差异，'+'表示显著优于KTCE。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845234</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fig. 12">
  <data key="d0">Fig. 12</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一张散点图，展示了各种启发式方法的平均RPD与总CPU时间的关系。&lt;SEP&gt;基于RPI值的箱形图和胜率饼图，用于说明解决方案的分布和性能差异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ISLS">
  <data key="d0">ISLS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Inter-factory Swap Local Search，一种局部搜索方法，通过在每个工厂内随机顺序交换作业位置来改进解，最坏情况下测试(n/F)(n/F-1)/2次交换操作，复杂度为O(n³m/F²)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ESLS">
  <data key="d0">ESLS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">External-key-factory Swap Local Search，一种局部搜索方法，针对关键工厂中的作业，与所有工厂(包括关键工厂)中的作业进行交换，并执行最佳交换以最小化Cmax，复杂度为O(n³m/F²)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EILS">
  <data key="d0">EILS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">External-key-factory Insertion Local Search，一种局部搜索方法，与ESLS类似，但通过将关键工厂中的作业重新插入所有工厂(含关键工厂)来改进解，复杂度为O(n³m/F²)，但理论上计算时间更短。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Key Factory">
  <data key="d0">Key Factory</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">关键工厂，在PM/DPFSP中具有最大完工时间的工厂，决定了整个调度方案的完工时间，记为f_key。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Swap Operator">
  <data key="d0">Swap Operator</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">交换算子，一种置换邻域操作，互换两个作业的位置。&lt;SEP&gt;一种变异算子，在FA和OS层中应用，通过交换个体中的元素来产生变异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Insertion Operator">
  <data key="d0">Insertion Operator</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">插入算子，一种置换邻域操作，将某个作业从其原始位置移除并插入到不同位置。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local Search Phase">
  <data key="d0">Local Search Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">局部搜索阶段，是MSIG算法的一部分，依次调用ISLS、ESLS和EILS，重复执行直到无法得到更优解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Acceptance Criterion">
  <data key="d0">Acceptance Criterion</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">接受准则，一种模拟退火式的准则，使用恒定温度以一定概率接受劣解，避免陷入局部最优，温度常数基于实例由Osman和Potts (1989)的公式计算。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Restart Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Restart Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">重启策略，若全局最优解在连续α次迭代中未改进，则放弃当前解并从启发式初始化重新开始搜索，以避免陷入局部最优或循环搜索。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
