  <data key="d0">构建阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">MSIG算法中的构建阶段，将临时序列λ_d中的工件按总加工时间递减顺序重新插入各工厂，并执行交换优化，生成完整候选解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="临时序列λ_d">
  <data key="d0">临时序列λ_d</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">由破坏阶段从所有工厂中移除的d个工件组成的临时存储序列。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="d">
  <data key="d0">d</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">破坏阶段中要移除的工件数量，是一个整数参数，需要调整。&lt;SEP&gt;常数，权重或延迟因子。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Procedure Construction">
  <data key="d0">Procedure Construction</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">构建阶段的伪代码：将λ_d中的工件按总加工时间降序排序，依次贪婪插入最佳位置，然后测试并执行工件交换以优化完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Procedure ISLS">
  <data key="d0">Procedure ISLS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">迭代局部搜索(ISLS)的伪代码：在每个工厂内随机选择工件，测试与所有其他工件交换，若改进则执行交换并跳出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Procedure ESLS">
  <data key="d0">Procedure ESLS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">增强局部搜索(ESLS)的伪代码：确定关键工厂后，从其随机选择工件，测试与所有工厂的所有工件交换，若降低最大完工时间则执行交换并跳出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Procedure EILS">
  <data key="d0">Procedure EILS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">增强迭代局部搜索(EILS)的伪代码：从关键工厂随机提取工件，测试插入所有工厂的所有位置，若降低最大完工时间则插入，否则将工件放回原位。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785300130</data>
