<node id="多目标优化">
  <data key="d0">多目标优化</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">同时优化多个相互冲突目标的优化方法，应用于EDFJSP-T。&lt;SEP&gt;同时考虑多个优化目标的优化方法，本文中针对最小化最大完工时间、最大工作负载和总能耗&lt;SEP&gt;同时优化多个目标的问题，本研究涉及最小化完工时间和总延误。&lt;SEP&gt;同时优化多个通常相互冲突的目标的优化方法，例如在调度中同时最小化完工时间和能耗。&lt;SEP&gt;同时优化多个相互冲突目标的优化问题，管理者希望获得大量非支配解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="10.1109/TEVC.2024.3388527">
  <data key="d0">10.1109/TEVC.2024.3388527</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出一种基于反馈学习的模因算法(FLMA)用于求解具有运输约束的能源感知分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(EDFJSP-T)的学术论文。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wang et al. [16]">
  <data key="d0">Wang et al. [16]</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">提出了一种基于演化博弈的求解器方法，用于在工业物联网下实时调度能源感知的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(EDFJSP)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Du et al. [17]">
  <data key="d0">Du et al. [17]</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">提出了一种结合变邻域搜索(VNS)的分布估计算法(EDA)，用于求解四种天车条件下的EDFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
