</node>
<node id="Li et al. [18]">
  <data key="d0">Li et al. [18]</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">提出了一种基于惊人一致性(surprisingly popular)的自适应模因算法，并随后开发了一种基于惊人一致性程度的反馈自修正操作子选择模型，用于求解EDFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
