<node id="总能耗">
  <data key="d0">总能耗</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">总能耗是指在生产调度过程中，为完成所有加工与转移作业而消耗的全部能量。它通常被记为TEC，是绿色调度和节能调度问题中的核心优化指标之一，常见于分布式柔性作业车间调度问题（如DFJSPT和DFJSPJP）的建模中。总能耗的构成同时涵盖机器加工能耗和自动导引小车（AGV）等运输设备在转移作业中所产生的能耗，反映工厂生产系统的整体能源消耗水平。

作为调度优化的关键目标函数，总能耗通常被设定为需要最小化的f2目标，以推动降低整体能源消耗。在相关研究对比中，采用MEM方法对该指标能实现约0.18%的改进效果，而OEM方法则几乎未带来改进。这一指标将加工能耗与运输能耗统一纳入考量，为面向可持续发展的生产调度提供了全面的能效评价依据。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
