<node id="FLMA (Feedback Learning-Based Memetic Algorithm)">
  <data key="d0">FLMA (Feedback Learning-Based Memetic Algorithm)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于反馈学习的模因算法，用于求解能量感知的分布式柔性作业车间调度等优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="田口实验设计法">
  <data key="d0">田口实验设计法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种广泛使用的实验设计方法，通过正交数组分析关键参数对算法性能的影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population Size (PS)">
  <data key="d0">Population Size (PS)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FLMA的一个关键参数，控制种群规模，影响并行搜索能力和进化深度与广度平衡。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="History Memory Length (HL)">
  <data key="d0">History Memory Length (HL)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FLMA的关键参数，表示历史信息的反馈程度，HL值越大，可利用的历史信息越多。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="正交数组L16(4^3)">
  <data key="d0">正交数组L16(4^3)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一个16行3列的正交数组，用于安排PS、NS、HL三个参数各四个水平的16种组合实验。&lt;SEP&gt;一种正交数组，用于测量三个参数各四个水平的影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Minitab/MATLAB">
  <data key="d0">Minitab/MATLAB</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">用于生成正交数组L16(4^3)的统计计算软件工具。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="60个第三类实例">
  <data key="d0">60个第三类实例</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">用于实验的60个第三类问题实例，以消除不同规模实例的影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hypervolume (HV)">
  <data key="d0">Hypervolume (HV)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">一种多目标优化性能指标，衡量帕累托解集的收敛性和多样性，其平均值用作响应值。&lt;SEP&gt;一种性能度量指标，用于评估解集的分布和收敛性，HV值越高表示算法性能越好</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Response Value (RV)">
  <data key="d0">Response Value (RV)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">每个参数组合下多次实验的平均HV值，作为田口方法的响应变量。&lt;SEP&gt;响应值，在田口实验中用于评估参数组合的性能；以IGD作为响应值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table II">
  <data key="d0">Table II</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">列出了正交数组L16(4^3)的具体实验安排及各实验对应响应值的表格。&lt;SEP&gt;表格II，呈现了所有比较算法的主要参数设置。&lt;SEP&gt;Table II详细列出了Wilcoxon检验的统计结果，包括R^+、R^-和P值等信息。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Table III">
  <data key="d0">Table III</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">列出了各参数不同水平的平均响应值、极差和显著性排名的表格。&lt;SEP&gt;表格III，呈现了所有比较算法在各实例上的RPI、MEAN、BEST和STD性能数值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
