<node id="L. Wang">
  <data key="d0">L. Wang</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">L. Wang 是一位在柔性作业车间调度、模因算法和分布式车间调度等领域发表了多项成果的研究人员。其研究聚焦于智能制造系统中的分布式调度问题，重点关注节能降碳、模糊处理时间、多目标优化以及异构工厂环境等实际约束。作为合著者，L. Wang 参与了多篇学术论文的撰写，其中包括《A Knowledge-Based Two-Population Optimization Algorithm for Distributed Energy-Efficient Parallel Machines Scheduling》、《A Bi-Population Evolutionary Algorithm with Feedback for Energy-Efficient Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling》、《A Cooperative Memetic Algorithm with Learning-Based Agent for Energy-Aware Distributed Hybrid Flow-Shop Scheduling》、《A Multi-Objective Scheduling Method for Distributed and Flexible Job Shop Based on Hybrid Genetic Algorithm and Tabu Search Considering Operation Outsourcing and Carbon Emission》、《A Self-Learning Discrete Jaya Algorithm for Multiobjective Energy-Efficient Distributed No-Idle Flow-Shop Scheduling Problem in Heterogeneous Factory System》（2022年）、《A Cooperative Coevolution Algorithm for Multi-Objective Fuzzy Distributed Hybrid Flow Shop》（2020年）、《Solving Energy-Efficient Distributed Job Shop Scheduling via Multi-Objective Evolutionary Algorithm with Decomposition》、《Two-Stage Knowledge-Driven Evolutionary Algorithm for Distributed Green Flexible Job Shop Scheduling with Type-2 Fuzzy Processing Time》，以及发表在 IEEE Trans. Cybern. 上的《Distributed Heterogeneous Co-evolutionary Algorithm for Scheduling a Multistage Fine-Manufacturing System with Setup Constraints》和《A Knowledge-Guided Fruit Fly Optimization Algorithm for Dual Resource Constrained Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling Problem》等。此外，L. Wang 还是专著《Distributed Scheduling Problems in Intelligent Manufacturing Systems》的作者之一。&lt;SEP&gt;一位从事分布式柔性作业车间调度研究的学者。&lt;SEP&gt;是论文《A Q-Learning-Based Hyper-Heuristic Evolutionary Algorithm for the Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling Problem with Crane Transportation》的作者之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-061&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-062</data>
