<node id="C. Lu">
  <data key="d0">C. Lu</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">与L. Gao等人共同发表了关于带反馈机制的混合多目标进化算法的学术论文的研究人员。&lt;SEP&gt;一名研究人员，作为作者参与了论文'Energy-efficient scheduling of distributed flow shop with heterogeneous factories: A real-world case from automobile industry in China'(2021)。&lt;SEP&gt;作者，参与了论文《Two-Stage Knowledge-Driven Evolutionary Algorithm for Distributed Green Flexible Job Shop Scheduling with Type-2 Fuzzy Processing Time》的撰写。&lt;SEP&gt;是论文《A knowledge-guided bi-population evolutionary algorithm for energy-efficient scheduling of distributed flexible job shop problem》的作者之一，该论文发表于期刊Eng. Appl. Artif. Intell.。&lt;SEP&gt;一位从事分布式柔性作业车间调度研究的学者。&lt;SEP&gt;是论文《A Knowledge-Guided Bi-Population Evolutionary Algorithm for Energy-Efficient Scheduling of Distributed Flexible Job Shop Problem》和《Inverse Model and Adaptive Neighborhood Search Based Cooperative Optimizer for Energy-Efficient Distributed Flexible Job Shop》的作者之一。&lt;SEP&gt;一名研究人员，作为合作作者参与发表了多篇关于柔性作业车间调度的论文。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-061&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-062&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-044</data>
