  <data key="d2">与C. Lu等人共同发表了关于带反馈机制的混合多目标进化算法的学术论文的研究人员。&lt;SEP&gt;一名研究人员，作为作者参与了论文'Energy-efficient scheduling of distributed flow shop with heterogeneous factories: A real-world case from automobile industry in China'(2021)。&lt;SEP&gt;作为参考文献[5]中论文《An effective multi-objective whale swarm algorithm for energy-efficient scheduling of distributed welding flow shop》的合著者之一。&lt;SEP&gt;X. Li是论文《Multi-objective optimisation in flexible assembly job shop scheduling using a distributed ant colony system》的合著者。&lt;SEP&gt;是论文《A Hybrid Genetic Tabu Search Algorithm for Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problems》和《An Effective Multi-Objective Whale Swarm Algorithm for Energy-Efficient Scheduling of Distributed Welding Flow Shop》的作者之一。&lt;SEP&gt;一名研究人员，作为合作作者参与发表了多篇关于柔性作业车间调度的论文。</data>
