<node id="A Feedback Learning-Based Memetic Algorithm for Energy-Aware Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling With Transportation Constraints">
  <data key="d0">A Feedback Learning-Based Memetic Algorithm for Energy-Aware Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling With Transportation Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇提出反馈学习型Memetic算法用于求解带运输约束的能耗感知分布式柔性作业车间调度问题的学术论文。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Energy-Aware Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling With Transportation Constraints (EDFJSP-T)">
  <data key="d0">Energy-Aware Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling With Transportation Constraints (EDFJSP-T)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">考虑能耗和运输约束的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785830239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Feedback Learning-Based Memetic Algorithm (FLMA)">
  <data key="d0">Feedback Learning-Based Memetic Algorithm (FLMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于反馈学习的Memetic算法，旨在同时最小化最大完工时间和总能耗。&lt;SEP&gt;Wang等人提出的反馈学习模因算法，通过监控种群和个体状态自适应选择算子，最小化制造周期和总能耗，用于带运输约束的节能DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Total Energy Consumption">
  <data key="d0">Total Energy Consumption</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">总能耗，衡量生产过程中能源消耗的指标。&lt;SEP&gt;总能耗，包括实际生产能耗、机器闲置能耗和维护能耗，是多目标优化中的目标之一。&lt;SEP&gt;总能耗，调度优化中的另一个关键目标。&lt;SEP&gt;总能耗，该工程案例中为51.661千焦。&lt;SEP&gt;最小化总能耗目标，包括加工能耗和机器间、工厂间转移能耗</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Forward Insertion-Based Encoding and Decoding Method">
  <data key="d0">Forward Insertion-Based Encoding and Decoding Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于前向插入的编码和解码方法，用于减小搜索空间并获得高质量调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3064a959dca3e0581ecf9bc89a1a99fd-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Feedback_Learning-Based_Memetic_Algorithm_for_Energy-Aware_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation_Constraints-32f047d1.pdf</data>
