<node id="A Learning-Assisted Bi-Population Evolutionary Algorithm for Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling With Maintenance Decisions">
  <data key="d0">A Learning-Assisted Bi-Population Evolutionary Algorithm for Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling With Maintenance Decisions</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇研究论文，提出了一种学习辅助的双种群进化算法，用于解决带维护决策的分布式柔性作业车间调度多目标优化问题。</data>
