<node id="Two-stage knowledgedriven evolutionary algorithm for distributed green flexible job shop scheduling with type-2 fuzzy processing time">
  <data key="d0">Two-stage knowledgedriven evolutionary algorithm for distributed green flexible job shop scheduling with type-2 fuzzy processing time</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一种两阶段知识驱动的进化算法，用于具有第二类模糊处理时间的分布式绿色柔性作业车间调度，发表于《Swarm Evol. Comput.》2022年第74卷。</data>
