</node>
<node id="A knowledge-guided bi-population evolutionary algorithm for energy-efficient scheduling of distributed flexible job shop problem">
  <data key="d0">A knowledge-guided bi-population evolutionary algorithm for energy-efficient scheduling of distributed flexible job shop problem</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一种知识引导的双种群进化算法，用于分布式柔性作业车间的节能调度，发表于《Eng. Appl. Artif. Intell.》2024年第128卷。&lt;SEP&gt;是一篇学术论文，标题为《A knowledge-guided bi-population evolutionary algorithm for energy-efficient scheduling of distributed flexible job shop problem》，发表于Eng. Appl. Artif. Intell.，卷128，2024年，文章号107458。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-036</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
