  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Learning-Assisted Adaptive LS Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Learning-Assisted Adaptive LS Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种学习辅助的自适应局部搜索策略，当第t代帕累托解集中遗传到第t+1代的解的比例超过阈值时触发，包含两个阶段的局部搜索过程。&lt;SEP&gt;一种学习辅助的自适应局部搜索策略，包含奖励更新和维修调整两个阶段。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="维修调整策略">
  <data key="d0">维修调整策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">学习辅助自适应局部搜索策略的第二阶段，负责调整预防性维修(PM)和纠正性维修(CM)的数量与位置。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="预防性维修(PM)">
  <data key="d0">预防性维修(PM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在机器操作前主动执行的维修方式，旨在改善机器状态并降低维修成本。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="纠正性维修(CM)">
  <data key="d0">纠正性维修(CM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">当预防性维修不及时而发生的被动维修方式，用于修复机器故障。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="OM级编码">
  <data key="d0">OM级编码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在调度解中用于编码维修决策的数据结构层，维护代码嵌入其中。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
