<node id="Machine Selection (MS)">
  <data key="d0">Machine Selection (MS)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">三级编码中的一个层次，用于指定每个操作所分配的机器。&lt;SEP&gt;编码中的机器选择向量，为每个操作从可用机器集中选择加工机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Factory Assignment (FA)">
  <data key="d0">Factory Assignment (FA)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">三级编码中的一个层次，用于指定每个操作所分配的工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
