<node id="Tournament Selection">
  <data key="d0">Tournament Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">二元锦标赛选择方法，用于从当前种群中选择个体创建交配池。&lt;SEP&gt;锦标赛选择方法，用于从当前种群中根据F(x,λ)值选择高质量个体进行局部搜索。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Evolution Operator">
  <data key="d0">Evolution Operator</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">包括交叉和变异操作的进化算子，用于生成后代个体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Crossover">
  <data key="d0">Crossover</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">进化算子中的交叉操作，重组父代个体生成新个体。&lt;SEP&gt;进化阶段的核心操作，用于解空间探索，是HOA-DSTM中种群内学习的重要组成部分。&lt;SEP&gt;算法中的交叉操作，决定全局搜索能力，针对两种编码向量采用不同的交叉方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mutation">
  <data key="d0">Mutation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">进化算子中的变异操作，对个体进行随机扰动以增加多样性。&lt;SEP&gt;进化阶段的核心操作，用于提高每代种群的多样性，通过交换或重置维持种群多样性。&lt;SEP&gt;变异操作，用于维持种群进化过程中的多样性，防止多样性下降导致收敛到局部最优。包含操作序列变异和设备分配变异两种策略。对每个后代个体，若满足变异条件，则生成一个0到1的随机数；当随机数小于0.5时，执行操作序列变异；否则执行设备分配变异。&lt;SEP&gt;差分进化策略中的变异操作，用于生成新解以逃离局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Environmental Selection">
  <data key="d0">Environmental Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">环境选择策略，从合并的父代和子代中选择个体形成下一代种群。&lt;SEP&gt;环境选择，采用非支配排序从合并种群中选择新一代种群和Pareto前沿。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Learning-Assisted Adaptive Local Search Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Learning-Assisted Adaptive Local Search Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种学习辅助的自适应局部搜索策略，用于平衡探索与开发，并根据解的特征自适应调整邻域结构。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fast Non-Dominated Sort">
  <data key="d0">Fast Non-Dominated Sort</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">快速非支配排序算法，用于对种群进行非支配排序，提取非支配前沿。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Delete Duplicates">
  <data key="d0">Delete Duplicates</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">删除重复解的操作，用于维护非支配解集的唯一性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Three-Level Encoding Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Three-Level Encoding Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于LBPEA初始化的一种三层编码机制，产生初始种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="OM-Level Encoding">
  <data key="d0">OM-Level Encoding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种操作-机器(OM)级编码方法，是三级编码机制的一部分，基于输入的操作序列、机器选择和工厂分配编码生成OM编码。&lt;SEP&gt;一种编码方案，用于表示操作-机器分配和排序，其中0值用于分隔不同工件的操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="OS">
  <data key="d0">OS</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">操作序列编码，代表作业调度的操作顺序。&lt;SEP&gt;操作序列向量存档，存储π向量。&lt;SEP&gt;HOA-DSTM中的一个层，设计了一种保持优先顺序的基于顺序的交叉(POX)方法以维持个体合法性。&lt;SEP&gt;操作序列，表示DFJSP中操作的处理顺序。&lt;SEP&gt;工序排序，DFJSP编码方案的一个组成部分，由DSTM进行优化。&lt;SEP&gt;工序序列，编码方案的一部分</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MS">
  <data key="d0">MS</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">机器选择编码，代表为每个操作分配的机器。&lt;SEP&gt;机器分配向量存档，存储μ向量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FA">
  <data key="d0">FA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">工厂分配编码，代表每个操作被分配到的工厂。&lt;SEP&gt;工厂分配向量存档，存储τ向量。&lt;SEP&gt;HOA-DSTM中的一个层，采用基于掩码的均匀交叉(UX)方法进行相互知识学习。&lt;SEP&gt;工厂分配，决定每个作业分配到哪个工厂。&lt;SEP&gt;工厂分配，DFJSP编码方案的另一个组成部分，由DSTM进行优化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="OM">
  <data key="d0">OM</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">操作-机器(OM)编码，在操作序列中插入0表示机器转换或空闲时间，用于OM-Level Encoding的输出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ω">
  <data key="d0">Ω</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">非支配解集，是LBPEA算法的最终输出，包含所有找到的非支配调度方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Q-Table">
  <data key="d0">Q-Table</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">强化学习中的Q表，尺寸为6×5，用于在学习辅助自适应局部搜索策略中指导邻域结构的选择。&lt;SEP&gt;Q-learning中用于估计状态-动作值的数据结构，代理通过动作选择和奖励反馈迭代优化Q值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LBPEA Code Repository">
  <data key="d0">LBPEA Code Repository</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">LBPEA算法的源代码仓库，托管在GitHub上，提供代码实现。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population1">
  <data key="d0">Population1</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">种群1，是合并父代和子代种群后随机分配得到的两个子种群之一，采用收敛驱动的环境选择策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population2">
  <data key="d0">Population2</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">种群2，是合并父代和子代种群后随机分配得到的两个子种群之一，采用多样驱动的环境选择策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="收敛驱动环境选择策略">
  <data key="d0">收敛驱动环境选择策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种环境选择策略，基于收敛性考虑，通过快速非支配排序、支配关系和拥挤距离从种群1中选择解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多样驱动环境选择策略">
  <data key="d0">多样驱动环境选择策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种环境选择策略，基于多样性考虑，通过生成权重向量划分目标空间为区域，并从每个区域选择解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="快速非支配排序方法">
  <data key="d0">快速非支配排序方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种将解划分为不同非支配层级的方法，用于种群1的环境选择。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="支配关系">
  <data key="d0">支配关系</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在多目标优化中，用于比较解优劣的关系。在种群1的环境选择中，基于支配关系和拥挤距离选择解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="拥挤距离">
  <data key="d0">拥挤距离</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">衡量解在目标空间中密集程度的指标，用于维持解的多样性。在种群1的选择中使用。&lt;SEP&gt;衡量个体在目标空间中密度的指标，用于维持解的多样性。&lt;SEP&gt;在多目标优化中衡量个体周围密度的指标，用于保持种群多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="权重向量">
  <data key="d0">权重向量</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在种群2的环境选择中，根据解的分布均匀生成的向量，用于将目标空间划分为区域。&lt;SEP&gt;一组权重向量，用于引导搜索方向，维持种群多样性，防止过快收敛。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="区域">
  <data key="d0">区域</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">目标空间中被权重向量划分出的互不重叠的子空间，每个区域中的解按加权目标值排名。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="空闲时间缩减策略">
  <data key="d0">空闲时间缩减策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于分解思想提出的策略，通过在OM层级中执行全主动调度并考虑劣化和维护来减少空闲时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="全主动调度">
  <data key="d0">全主动调度</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种常用于柔性作业车间调度问题的调度方法，通过左右移动操作至最早空闲时间槽来减少空闲时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="劣化">
  <data key="d0">劣化</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">影响加工时间的因素之一，导致操作的实际加工时间与标准加工时间不同。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="维护">
  <data key="d0">维护</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">影响加工时间的因素之一，考虑维护活动会导致实际加工时间的变化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="OM层级">
  <data key="d0">OM层级</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">一种数据结构，表示操作-机器的分配信息。在空闲时间缩减策略中，通过删除和填充0值来更新。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="解码过程">
  <data key="d0">解码过程</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">将编码转换为可行调度的过程，在OM层级更新后执行，具体方法见第四节B部分。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="空闲时间">
  <data key="d0">空闲时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器上未被利用的时间段，优化目标f1和f3受空闲时间影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="实际加工时间">
  <data key="d0">实际加工时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">考虑劣化和维护后操作的实际加工耗时，用于决定操作能否插入空闲时间槽。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="标准加工时间">
  <data key="d0">标准加工时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">不考虑劣化和维护时操作的正常加工耗时，与空闲时间比较以判断操作移动。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785833024</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="f1">
  <data key="d0">f1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优化目标中的第一个目标，受空闲时间影响。&lt;SEP&gt;优化目标函数之一，在收敛曲线中分析其平均值的变化。&lt;SEP&gt;f1是DFJSPJP问题中的一个优化目标函数，涉及最小化某个指标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-031</data>
