<node id="LBPEA for Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling with Maintenance Decisions">
  <data key="d0">LBPEA for Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling with Maintenance Decisions</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇学术论文，提出了学习辅助的双种群进化算法(LBPEA)，用于解决分布式柔性作业车间调度与维护决策问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-3c097ff3685735b34b61c3dd960e3345-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Learning-Assisted_Bi-Population_Evolutionary_Algorithm_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Maintenance_Decisions-ef8a1db5.pdf</data>
