  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling">
  <data key="d0">Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，扩展了FJSP，涉及多工厂的作业分配和运输调度。&lt;SEP&gt;分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，作为FJSP的扩展，应对从集中式生产向分布式生产转变带来的额外复杂性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Quality-Diversity Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Quality-Diversity Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种在求解高质量解的同时保持行为多样性的优化方法&lt;SEP&gt;一种优化框架，旨在生成具有多样性特征的高质量解决方案。&lt;SEP&gt;一种进化算法范式，侧重于同时探索特征空间并优化由用户定义指标衡量的目标函数，通过发现每个特征区域的最佳解来促进解的多样性。&lt;SEP&gt;一种优化范式，旨在同时追求解的质量和多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MAP-Elites">
  <data key="d0">MAP-Elites</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种广泛使用的质量多样性框架，将解映射到特征网格并保持精英解&lt;SEP&gt;一种广泛使用的质量多样性算法，将特征空间离散化为网格，迭代地选择解进行变异以产生新候选解，并将其加入网格中，如果它们占据空单元格或优于当前占据者，旨在为每个单元格找到最高质量的解。&lt;SEP&gt;一种质量多样性对比算法，在所有测试实例中始终产生最优解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Particle Swarm Optimization Combined With Genetic Algorithms">
  <data key="d0">Particle Swarm Optimization Combined With Genetic Algorithms</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种将粒子群优化(PSO)与遗传算法(GA)相结合的混合元启发式方法，被用于求解柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid Variable Neighborhood Search">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Variable Neighborhood Search</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种混合变邻域搜索算法，通过系统地改变邻域结构来避免局部最优，用于求解柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Two-Individual Master-Apprentice Evolutionary Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Two-Individual Master-Apprentice Evolutionary Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种仅使用两个个体的主学徒进化算法，采用小种群策略，对求解柔性作业车间调度问题展现出良好性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Single-Individual Iterative Greedy Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Single-Individual Iterative Greedy Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种单个体迭代贪婪算法，通过迭代地破坏和重建解来优化，使用小种群，对求解柔性作业车间调度问题具有良好性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Knowledge-Based Cuckoo Search">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge-Based Cuckoo Search</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于知识的布谷鸟搜索方法，利用领域知识引导搜索过程，用于解决带装配约束的柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Dominated Sorting Genetic Algorithm-Iii">
  <data key="d0">Non-Dominated Sorting Genetic Algorithm-Iii</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">非支配排序遗传算法-III，一种多目标进化算法，被用于在作业到达情况下同时优化多个目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Improved Genetic Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Improved Genetic Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种改进的遗传算法，通过优化最有希望的个体来提高解质量，用于求解分布式柔性作业车间调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;一种改进的遗传算法，用于求解双资源约束柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deep Q-Networks Co-Evolution">
  <data key="d0">Deep Q-Networks Co-Evolution</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种深度Q网络协同进化方法，利用深度强化学习与协同进化框架，用于解决分布式柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Surprisingly Popular Based Adaptive Memetic Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Surprisingly Popular Based Adaptive Memetic Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于惊人流行度的自适应模因算法，利用群体智慧来指导自适应搜索，用于解决分布式柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transportation Constraints">
  <data key="d0">Transportation Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式调度环境中存在的运输约束，包括机器间转运时间和装卸过程，对调度精度有重要影响。&lt;SEP&gt;调度中需考虑的物料运输限制。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Feature Space">
  <data key="d0">Feature Space</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在质量多样性优化中，由用户定义的特征或行为描述符定义的数值向量空间，用于表征解的属性。&lt;SEP&gt;SADE-QD中定义的行为特征空间，被离散化为二维网格，用于存储和评估解的多样性。&lt;SEP&gt;一种多维空间，由机器空闲时间次数和工序转移次数等行为特征定义，用于刻画质量多样性优化中解的多样性；在SADE-QD中被用于维持和探索解的多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Behavior Descriptors">
  <data key="d0">Behavior Descriptors</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在质量多样性优化中，表征解的性质并定义特征空间的数值向量，也称为特征。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling With Transportation">
  <data key="d0">Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling With Transportation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">带运输的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，考虑了运输约束和分布式生产环境，是本文提出算法的主要应用场景。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assembly Constraints">
  <data key="d0">Assembly Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度中的一类特定约束，涉及多个柔性和装配阶段的集成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fuzzy Constraints">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度中的不确定约束，需要进化算法处理模糊信息以实现低能耗和高精度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Domain Knowledge">
  <data key="d0">Domain Knowledge</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">领域知识，包括机器空闲、作业运输特征等，被整合到算法中以提升性能。&lt;SEP&gt;在调度问题中，关于分布式工厂、机器运输状态和机器空闲时间等领域的专门知识，用于指导优化算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Problem Features">
  <data key="d0">Problem Features</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式柔性作业车间调度中的问题特征，如分布式工厂、机器运输状态和机器空闲时间，可被用于提高调度精度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
