<node id="Quality Diversity: A New Frontier for Evolutionary Computation">
  <data key="d0">Quality Diversity: A New Frontier for Evolutionary Computation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">将质量多样性作为进化计算的新前沿进行介绍，并探讨了其概念和应用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
