  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A Hybrid Estimation of Distribution Algorithm for Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling with Crane Transportations">
  <data key="d0">A Hybrid Estimation of Distribution Algorithm for Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling with Crane Transportations</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">提出一种混合分布估计算法，用于带起重机运输的分布式柔性作业车间调度。&lt;SEP&gt;2021年发表于《Swarm and Evolutionary Computation》的论文，提出了一种混合分布估计算法用于带起重机运输的分布式柔性作业车间调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-015</data>
