<node id="Deep reinforcement learning-based memetic algorithm for solving dynamic distributed green flexible job shop scheduling problem with finite transportation resources">
  <data key="d0">Deep reinforcement learning-based memetic algorithm for solving dynamic distributed green flexible job shop scheduling problem with finite transportation resources</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇提出深度强化学习基模因算法求解带有限运输资源的动态分布式绿色柔性作业车间调度问题的论文，发表于Swarm and Evolutionary Computation期刊第94卷，2025年，文章编号101885。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-026</data>
