  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="S_{i,j}">
  <data key="d0">S_{i,j}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">作业i操作j的开始时间，取机器可用时间和作业到达时间(前序完成时间加运输时间)的较大值。&lt;SEP&gt;操作O_{i,j} 的开始时间</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="I_O">
  <data key="d0">I_O</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">空闲间隔，当作业到达后机器已经可用但机器空闲的时间段。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="W_O">
  <data key="d0">W_O</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">等待时间，当作业到达时机器尚忙导致作业等待的时间段。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="O_{i,j}">
  <data key="d0">O_{i,j}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">作业i的第j个操作，是调度过程中的一个任务单元。&lt;SEP&gt;作业J_i的第j个操作，j=1,2,...,o_i</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="单调性">
  <data key="d0">单调性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">完成时间C_{i,j}关于机器可用时间M_t和运输时间TR_{i,j,k,k'}是非递减的性质。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="加法影响">
  <data key="d0">加法影响</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">完成时间C_{i,j}与无延迟完成时间(前序完成时间加处理时间)的差异等于由机器引起的延迟和运输延迟中的较大值的性质。</data>
