<node id="Self-Adaptive Differential Evolution-Enhanced Quality-Diversity Optimization for Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling With Transportation">
  <data key="d0">Self-Adaptive Differential Evolution-Enhanced Quality-Diversity Optimization for Distributed Flexible Job-Shop Scheduling With Transportation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇提出SADE-QD方法用于解决DFJSP-T问题的学术论文。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling with Transportation Constraints">
  <data key="d0">Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling with Transportation Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种考虑运输约束的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，广泛应用于制造业。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Differential Evolution">
  <data key="d0">Differential Evolution</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种通过利用有潜力的个体来生成后代的进化算法&lt;SEP&gt;一种进化算法，SADE-QD中采用其自适应形式。&lt;SEP&gt;一种基于种群差异的进化优化算法，在一篇参考文献中被改进并用于分布式装配柔性作业车间调度。&lt;SEP&gt;一种求解优化问题的进化算法，具有突变策略和突变及交叉参数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Self-Adaptive Differential Evolution">
  <data key="d0">Self-Adaptive Differential Evolution</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">差分进化的自适应变体，用于在特征空间中探索更广泛的解决方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Machine Idle Feature">
  <data key="d0">Machine Idle Feature</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器空闲特征，用于建模问题并保留具有不同行为的解决方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
