<node id="机器闲置时间(I_O)">
  <data key="d0">机器闲置时间(I_O)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器在等待工件到达时的闲置时间长度。当机器先于工件到达时，I_O &gt; 0，否则为0。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工件等待时间(W_O)">
  <data key="d0">工件等待时间(W_O)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工件在机器可用前等待的时间长度。当工件先于机器可用时，W_O &gt; 0，否则为0。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="完成时间(C_{i,j})">
  <data key="d0">完成时间(C_{i,j})</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工序O_{i,j}的完工时间点。通过统一公式计算，等于加工时间加上机器可用时间与工序到达时间中的较大者。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器可用时间(M_t)">
  <data key="d0">机器可用时间(M_t)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器t的可用时间点，表示机器可以开始新工序的时刻。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="运输时间(TR_{i,j,k,k'})">
  <data key="d0">运输时间(TR_{i,j,k,k'})</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">将工序O_{i,j}从机器k运输到机器k'所需的时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="加工时间(T_{i,j,k'})">
  <data key="d0">加工时间(T_{i,j,k'})</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工序O_{i,j}在机器k'上执行加工操作所需的时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="开始时间(S_{i,j})">
  <data key="d0">开始时间(S_{i,j})</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工序O_{i,j}开始加工的时刻。在机器先等待场景中为工件到达时间，在工件先等待场景中为机器可用时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工序(O_{i,j})">
  <data key="d0">工序(O_{i,j})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件i的第j道加工工序，是调度问题中的基本操作单元。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="性质3">
  <data key="d0">性质3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一个关于DFJSP-T调度中完成时间计算的显式性质，提供了统一公式并解释机器闲置与运输时间的影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器闲置特征(num_idle)">
  <data key="d0">机器闲置特征(num_idle)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在QD优化中作为第一维特征使用的机器闲置次数，表示整个调度过程中机器闲置事件的数量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工件运输特征(num_trans)">
  <data key="d0">工件运输特征(num_trans)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在QD优化中作为第二维特征使用的工件运输次数，表示整个调度过程中工件运输事件的数量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="特征空间(Feature Space B)">
  <data key="d0">特征空间(Feature Space B)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由机器闲置特征和工件运输特征张成的二维有界空间，用于QD优化中的解存档与多样性维护。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="下界(lb)">
  <data key="d0">下界(lb)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">特征空间的下边界，固定为0，表示特征值的最小可能取值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="上界(ub)">
  <data key="d0">上界(ub)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">特征空间的上边界，设置为n_max(最大操作数等)，用于制约特征空间范围。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="网格单元">
  <data key="d0">网格单元</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">特征空间被离散化后形成的(ub-lb)^2个矩形单元，每个单元内维护一个最佳解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="质量多样性优化(QD优化)">
  <data key="d0">质量多样性优化(QD优化)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种同时优化目标函数与保持解空间多样性的优化方法，此处用于DFJSP-T以构建特征空间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSP-T)">
  <data key="d0">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSP-T)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">考虑运输时间的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，是本文的研究对象，涉及工件在多台机器间的加工与转运。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="统一公式">
  <data key="d0">统一公式</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">完成时间C_{i,j}的统一表达式：C_{i,j} = M_t + I_O + T_{i,j,k'} = (C_{i,j-1} + TR_{i,j,k,k'}) + W_O + T_{i,j,k'}。该公式明确定义了两种场景，并揭示了各延迟因素的作用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835930</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="瓶颈">
  <data key="d0">瓶颈</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指机器忙碌或运输时间成为限制完工时间的主要延迟因素。当机器为瓶颈时，运输时间不影响C_{i,j}；反之运输时间可能直接延迟。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="问题规模(n_max)">
  <data key="d0">问题规模(n_max)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">以最大操作数等表示的DFJSP-T问题规模，用于确定特征空间上界，例如50道工序时n_max=50。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job Transportation Time">
  <data key="d0">Job Transportation Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件运输时间，作为DFJSP-T中用于构建特征空间的行为特征之一</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transportation-Idle Feature Space">
  <data key="d0">Transportation-Idle Feature Space</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由机器空闲时间和工件运输时间构成的二维特征空间，用于MAP-Elites中的解映射</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835931</data>
