<node id="Batch Size">
  <data key="d0">Batch Size</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">SADE-QD算法在初始化和每代中生成的解的批量大小。&lt;SEP&gt;批量大小bs是DQCE算法中用于训练神经网络的样本批次大小。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845234</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
