<node id="Add_to_grid">
  <data key="d0">Add_to_grid</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">算法3，负责将新生成解更新到归档网格中的过程，根据对应单元格是否为空以及性能优劣决定替换或丢弃。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785835931</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="10J2F">
  <data key="d0">10J2F</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">10J2F 是一个典型的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题（Distributed Flexible Job-shop Scheduling Problem）测试实例。该实例由 10 个作业（或工件）和 2 个工厂构成，专门用于评估各类调度算法在分布式制造环境下的性能表现。在相关研究中，10J2F 被应用于组件分离实验与消融实验，通过对该实例的求解与结果分析，研究人员能够检验算法对多工厂、多作业协调调度的优化效果。其简洁而具有代表性的问题规模，使其成为验证新算法有效性与对比基准方法优劣的常用测试用例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845179</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
