<node id="M3">
  <data key="d0">M3</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">M3是位于工厂1车间内的一台机器设备，归属于资源组R2。该机器被描述为兼具钻床和铣床的功能，能够执行铣削、钻削等多种在线加工操作，用于工件的部件加工。在具体任务中，M3可用于加工特定工序O71，且需要工人进行操作，其可选工人集合为{W1, W2, W4}。&lt;SEP&gt;一台具体的机器，在机器交换方法示例中是O22更换后的加工机器，具有最小累积工作负荷。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-037&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-039&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-040&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-036&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
