  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总体最大完工时间">
  <data key="d0">总体最大完工时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">所有工厂完工时间的最大值，即整体项目完成时刻。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工艺顺序">
  <data key="d0">工艺顺序</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件工序之间必须遵循的先后加工次序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="空闲能耗">
  <data key="d0">空闲能耗</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器在空闲状态下消耗的能量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分支定界算法">
  <data key="d0">分支定界算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于求解MILP模型的精确算法。&lt;SEP&gt;用于求解整数规划模型的算法，由于位置索引集大小减小，该算法中的节点数得以减少。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="拓扑排序算法">
  <data key="d0">拓扑排序算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于证明约束无矛盾性的图论算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="决策变量">
  <data key="d0">决策变量</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">模型中需要决策的变量，如开始时间等。&lt;SEP&gt;决策变量，包括x_{i,j,f,m}、φ_{i,j,f,m}、u_{i,j,f,m,p}、v_{i,f}等，用于表示操作分配、机器包含、加工位置和工件工厂分配。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845210</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (6)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (6)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件(6)，确保每个工件只分配给一个工厂。&lt;SEP&gt;若作业的相邻工序使用同一资源组且该组包含机器，则它们应安排在同一机器上。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (7)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (7)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件(7)，确保一个工件分配给工厂后，其所有工序在该工厂内完成。&lt;SEP&gt;定义最大完工时间makespan的约束。&lt;SEP&gt;每个资源在任何时刻只能加工一个工序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (8)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (8)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件(8)，定义了优化目标，建立最大完工时间与各工序完工时间的关系。&lt;SEP&gt;决策变量非负性约束。&lt;SEP&gt;任何时刻同时使用的附件、刀具和切削工具数量不得超过各自总数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (9)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (9)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件(9)，建立各工厂最大完工时间与总体最大完工时间的关系。&lt;SEP&gt;任何工序的开始时间必须在作业开始时间之后。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (10)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (10)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件(10)，通过工序开始-结束时间的递归关系保证工艺顺序约束。&lt;SEP&gt;外包工序必须在给定的时间窗口内完成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (11)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (11)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件(11)，机器单工序约束，保证每台机器同时只能处理一个工序。&lt;SEP&gt;决策变量$x_{ji}^{rn}$为二进制变量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (12)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (12)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件(12)，规定机器上后续工序的开始必须在前一工序结束后。&lt;SEP&gt;决策变量$y_{jij'i'}^{rn}$为二进制变量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (13)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (13)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件(13)，描述每台机器上工序的开始与结束时间关系。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (14)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (14)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
