<node id="A Hybrid Metaheuristic Algorithm for Multiobjective Scheduling in Distributed Heterogeneous Flexible Job Shops">
  <data key="d0">A Hybrid Metaheuristic Algorithm for Multiobjective Scheduling in Distributed Heterogeneous Flexible Job Shops</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">提出D3QN-NSGA-II算法的研究论文，旨在解决分布式异构柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-000</data>
