</node>
<node id="优化调度">
  <data key="d0">优化调度</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">论文索引关键词，指寻找最优调度方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="D3QN-NSGA-II Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">D3QN-NSGA-II Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种混合元启发式算法，结合了D3QN和NSGA-II，用于解决分布式异构柔性作业车间的多目标调度问题，旨在优化完工时间和总能耗。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Three-Tiered Encoding">
  <data key="d0">Three-Tiered Encoding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种三层编码方法，包括操作选择(OS)、机器选择(MS)和工厂序列(FS)，用于表示调度问题的解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Operation Selection (OS)">
  <data key="d0">Operation Selection (OS)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">编码中的操作选择向量，定义了每个作业的操作顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Factory Sequence (FS)">
  <data key="d0">Factory Sequence (FS)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">编码中的工厂序列向量，指定每个作业被分配到的异构工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Decoding Phase">
  <data key="d0">Decoding Phase</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">解码阶段，利用FS向量分配作业到工厂，根据MS向量为每个操作选择最优机器，以确定每个操作的开始和完成时间，并计算总完工时间和总能耗。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="D3QN Training">
  <data key="d0">D3QN Training</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">D3QN(Dueling Double Deep Q-Network)训练过程，使用随机初始化来增强解的多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Random Initialization">
  <data key="d0">Random Initialization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">随机初始化策略，随机排序作业和操作序列生成OS，随机选择机器生成MS，随机分配工厂生成FS。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dual Population Evolutionary Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Dual Population Evolutionary Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">双种群进化策略，将主种群分成两个子种群，分别采用不同的遗传策略，以增强NSGA-II算法的搜索方向性和环境适应能力，避免陷入局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NSGA-II Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">NSGA-II Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">经典的多目标进化算法，作为D3QN-NSGA-II算法的基础框架，被改进以增强搜索能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reproductive Capacity Assessment Mechanism (Algorithm 1)">
  <data key="d0">Reproductive Capacity Assessment Mechanism (Algorithm 1)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">繁殖能力评估机制，通过测试种群评估每个个体的繁殖能力，将种群划分为繁殖子种群和普通子种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reproductive Subpopulation">
  <data key="d0">Reproductive Subpopulation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由具有较强繁殖能力的个体组成的子种群1，占总个体数的N×β，采用标准交叉和变异操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ordinary Subpopulation">
  <data key="d0">Ordinary Subpopulation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由剩余个体组成的子种群2，采用改进的交叉和变异操作以增强局部搜索效率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Standard POX Crossover">
  <data key="d0">Standard POX Crossover</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">标准优先操作交叉，用于繁殖子种群的过程排序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Random Two-Point Exchange Mutation">
  <data key="d0">Random Two-Point Exchange Mutation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">随机两点交换变异，用于繁殖子种群的过程排序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="UX Crossover">
  <data key="d0">UX Crossover</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">均匀交叉，用于繁殖子种群的机器选择和工厂分配。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Random Machine Replacement Mutation">
  <data key="d0">Random Machine Replacement Mutation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">随机机器替换变异，用于繁殖子种群的机器选择。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Improved POX Crossover">
  <data key="d0">Improved POX Crossover</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">改进的优先操作交叉，用于普通子种群的过程排序，如图2(a)所示。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Genetic Sequence Inversion Mutation">
  <data key="d0">Genetic Sequence Inversion Mutation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基因序列逆转变异，用于普通子种群的过程排序，如图2(b)所示。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Uniform Crossover and Mutation">
  <data key="d0">Uniform Crossover and Mutation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">均匀交叉和变异，用于普通子种群的机器选择，通过随机选择具有更短加工时间的机器来加速收敛。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785842022</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local Search Operators">
  <data key="d0">Local Search Operators</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">局部搜索算子集合，包括经典算子、破坏重建算子和关键路径算子三类，用于提高解质量并帮助算法跳出局部最优。&lt;SEP&gt;局部搜索算子，用于改进算法解的质量，在HOA-DSTM中可被移除或替换。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844617</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Positional Exchange">
  <data key="d0">Positional Exchange</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">位置交换局部搜索策略，属于经典局部搜索算子。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-14134317afd8f7893989aea5ef545cb8-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hybrid_Metaheuristic_Algorithm_for_Multiobjective_Scheduling_in_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shops-82203ead.pdf</data>
