<node id="Q. Luo et al. (2020)">
  <data key="d0">Q. Luo et al. (2020)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">当前文本来源论文，题为“An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling...”，发表于Expert Systems with Applications。&lt;SEP&gt;提出EMA算法的研究论文，发表于Expert Systems with Applications期刊，第160卷，文章编号113721。&lt;SEP&gt;一篇由Q. Luo等人于2020年发表在《Expert Systems with Applications》第160卷上的论文，文章ID为113721。&lt;SEP&gt;由Q. Luo等人发表在《Expert Systems with Applications》上的学术文章，介绍了EMA算法并在DFJSPT实例上与其他算法进行了比较。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
