<node id="柔性作业车间调度(FJSP)">
  <data key="d0">柔性作业车间调度(FJSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题，所有作业仅在一个加工地点完成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSP)">
  <data key="d0">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，作业可在多个工厂加工，但不同工厂间无作业转移。&lt;SEP&gt;具有多个优化目标和不确定性的复杂调度问题，需要做出工厂分配、机器分配和操作顺序决策。&lt;SEP&gt;一种NP难的组合优化问题，涉及在分布式制造环境中将作业分配到工厂和机器并安排操作顺序以最小化最大完工时间。&lt;SEP&gt;柔性作业车间调度问题在分布式制造环境下的扩展，工件可在多个工厂加工。大多数研究假设一个工件只能在一个工厂加工。&lt;SEP&gt;一种调度问题，涉及在分布式制造环境中将作业分配到工厂、车间和机器，并确定工序顺序。&lt;SEP&gt;分布式制造环境下的柔性作业车间调度问题，涉及多个工厂的作业分配和调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="带转移的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSPT)">
  <data key="d0">带转移的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSPT)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，允许作业在工厂间转移，优化目标包括最小化完工时间、最大工厂负荷和总能耗。&lt;SEP&gt;DFJSP的变体，允许工件在不同工厂之间转移加工，更符合现实生产需求。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大工厂负荷">
  <data key="d0">最大工厂负荷</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">各工厂的最大工作负荷，DFJSPT的优化目标之一。&lt;SEP&gt;调度模型的目标之一，表示工厂负荷的最大值，需最小化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工厂分配">
  <data key="d0">工厂分配</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSPT的子问题，为每个操作指定加工工厂。&lt;SEP&gt;将工件分配到不同工厂的决策。&lt;SEP&gt;分布式柔性作业车间调度中的关键子问题之一，指将作业分配到合适的工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作排序">
  <data key="d0">操作排序</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSPT的子问题，确定各操作在机器上的加工顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="柔性制造单元(FMU)">
  <data key="d0">柔性制造单元(FMU)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由多个企业或生产单元组成的制造单位，包含多台不同性能的机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="文化基因算法(MA)">
  <data key="d0">文化基因算法(MA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">混合进化算法与局部搜索的优化算法，具有优秀的全局和局部搜索能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="有效文化基因算法(EMA)">
  <data key="d0">有效文化基因算法(EMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出的文化基因算法，集成全局、局部和随机选择的初始化方法、交叉算子和局部搜索算子，用于求解DFJSPT。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="初始化方法">
  <data key="d0">初始化方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EMA中使用的组合全局、局部和随机选择的初始化方法，用于生成高质量初始种群。&lt;SEP&gt;用于生成初始种群的方法，遵循特定规则。&lt;SEP&gt;基于问题特征的初始化方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="局部搜索算子(LSO)">
  <data key="d0">局部搜索算子(LSO)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EMA中设计的局部搜索算子，用于提高收敛速度并充分探索解空间。&lt;SEP&gt;一种局部搜索算子，用于加速高效模因算法的收敛速度并扩展解空间，包含三种方法：LSO_SP、LSO_MPT、LSO_RTT。&lt;SEP&gt;EMA中的局部搜索组件，用于提高解的质量。&lt;SEP&gt;NMA中设计的局部搜索算子，包含操作交换方法和机器交换方法，用于增强算法的收敛速度和方案质量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="非支配排序遗传算法II (NSGA-II)">
  <data key="d0">非支配排序遗传算法II (NSGA-II)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">经典的多目标进化算法，用于与EMA进行性能对比。&lt;SEP&gt;一种经典的多目标进化算法框架，HDVMA基于此框架设计。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="非支配邻居免疫算法(NNIA)">
  <data key="d0">非支配邻居免疫算法(NNIA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于免疫原理的多目标优化算法，用于与EMA进行性能对比。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="非支配排序遗传算法III (NSGA-III)">
  <data key="d0">非支配排序遗传算法III (NSGA-III)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于参考点的多目标进化算法，用于与EMA进行性能对比。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
