<node id="ACM">
  <data key="d0">ACM</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">一个计算机领域的学术组织，曾出版第15届遗传与进化计算年会论文集。&lt;SEP&gt;出版商ACM，出版了第15届遗传与进化计算年度会议论文集。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GLR Initialization Method">
  <data key="d0">GLR Initialization Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种结合全局选择、局部选择和随机选择的初始化方法，用于生成EMA的初始种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Global Selection Method">
  <data key="d0">Global Selection Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">GLR中的全局选择方法，以最小化累计加工时间为目标，为每个工件分配工厂和机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local Selection Method">
  <data key="d0">Local Selection Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">GLR中的局部选择方法，为每个工件选择加工时间最短的工厂和机器安排。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Random Selection Method">
  <data key="d0">Random Selection Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">GLR中的随机选择方法，为每个工序随机选择一个工厂内的可用机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Proportions of Selection Methods">
  <data key="d0">Proportions of Selection Methods</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">EMA中全局选择、局部选择和随机选择方法的使用比例，分别为60%、30%和10%。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MOX">
  <data key="d0">MOX</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">多重操作交叉算子，作用于OS向量，通过交换父代OS向量中的基因片段生成子代以增加种群多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="OS Vector">
  <data key="d0">OS Vector</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">染色体中表示工序序列的向量。&lt;SEP&gt;操作序列向量，表示调度中操作的顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FA Vector">
  <data key="d0">FA Vector</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">染色体中表示工厂分配的向量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MA Vector">
  <data key="d0">MA Vector</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">染色体中表示机器分配的向量。&lt;SEP&gt;机器分配向量，表示每个操作被分配的机器和工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
