</node>
<node id="Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem">
  <data key="d0">Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，涉及工件分配、工序排序和机器分配的组合优化。&lt;SEP&gt;一种生产调度问题，涉及地理位置分布的多个柔性作业车间，是多项参考文献关注的焦点。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Algorithm 1: initializationGLR">
  <data key="d0">Algorithm 1: initializationGLR</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">GLR初始化方法的伪代码实现，输入种群大小、工序信息等，输出初始种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
