</node>
<node id="Three-layer Encoding Method">
  <data key="d0">Three-layer Encoding Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于染色体表示的三层编码方法，定义染色体由OS向量、FA向量和MA向量组成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DFJSPT (Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfers)">
  <data key="d0">DFJSPT (Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfers)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种允许作业通过转移在多个工厂间处理的扩展分布式柔性作业车间调度问题模型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DFJSP (Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem)">
  <data key="d0">DFJSP (Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">传统的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，通常假设同一作业的所有操作只能在一个工厂内处理。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DFJSPT数学模型">
  <data key="d0">DFJSPT数学模型</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">针对DFJSPT构建的数学模型，以最小化最大完工时间、工厂最大工作负荷和总能耗为优化目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工厂最大工作负荷">
  <data key="d0">工厂最大工作负荷</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一个优化目标，衡量工厂间工作负荷的均衡性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总能耗(Total Energy Consumption)">
  <data key="d0">总能耗(Total Energy Consumption)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一个优化目标，衡量整个生产过程消耗的总能源。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Effective Memetic Algorithm (EMA)">
  <data key="d0">Effective Memetic Algorithm (EMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于求解DFJSPT的文化基因算法，结合了三层编码、交叉变异、GLR初始化和基于关键路径的局部搜索。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多目标优化模型">
  <data key="d0">多目标优化模型</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">同时考虑最大完工时间、工厂工作负荷和总能耗的优化模型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="三层编码方法">
  <data key="d0">三层编码方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EMA中采用的一种个体编码方式，用于表示调度方案。&lt;SEP&gt;一种已有的编码方法，包含工厂编码、机器编码和操作序列编码三层，但会增加进化算子的复杂度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GLR初始化方法">
  <data key="d0">GLR初始化方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">结合全局、局部和随机选择的初始化策略，用于生成高质量的初始种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
