  <data key="d0">DFJSPT研究</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">关于分布式柔性作业车间调度问题带转移的研究工作，具有理论和实践意义。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="手稿">
  <data key="d0">手稿</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">本文的原始未发表手稿。&lt;SEP&gt;呈现柔性作业车间调度问题研究并提出IWOA算法的手稿。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="动态转移时间(Dynamic Transfer Time)">
  <data key="d0">动态转移时间(Dynamic Transfer Time)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器间动态变化的转移时间，是DFJSPT未来研究计划考虑的细节之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业批次运输(Batch Transportation of Jobs)">
  <data key="d0">作业批次运输(Batch Transportation of Jobs)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工厂间作业的批次运输，是DFJSPT未来研究计划考虑的细节之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-025</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GLR方法">
  <data key="d0">GLR方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种生成种群的方法，通过平衡工厂的完工时间和工作负载来分配机器给操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="逆序变异(ISM)">
  <data key="d0">逆序变异(ISM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种变异算子，通过逆序OS向量上三个连续基因来优化操作序列，以减少三个调度目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器替换变异(RMM)">
  <data key="d0">机器替换变异(RMM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种变异算子，通过替换MA向量上两个位置的机器来减少加工时间和转移时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LSO_SP">
  <data key="d0">LSO_SP</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种局部搜索方法，基于关键块交换两个关键操作的位置。&lt;SEP&gt;针对操作序列向量的局部搜索算子，以一定概率被选择执行。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LSO_MPT">
  <data key="d0">LSO_MPT</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种局部搜索方法，将当前工厂和机器转换为具有最小加工时间的其他替代方案。&lt;SEP&gt;针对机器分配向量的局部搜索算子，选择除当前机器和工厂外加工时间最短的机器和工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LSO_RTT">
  <data key="d0">LSO_RTT</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种局部搜索方法，将当前工厂和机器替换为可以最大程度减少转移时间的其他替代方案。&lt;SEP&gt;针对机器分配向量的局部搜索算子，尝试保持与前序操作的机器和工厂一致。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="高效模因算法(EMA)">
  <data key="d0">高效模因算法(EMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于分布式柔性作业车间调度问题的高效模因算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="关键操作">
  <data key="d0">关键操作</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">位于关键路径上的操作。&lt;SEP&gt;在关键工厂中，对整体调度效率有显著影响的关键路径上的操作，局部搜索算子对其进行交换或移动。&lt;SEP&gt;位于关键路径上的关键块中的操作，是操作交换方法和机器交换方法的作用对象。&lt;SEP&gt;邻域结构中共同的关键操作，驱动邻域搜索。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854080</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="关键块">
  <data key="d0">关键块</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">关键操作路径上连续在同一台机器上处理的一组操作。&lt;SEP&gt;调度方案中的关键块，包含多个工序&lt;SEP&gt;关键路径上的一组相邻操作组成的块。&lt;SEP&gt;在关键路径上的一组连续加工操作构成的块，用于局部搜索操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854052</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="父代个体P3">
  <data key="d0">父代个体P3</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在变异操作示例中使用的一个父代个体，包含OS和MA向量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="子代C3">
  <data key="d0">子代C3</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">由逆序变异算子从父代P3生成的一个子代个体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="子代C4">
  <data key="d0">子代C4</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
