  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Chrom_all">
  <data key="d0">Chrom_all</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">完整的染色体矩阵，包含工厂分配、机器分配和操作序列信息，代表一个调度解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
