</node>
<node id="Algorithm 4: localsearchMA">
  <data key="d0">Algorithm 4: localsearchMA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本地搜索主算法，接收当前调度解R1、完整染色体Chrom_all和关键操作块列表C_b，通过解码形成新解R_new，若R_new支配R1则返回R_new，否则返回R1。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Coverage Metric">
  <data key="d0">Coverage Metric</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">覆盖率指标C(A,B)，表示算法A的解集中被算法B的解支配或等于的比例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843044</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EMA">
  <data key="d0">EMA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">EMA（高效模因算法）是一种由 Q. Luo 等人提出的专门用于求解分布式柔性作业车间调度问题（DFJSP）及其带运输时间变体（DFJSPT）的高效模因算法。该算法以最小化最大完工时间、最大工作负载和总能耗为优化目标，采用全局-局部随机（GLR）初始化方法生成高质量初始种群，并通过交叉、变异和淘汰算子进行全局搜索，同时集成局部搜索算子（LSO）以增强局部开发能力。算法在 MATLAB R2016 环境中实现，数值实验中与 NNIA、NSGA-II 和 NSGA-III 等主流多目标算法进行了对比验证，表现出优越的性能。整体框架包含初始化、交叉变异、局部搜索等核心步骤，兼顾全局探索与局部精化，能有效解决考虑运输时间的复杂车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e5d47f23ff2115fdf069ba128946a7e2-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">An efficient memetic algorithm for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with transfers-316215e1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843059</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总延迟时间">
  <data key="d0">总延迟时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">所有作业的延迟时间总和，延迟时间为作业完工时间超过交货期的量。&lt;SEP&gt;所有作业完成时间超出其交货期的总量，是调度优化中最小化的目标之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="交货期">
  <data key="d0">交货期</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业的交货期限，若完工时间超过此期限则产生延迟。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Property 3.1">
  <data key="d0">Property 3.1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在DFJSP中，达到极小化最大完工时间和极小化总延迟时间之间存在不一致关系。&lt;SEP&gt;属性，指出解域非常大。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Property 3.2">
  <data key="d0">Property 3.2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">尽管DFJSP中作业加工时间的随机分布已知且独立，但完工时间的具体表达式无法确定，因此难以获得最优调度方案。&lt;SEP&gt;属性，指出由于问题的随机性难以准确评估解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="随机规划模型">
  <data key="d0">随机规划模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">为DFJSP建立的数学模型，包含目标函数(极小化最大完工期望和总延迟期望)和约束条件。&lt;SEP&gt;建立的数学模型，用于形式化描述具有随机处理时间的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;为随机分布式柔性作业车间调度问题建立的数学编程模型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="随机分布">
  <data key="d0">随机分布</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业在机器上的加工时间服从已知且相互独立的概率分布。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="交货要求">
  <data key="d0">交货要求</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">所有作业均有交货要求，若作业完工时间超过指定交货期则产生延迟。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多目标优化问题">
  <data key="d0">多目标优化问题</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">同时优化多个可能存在冲突目标的问题，DFJSP因极小化最大完工时间和极小化总延迟时间不一致而成为多目标优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="图1">
  <data key="d0">图1</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题的一个解示例插图，包含9个作业、3个工厂、每工厂3台机器。&lt;SEP&gt;展示了一个带有批处理的5作业、6机器、3步骤的柔性作业车间调度问题实例。&lt;SEP&gt;示例问题可行解的机器视角甘特图，展示各机器上操作的加工顺序和时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
