<node id="不确定性">
  <data key="d0">不确定性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">生产环境中的随机因素，如加工时间波动和机器故障，增加了调度问题的复杂性。&lt;SEP&gt;问题中的随机因素，使得精确评估解的难度增加。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="解域">
  <data key="d0">解域</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">所有可能解的集合，根据Property 3.1和推论3.1非常大。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="数学规划方法">
  <data key="d0">数学规划方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">难以在可接受时间内解决该问题的方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="搜索方法">
  <data key="d0">搜索方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">需要结合问题特征设计的高效搜索方法，以从解域中找到有希望的解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="随机扰动">
  <data key="d0">随机扰动</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">影响解质量评估的随机因素，需要减小其影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分布式制造系统">
  <data key="d0">分布式制造系统</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">具有复杂生产流程的系统，工件移动难以追踪。&lt;SEP&gt;由多个工厂协作处理产品集的生产系统，可提升生产吞吐量、操作灵活性和降低管理风险。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845129</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="生产流程">
  <data key="d0">生产流程</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式制造系统中复杂的生产过程，需要更好地模拟。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多目标进化算法(MOEA)">
  <data key="d0">多目标进化算法(MOEA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一类通过迭代搜索多个解来处理多目标优化问题的进化算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="仿真方法">
  <data key="d0">仿真方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于模拟系统行为的方法，与多目标进化算法结合处理考虑的问题。&lt;SEP&gt;未来工作将开发的仿真方法，用于求解所研究的问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="元启发式">
  <data key="d0">元启发式</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">解决复杂优化问题的高层探索算法，受到广泛关注。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="进化算法(EA)">
  <data key="d0">进化算法(EA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">模拟自然进化过程的搜索算法，因其能在每次迭代获取多个解而适用于多目标优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="随机仿真">
  <data key="d0">随机仿真</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种仿真技术，用于处理随机性，集成在评估方法中。&lt;SEP&gt;用于处理不确定性的仿真技术，评估方法使用它来计算目标值。&lt;SEP&gt;评估方法中使用的随机仿真技术。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="离散事件仿真">
  <data key="d0">离散事件仿真</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种仿真技术，用于模拟动态系统，与随机仿真结合以评估解的目标值。&lt;SEP&gt;模拟离散事件随时间变化的仿真技术，评估方法使用它来计算目标值。&lt;SEP&gt;通过模拟一系列事件来再现系统动态过程的方法，用于计算给定样本的最大完工时间和总延迟时间。&lt;SEP&gt;评估方法中使用的离散事件仿真技术。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="评估方法">
  <data key="d0">评估方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">集成随机仿真和离散事件仿真的方法，用于计算候选解的目标值。&lt;SEP&gt;与MOEA交互的方法，使用随机仿真和离散事件仿真计算个体的目标值。&lt;SEP&gt;MOEA-EM中用于评估解的评估方法，结合了随机仿真和离散事件仿真。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Corollary 3.1">
  <data key="d0">Corollary 3.1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">推论，与Property 3.1相关，指出解域很大。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF PRODUCTION RESEARCH">
  <data key="d0">INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF PRODUCTION RESEARCH</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">国际生产研究期刊，发表相关研究。&lt;SEP&gt;刊登该论文的国际生产研究期刊名称。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="迭代">
  <data key="d0">迭代</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">进化算法中的重复搜索过程，每次迭代产生新的种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="复杂约束">
  <data key="d0">复杂约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">问题中复杂的约束条件，MOEA-EM的设计考虑了这些约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工件移动">
  <data key="d0">工件移动</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件在分布式制造系统中的运动过程，由于复杂生产流程而难以追踪。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="管理者">
  <data key="d0">管理者</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">决策者，偏好获得大量非支配解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="质量评估">
  <data key="d0">质量评估</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">评估解质量的过程，受随机扰动影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="确定性环境">
  <data key="d0">确定性环境</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">不存在不确定性的环境，大多数分布式调度模型在此环境下处理。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分布式调度模型">
  <data key="d0">分布式调度模型</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">被多目标进化算法广泛应用的调度模型，通常假设确定性环境。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="逆全球化">
  <data key="d0">逆全球化</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种全球化的倒退趋势，促使企业采用分布式结构以应对不确定性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分布式柔性作业车间调度问题">
  <data key="d0">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">本研究关注的调度问题，涉及在多个工厂间分配作业并安排柔性作业车间的生产，以最小化完工时间和总延误。&lt;SEP&gt;一种将工件分配到多个工厂并安排各工厂内柔性作业车间生产任务的调度问题，旨在优化一个或多个目标。&lt;SEP&gt;一种考虑随机加工时间、多工厂、多目标(最小化期望完工时间和总延迟)的复杂调度问题&lt;SEP&gt;由Meng, Zhang, Ren, Zhang和Lv (2020)研究的FJSP变体，工件可在多个车间加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="随机作业处理时间">
  <data key="d0">随机作业处理时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业在机器上的处理时间不确定，受刀具磨损和工人熟练度等因素影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总延误">
  <data key="d0">总延误</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">所有作业延期完成的总时间，作为调度优化的另一目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="全球供应链">
  <data key="d0">全球供应链</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">全球范围内的供应网络，受逆全球化和突发事件影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="精益运营">
  <data key="d0">精益运营</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">以最低成本为准则的运营策略，在全球供应链中曾被广泛采用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="建筑设备制造系统">
  <data key="d0">建筑设备制造系统</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一个实际的制造系统，生产管磨机、回转窑、立磨机等设备，被抽象为分布式柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="个性化定制">
  <data key="d0">个性化定制</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">客户对产品定制的需求，导致作业有多条处理路径。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="刀具磨损">
  <data key="d0">刀具磨损</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">影响作业处理时间的因素之一，导致处理时间不确定。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工人熟练度">
  <data key="d0">工人熟练度</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">影响作业处理时间的因素之一，导致处理时间不确定。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基于种群的搜索过程">
  <data key="d0">基于种群的搜索过程</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">进化算法的一部分，用于搜索候选解。&lt;SEP&gt;MOEA-EM采用的搜索策略之一，用于探索整个解空间以寻找有前景的区域。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
