<node id="Programming Formulations for Solving Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem">
  <data key="d0">Programming Formulations for Solving Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇发表在《Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering》上的文章，地址为第142卷，DOI为10.1016/j.cie.2020.106347，提出了用于解决分布式柔性作业车间调度问题的编程公式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A Knowledge-Based Two-Population Optimization Algorithm for Distributed Energy-Efficient Parallel Machines Scheduling">
  <data key="d0">A Knowledge-Based Two-Population Optimization Algorithm for Distributed Energy-Efficient Parallel Machines Scheduling</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">由Z. X. Pan等人在2020年发表的文章，提出了一种基于知识的两群体优化算法，用于解决分布式能效并行机调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-017</data>
