<node id="Supply Chain Resilience Assessment with Financial Considerations: A Bayesian Network-Based Method">
  <data key="d0">Supply Chain Resilience Assessment with Financial Considerations: A Bayesian Network-Based Method</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">由W. Y. Shi和C. Mena发表的文章，提出了一种考虑财务因素的供应链韧性评估方法，基于贝叶斯网络。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-017</data>
