</node>
<node id="Hypervolume-metric">
  <data key="d0">Hypervolume-metric</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">超体积，一种多目标优化性能评价指标，评估非支配解的收敛性与多样性；值越大表示性能越好。&lt;SEP&gt;超体积，一种综合评估多目标进化算法收敛性和多样性的性能指标。&lt;SEP&gt;超体积度量，一种多目标优化性能评价指标，用于衡量非支配解集的收敛性和多样性</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Set Coverage">
  <data key="d0">Set Coverage</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">集合覆盖率度量，一种多目标优化性能评价指标</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Spread">
  <data key="d0">Spread</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">扩散度度量，一种多目标优化性能评价指标，用于衡量解集的分布广度&lt;SEP&gt;散布性指标，多目标优化性能指标。&lt;SEP&gt;多目标优化中的性能指标，分布性指标，衡量解集在目标空间中的分布均匀性和广泛性。&lt;SEP&gt;分布性指标，用于评估多目标优化算法所得解集在帕累托前沿上的分布均匀程度。&lt;SEP&gt;分布性指标，一种评价多目标优化算法解集分布均匀性的指标</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
