<node id="Nemenyi test">
  <data key="d0">Nemenyi test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种后续检验方法，与Friedman检验结合使用，以确定算法间性能差异的显著性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wilcoxon signed rank test">
  <data key="d0">Wilcoxon signed rank test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种配对样本非参数统计检验，用于比较两个算法在多个实例上的性能。&lt;SEP&gt;威尔科克森符号秩检验，一种非参数统计检验方法，用于成对比较两个算法性能的显著性。&lt;SEP&gt;Wilcoxon符号秩检验是一种非参数统计检验方法，用于检验NMA与其他算法结果之间的显著性差异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-031</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
