<node id="A Self-Learning Discrete Jaya Algorithm for Multiobjective Energy-Eficient Distributed No-Idle Flow-Shop Scheduling Problem in Heterogeneous Factory System">
  <data key="d0">A Self-Learning Discrete Jaya Algorithm for Multiobjective Energy-Eficient Distributed No-Idle Flow-Shop Scheduling Problem in Heterogeneous Factory System</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇期刊文章，发表于2022年的《IEEE Transactions on Cybernetics》第52卷第12期，页码12675-12686，DOI为10.1109/TCYB.2021.3086181，提出了一种自学习离散Jaya算法，用于异构工厂系统中多目标节能分布式无空闲流水车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A Cooperative Whale Optimization Algorithm for Energy-Eficient Scheduling of the Distributed Blocking Flow-Shop with Sequence-Dependent Setup Time">
  <data key="d0">A Cooperative Whale Optimization Algorithm for Energy-Eficient Scheduling of the Distributed Blocking Flow-Shop with Sequence-Dependent Setup Time</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇期刊文章，发表于2023年的《Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering》第178卷，DOI为10.1016/j.cie.2023.109082，提出了一种合作鲸鱼优化算法，用于具有序列相关准备时间的分布式阻塞流水车间节能调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A Cooperative Coevolution Algorithm for Multi-Objective Fuzzy Distributed Hybrid Flow Shop">
  <data key="d0">A Cooperative Coevolution Algorithm for Multi-Objective Fuzzy Distributed Hybrid Flow Shop</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇期刊文章，发表于2020年的《Knowledge-Based Systems》第194卷，DOI为10.1016/j.knosys.2020.105536，提出了一种合作协同进化算法，用于多目标模糊分布式混合流水车间调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
