<node id="加权和法">
  <data key="d0">加权和法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种将多目标问题转化为单目标问题的方法，通过分配权重向量(1.0, 0.0)、(0.5, 0.5)和(0.0, 1.0)来组合目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="权重向量(1.0, 0.0)">
  <data key="d0">权重向量(1.0, 0.0)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">用于加权和法的一个权重向量，表示完全侧重于第一个目标(完工时间)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="权重向量(0.5, 0.5)">
  <data key="d0">权重向量(0.5, 0.5)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">用于加权和法的一个权重向量，代表两个目标同等重要。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="权重向量(0.0, 1.0)">
  <data key="d0">权重向量(0.0, 1.0)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">用于加权和法的一个权重向量，表示完全侧重于第二个目标(总延误时间)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="施工设备制造过程">
  <data key="d0">施工设备制造过程</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">用于测试的案例，涉及将10个工件分配到两个工厂，每个工厂有三台机器，每个工件有三个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="调度问题实例">
  <data key="d0">调度问题实例</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">从施工设备制造过程中构建的9个调度问题实例，分别包含5、7和10个工件，用于测试CPLEX和MOEA-EM。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="表16">
  <data key="d0">表16</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">附录中的表格，提供工件处理时间和截止日期等基本数据。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
