<node id="Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation">
  <data key="d0">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇发表于International Journal of Production Research的学术文章，内容涉及随机分布式柔性作业车间调度、多目标进化算法和仿真评估。&lt;SEP&gt;由Y. Fu, K. Gao, L. Wang, M. Huang, Y.-C. Liang, H. Dong撰写的论文，发表在Int. J. Prod. Res., 63(1), 2025, 86–103, https://doi.org/10.1080/00207543.2024.2356628。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-063</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stochastic Distributed Flexible Job Shops">
  <data key="d0">Stochastic Distributed Flexible Job Shops</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">随机分布式柔性作业车间，是一类具有不确定性和分布式特征的柔性制造调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-objective Evolutionary Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Multi-objective Evolutionary Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">多目标进化算法，用于求解文章中的调度优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Simulation Evaluation">
  <data key="d0">Simulation Evaluation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">仿真评估方法，用于评价文章所提算法的性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
