  <data key="d0">Taiwan</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">中国台湾地区。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="探索搜索阶段">
  <data key="d0">探索搜索阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MOEA-EM算法中进行全局搜索的阶段，旨在探索解空间的不同区域。&lt;SEP&gt;MOEA-EM的第一阶段，旨在从整个搜索空间探索有希望的区域，采用遗传操作产生新个体，所有个体在种群P和外部档案E中均可选作父代。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="开发搜索阶段">
  <data key="d0">开发搜索阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MOEA-EM算法中进行局部搜索的阶段，旨在对已有解进行精细改进。&lt;SEP&gt;MOEA-EM的第二阶段，采用迭代局部搜索方法(ILSM)改进有利个体，利用四种邻域结构寻找新个体，并使用五个条件判断替换。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="遗传操作">
  <data key="d0">遗传操作</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种产生新个体的操作，包括交叉和变异，具有提升全局搜索能力的优势，在探索搜索阶段使用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变异操作">
  <data key="d0">变异操作</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">遗传操作的一部分，以概率p_m对新个体执行变异，包含四种邻域结构：随机分配作业到另一工厂、交换两个工厂索引、交换两个作业索引、插入作业索引。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="迭代局部搜索方法">
  <data key="d0">迭代局部搜索方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于改进有利个体的方法，简称ILSM，采用四种邻域结构，使用五个条件判断邻域个体是否替代当前个体，不使用退火方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="模拟退火方法">
  <data key="d0">模拟退火方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种优化方法，本文中作为对比，ILSM与其不同之处在于不使用退火方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="外部档案E">
  <data key="d0">外部档案E</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">MOEA-EM中的外部档案，存储非支配个体，在探索搜索阶段作为父代选择池之一，并在开发搜索阶段被更新。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工厂分配串">
  <data key="d0">工厂分配串</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">双链整数串的第一部分，长度为作业数，每个位置的值表示对应作业分配的工厂索引。&lt;SEP&gt;解表示的一部分，指定每个作业分配的工厂，是交叉和变异操作的直接操作对象。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业序列串">
  <data key="d0">作业序列串</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">双链整数串的第二部分，是一个作业索引的排列，确定了每个工厂内作业的加工顺序。&lt;SEP&gt;解表示的一部分，指定每个工厂内作业的加工顺序，是交叉和变异操作的直接操作对象。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="五个条件">
  <data key="d0">五个条件</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">迭代局部搜索方法中用于判断邻域个体是否替代当前个体的五个条件，涉及两个目标值的差值和接受概率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="I_M">
  <data key="d0">I_M</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">开发搜索阶段中产生的新个体数量，等于2·τ·n。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="L_e">
  <data key="d0">L_e</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">解的长度，对于所研究问题等于2·n。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="r">
  <data key="d0">r</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在五个条件中使用的随机数，从区间[0,1]生成。&lt;SEP&gt;参数r，表示总操作数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="t_0">
  <data key="d0">t_0</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">温度系数，从区间[0.30, 0.75]生成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="二进制选择方法">
  <data key="d0">二进制选择方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在探索搜索阶段用于选择集群和选择种群P中个体的方法，源自Fu et al. 2018。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基于顺序的交叉方法">
  <data key="d0">基于顺序的交叉方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于作业序列串的交叉方法，源自Fu et al. 2018，通过随机选择两个切割点进行作业重组。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="支配与拥挤距离方法">
  <data key="d0">支配与拥挤距离方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于非支配排序和拥挤距离的个体选择方法，用于从合并种群中选择Q个个体构造下一代种群，源自Deb et al. 2002。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deb et al. 2002">
  <data key="d0">Deb et al. 2002</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Deb等人于2002年发表的文献，提出了用于多目标进化算法中个体选择的支配与拥挤距离方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fu et al. 2018">
  <data key="d0">Fu et al. 2018</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Fu等人于2018年发表的文献，提供了二进制选择方法和基于顺序的交叉方法，被MOEA-EM的探索搜索阶段采用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="表A14">
  <data key="d0">表A14</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">附录中的表格，报告了各算法在IGD指标上的结果。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="表A15">
  <data key="d0">表A15</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">附录中的表格，报告了各算法在Hypervolume指标上的结果。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="27个测试实例">
  <data key="d0">27个测试实例</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">一组包含六个工厂的随机分布式柔性作业车间调度问题测试实例，共27个。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="双链整数串">
  <data key="d0">双链整数串</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MOEA-EM中个体的编码表示方法，由工厂分配串和作业序列串两部分构成，用于确定工厂分配与作业顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="评价方法">
  <data key="d0">评价方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于将个体解码为完整调度并评估其期望最大完工时间和总延迟时间的算法组件，结合了随机模拟与离散事件仿真。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="随机模拟">
  <data key="d0">随机模拟</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">通过生成大量样本并取平均值来估计概率函数的方法，在MOEA-EM中用于评估解的期望目标值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最早交货期规则">
  <data key="d0">最早交货期规则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种启发式规则，将所有作业按照交货期从小到大排序，用于生成初始种群的作业序列串。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="外部存档E">
  <data key="d0">外部存档E</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">用于存储每一代产生的非支配个体的集合，采用帕累托规则进行更新。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="帕累托规则">
  <data key="d0">帕累托规则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于非支配排序的选择规则，用于更新外部存档，保留非支配个体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="参数化事件图方法">
  <data key="d0">参数化事件图方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Choi和Kang(2013)提出的一种用于描述离散事件仿真过程的事件图方法，用于说明系统的离散事件仿真流程。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="启发式规则">
  <data key="d0">启发式规则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在离散事件仿真中，用于模拟工件在工厂间移动的规则，以再现生产流程。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="EABS">
  <data key="d0">EABS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">外部档案搜索，利用ILSM对E中的个体进行精细搜索，以强化MOEA-EM的开发性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ILSM">
  <data key="d0">ILSM</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">迭代局部搜索方法，在MOEA-EM中用于实现EABS，并使用了来自BMSA的五种接受条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population-based Search">
  <data key="d0">Population-based Search</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">MOEA-EM中的基于种群的搜索过程，与外部档案搜索交替执行。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Evaluation Method">
  <data key="d0">Evaluation Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">评估方法，用于评估种群中新生成个体的目标值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Crossover Method">
  <data key="d0">Crossover Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">交叉操作，NSGA-II和MOEA/D采用与MOEA-EM相同的交叉方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mutation Method">
  <data key="d0">Mutation Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">变异操作，NSGA-II、MOEA/D和BMSA采用与MOEA-EM相同的变异方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-458859b0b2943b04036593edf0f47c6d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Scheduling stochastic distributed flexible job shops using an multi-objective evolutionary algorithm with simulation evaluation-1b3e14db.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785843068</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Decoding Methods">
