<node id="Exact Methods">
  <data key="d0">Exact Methods</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">精确求解方法，在求解小规模分布式柔性作业车间调度问题时效率高，但面对大规模问题求解时间过长。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
