  <data key="d0">Priority-Preserving Order-Based Crossover (POX)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种保持优先顺序的基于顺序的交叉方法，用于OS层中维持个体合法性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Two-Point Crossover">
  <data key="d0">Two-Point Crossover</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种交叉方法，在MA层中与均匀交叉组合使用，以避免种群早熟。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Random Reset Mutation Operator">
  <data key="d0">Random Reset Mutation Operator</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种变异算子，在MA层中使用，通过随机重置来进一步维持种群多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dual-RL">
  <data key="d0">Dual-RL</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种双重强化学习机制，用于在HOA-DSTM的进化阶段动态选择交叉概率P_c和变异概率P_m。&lt;SEP&gt;Dual-RL是一种双强化学习机制，能够动态智能调整交叉概率P_c和变异概率P_m，以提高进化效率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_c">
  <data key="d0">P_c</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">交叉概率，由双强化学习在线调整的参数。&lt;SEP&gt;交叉操作中的重要参数，表示交叉概率。过小减慢种群进化，过大会破坏高质量个体。&lt;SEP&gt;P_c是交叉概率，由Dual-RL动态调整。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_m">
  <data key="d0">P_m</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">变异概率，由双强化学习在线调整的参数。&lt;SEP&gt;变异操作中的重要参数，表示变异概率。过小降低多样性，过大会影响最优解形成。&lt;SEP&gt;P_m是变异概率，由Dual-RL动态调整。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Conversion Factor Λ">
  <data key="d0">Conversion Factor Λ</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">用于决定强化学习算法切换的因子，当Λ大于0时，另一种算法提供更好的奖励。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Bellman Optimality Principle">
  <data key="d0">Bellman Optimality Principle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">最优控制原理，Q-learning基于该原理迭代优化Q值以推导最优策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population P">
  <data key="d0">Population P</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在HOA-DSTM的进化阶段，由种群均分得到的一个子种群，个体与当前最优个体和优等个体进行交叉以学习精英知识。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population Q">
  <data key="d0">Population Q</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在HOA-DSTM的进化阶段，由种群均分得到的另一个子种群，个体随机分为两个亚群Q1和Q2进行交叉以学习种群知识。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subpopulation Q1">
  <data key="d0">Subpopulation Q1</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">从Population Q中随机划分出的一个亚群，与Q2进行交叉。</data>
