<node id="Enhanced Genetic Algorithm (GA) Framework">
  <data key="d0">Enhanced Genetic Algorithm (GA) Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">De Giovanni和Pezzella提出的增强遗传算法框架，针对DFJSP设计，通过引入新颖的局部搜索算子迭代优化进化种群中的精英候选解，以提高解质量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid Genetic Tabu Search Algorithm (HGTSA)">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Genetic Tabu Search Algorithm (HGTSA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Xie等人提出的混合算法，融合遗传算法和禁忌搜索，采用面向工厂的算子和自适应邻域增强搜索协同，用于解决DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Simulated Annealing Boosted Coevolutionary Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Simulated Annealing Boosted Coevolutionary Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhang等人设计的算法，采用三整数编码和多群体启发式，结合统一全局局部机制优化集成生产物流，用于解决DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Improved Memetic Algorithm (IMA)">
  <data key="d0">Improved Memetic Algorithm (IMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Luo等人提出的改进模因算法，采用简化的两层编码、启发式解码和自适应邻域搜索，用于解决带工人安排的DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reformed Memetic Algorithm (RMA)">
  <data key="d0">Reformed Memetic Algorithm (RMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhu等人提出的重构模因算法，采用负载均衡初始化和增强的遗传局部搜索，解决考虑订单取消的DFJSP中的资源低效问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multidimensional Probabilistic Model-Based Evolutionary Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Multidimensional Probabilistic Model-Based Evolutionary Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhang等人提出的进化算法，采用混合初始化策略、联合概率模型和问题特定邻域算子，用于解决节能DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Improved Gray Wolf Optimizer (IGWO)">
  <data key="d0">Improved Gray Wolf Optimizer (IGWO)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Li等人提出的改进灰狼优化器，集成新颖编解码方案、混合交叉算子和关键工厂驱动的局部搜索，用于DFJSP的求解增强和细化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deep Q-Network (DQN)-Guided Variable Neighborhood Search">
  <data key="d0">Deep Q-Network (DQN)-Guided Variable Neighborhood Search</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhang等人提出的方法，集成61个调度特征与六种策略，通过仿真环境训练，结合贪婪初始化和关键路径驱动的搜索算子提高解质量，用于DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Surprisingly Popular-Based Adaptive Memetic Algorithm (SPAMA)">
  <data key="d0">Surprisingly Popular-Based Adaptive Memetic Algorithm (SPAMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Li等人提出的算法，创新地采用基于惊异度反馈的自适应算子选择模型，以增强收敛性和能效，用于DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MILP Model and Multiobjective Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">MILP Model and Multiobjective Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhang等人提出的混合整数线性规划模型和多目标人工蜂群算法，融合Q学习和问题特定启发式，提高搜索效率，用于带维护和运输的DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Q-Learning-Based Multiobjective GA (QL-IMOGA)">
  <data key="d0">Q-Learning-Based Multiobjective GA (QL-IMOGA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Yang等人提出的基于Q学习的多目标遗传算法，通过Q学习自适应调整关键参数，提高收敛速度和解质量，用于带转移的DFJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multiagent Adaptive Scheduling Framework">
  <data key="d0">Multiagent Adaptive Scheduling Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Wang提出的多智能体自适应调度框架，融合聚类机制和响应式搜索策略，在增强Q学习架构内优化动态作业车间调度的操作决策。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Historical Information-Based Iterated Greedy Algorithm (HIG)">
  <data key="d0">Historical Information-Based Iterated Greedy Algorithm (HIG)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">He等人提出的算法，创新地集成历史信息进行解构造，采用基于组和基于工件的插入以及基于支配准则的交换算子，用于生产调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cooperative Iterated Greedy Algorithm Based on Q-Learning (CIG)">
  <data key="d0">Cooperative Iterated Greedy Algorithm Based on Q-Learning (CIG)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Bao等人提出的算法，核心创新是双层Q学习机制联合优化制造周期和能耗，用于分布式阻塞流水车间的节能调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid Optimization Approach with Adversarial Generative Learning and Dueling DDQN">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Optimization Approach with Adversarial Generative Learning and Dueling DDQN</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Zhao等人提出的混合优化方法，利用对抗生成学习进行全局解空间探索，使用决斗双深度Q网络进行局部搜索算子选择。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hierarchical RL Framework with GNN and MLP">
  <data key="d0">Hierarchical RL Framework with GNN and MLP</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Lei等人提出的分层强化学习框架，结合图神经网络和多层感知器，近实时解决大规模动态柔性作业车间调度，在不确定环境下实现自适应子问题协调。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Q-Learning-Enhanced Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Q-Learning-Enhanced Artificial Bee Colony Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Li等人设计的算法，集成NEH初始化、自适应邻域选择、全面搜索策略和基于插入的局部陷阱避免，用于解决置换流水车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DRL-Based Approach with Heterogeneous Graph Neural Network">
  <data key="d0">DRL-Based Approach with Heterogeneous Graph Neural Network</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Song等人提出的深度强化学习方法，集成复合操作-机器决策和异构图神经网络，建模复杂调度状态关系，用于柔性作业车间调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Du [36]">
  <data key="d0">Du [36]</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">研究人员，提出了一种混合多目标优化算法，利用3-D编码解决分时电价下的多目标FJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cheng [40]">
  <data key="d0">Cheng [40]</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">研究人员，针对带自动导引车(AGV)的节能FJSP，提出了一种新型MILP模型和模仿学习辅助的多群进化算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Meng [41]">
  <data key="d0">Meng [41]</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">研究人员，针对带AGV的FJSP，提出了一种新型约束规划(CP)模型和CP辅助的元启发式算法框架。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hybrid Multiobjective Optimization Algorithm with 3-D Encoding">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Multiobjective Optimization Algorithm with 3-D Encoding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Du等人提出的混合多目标优化算法，利用3-D编码方案，旨在优化分时电价下的多目标FJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MILP Model and Imitation Learning-Assisted Multipopulation Evolutionary Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">MILP Model and Imitation Learning-Assisted Multipopulation Evolutionary Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Cheng等人提出的方法，包含一个新型混合整数线性规划模型和一个模仿学习辅助的多群进化算法，用于优化带AGV的节能FJSP的制造周期和能耗。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint Programming (CP) Model and CP-Assisted Metaheuristic Algorithm Framework">
  <data key="d0">Constraint Programming (CP) Model and CP-Assisted Metaheuristic Algorithm Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Meng等人提出的框架，包含一个新型约束规划模型和一个CP辅助的元启发式算法，用于解决带AGV的FJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Λ">
  <data key="d0">Λ</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Λ 是另一算法奖励值e_reward与实际使用算法奖励值a_reward的差值，初始值为0，用于判断强化学习算法切换。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="e_reward">
  <data key="d0">e_reward</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">e_reward表示另一强化学习算法的奖励值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="a_reward">
  <data key="d0">a_reward</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">a_reward表示实际使用的强化学习算法的奖励值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="RL切换">
  <data key="d0">RL切换</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">RL切换是根据 Λ 值在不同强化学习算法间进行转换的过程，实现种群从利用到探索的切换。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="马尔可夫决策过程">
  <data key="d0">马尔可夫决策过程</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">马尔可夫决策过程是一种数学框架，用于定义Dual-RL的状态、动作和奖励。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="状态">
  <data key="d0">状态</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">智能体在时刻t所处的环境状态，用s_t表示，是动作选择的依据。&lt;SEP&gt;状态是马尔可夫决策过程的要素，指示种群信息，由进化种群适应度特征构建。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="f_nor">
  <data key="d0">f_nor</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">f_nor是归一化的种群平均适应度，计算为当前代所有个体适应度之和与初始代之比。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="d_nor">
  <data key="d0">d_nor</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">d_nor是归一化的种群多样性，衡量个体适应度值的离散程度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="m_nor">
  <data key="d0">m_nor</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">m_nor是归一化的最优个体适应度，计算为当前代最优适应度与初始代最优适应度之比。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="S_pop">
  <data key="d0">S_pop</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">S_pop是种群状态值，由f_nor、d_nor和m_nor通过权重w1、w2、w3加权组合而成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="w1">
  <data key="d0">w1</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">w1是f_nor在S_pop计算中的权重，表示平均适应度的相对重要性，在HOA-DSTM中设为0.35。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="w2">
  <data key="d0">w2</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">w2是d_nor在S_pop计算中的权重，表示种群多样性的相对重要性，在HOA-DSTM中设为0.35。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="w3">
  <data key="d0">w3</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">w3是m_nor在S_pop计算中的权重，表示最优适应度的相对重要性，在HOA-DSTM中设为0.3。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="智能体">
  <data key="d0">智能体</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在双强化学习中，通过执行动作与环境交互的决策实体，负责选择动作以调整参数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="动作集">
  <data key="d0">动作集</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">包含十个动作的集合，用于调整交叉概率P_c和变异概率P_m。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="交叉概率P_c">
  <data key="d0">交叉概率P_c</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">控制交叉操作的概率参数，取值范围从0.4到1，间隔为0.06，由智能体调整。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变异概率P_m">
  <data key="d0">变异概率P_m</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">控制变异操作的概率参数，取值范围从0.01到0.3，间隔为0.03，由智能体调整。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ε-贪婪策略">
  <data key="d0">ε-贪婪策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种在探索与利用之间平衡的动作选择策略，根据贪婪率ε和随机值r决定是选择最优动作还是随机动作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="奖励信号">
  <data key="d0">奖励信号</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">环境反馈给智能体的标量信号，用于衡量智能体执行动作后的效果，指导后续学习。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="奖励值reward_c">
  <data key="d0">奖励值reward_c</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">根据当前迭代与上一迭代个体最佳适应度变化率计算的奖励值，用于评估交叉概率P_c的调整效果。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="奖励值reward_m">
  <data key="d0">奖励值reward_m</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">根据当前迭代与上一迭代种群平均适应度变化率计算的奖励值，用于评估变异概率P_m的调整效果。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="综合奖励值reward_i">
  <data key="d0">综合奖励值reward_i</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">奖励值reward_c和reward_m的平均值，作为每次迭代的综合奖励指标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="环境">
  <data key="d0">环境</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">强化学习中与智能体交互的外部系统，提供状态和奖励反馈。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="双强化学习">
  <data key="d0">双强化学习</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种在线调整交叉概率和变异概率的强化学习方法，交替使用SARSA和Q学习，利用奖励反馈平衡探索与利用并维持遗传多样性和精英保留。&lt;SEP&gt;一种分层优化算法中的组件，采用双缓存同步调优机制，通过强化学习实现参数的自适应调整。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fuqing Zhao">
  <data key="d0">Fuqing Zhao</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">兰州理工大学计算机与通信技术学院教授，本文的通讯作者之一。&lt;SEP&gt;1994年在兰州理工大学获得本科学位，2006年获得博士学位。自1998年起在兰州理工大学计算机科学与技术系工作，2012年晋升为正教授。2009年在西安交通大学制造系统工程国家重点实验室进行博士后研究。曾作为访问学者在埃克塞特大学制造企业中心和佐治亚理工学院制造研究所交流。出版两本学术著作，发表论文90余篇。研究方向为智能优化与调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-016</data>
