<node id="进化阶段">
  <data key="d0">进化阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">HOA-DSTM的一个阶段，在交叉过程中使用精英保留策略保留高质量个体，并利用双强化学习机制调整交叉和变异概率。&lt;SEP&gt;HOA-DSTM算法的主要阶段，在此阶段进行个体选择、种群分割、异质交叉和变异，并由双强化学习在线调整交叉和变异概率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="优化阶段">
  <data key="d0">优化阶段</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">HOA-DSTM的一个阶段，包括带有七种算子的局部搜索和用于优化种群中精英个体的双缓存同步调节机制(DSTM)。&lt;SEP&gt;HOA-DSTM算法的阶段，在此阶段使用七个局部搜索算子探索个体邻域，并通过DSTM进一步优化当前最优个体。&lt;SEP&gt;算法中独立演化各子问题并执行局部搜索的阶段。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="精英保留策略">
  <data key="d0">精英保留策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种在进化阶段交叉过程中保留高质量个体知识的策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="双强化学习机制(dual-RL)">
  <data key="d0">双强化学习机制(dual-RL)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于转换因子的机制，用于调整交叉概率和变异概率以提高优化效率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="转换因子">
  <data key="d0">转换因子</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在双强化学习机制中用于调整交叉概率和变异概率的因子。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变异概率">
  <data key="d0">变异概率</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">遗传算法中控制变异操作发生概率的参数，在HOA-DSTM中由双强化学习机制调整。&lt;SEP&gt;KTCE的关键参数之一，设置了四个水平：0.05、0.1、0.15、0.2。&lt;SEP&gt;MCPEA算法的参数之一，表示个体发生变异的概率，候选值为0.05、0.10、0.15、0.20。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="局部搜索与七种算子">
  <data key="d0">局部搜索与七种算子</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">优化阶段中使用七种局部搜索算子对解进行改进的方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DFJSP编码方案的耦合特性">
  <data key="d0">DFJSP编码方案的耦合特性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP编码方案中操作序列与工厂分配之间的关联特性，被DSTM利用来调整解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作序列(OS)">
  <data key="d0">操作序列(OS)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP编码方案中的一个组成部分，表示作业的操作顺序。&lt;SEP&gt;个体编码中表示各作业操作加工顺序的部分。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工厂分配(FA)">
  <data key="d0">工厂分配(FA)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP编码方案中的一个组成部分，表示作业分配到哪个工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基准数据集">
  <data key="d0">基准数据集</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">用于评估HOA-DSTM性能的标准测试数据集，实验结果表明HOA-DSTM优于现有算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A Hierarchical Optimization Algorithm With Dual-Cache Synced Tuning Mechanism for Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem">
  <data key="d0">A Hierarchical Optimization Algorithm With Dual-Cache Synced Tuning Mechanism for Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">本文所提出的论文，提出HOA-DSTM算法解决DFJSP问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844603</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="混合分区初始化">
  <data key="d0">混合分区初始化</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种初始化方法，用于生成多样化和高质量的初始种群，同时建立强化学习的状态-动作集。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-004</data>
