<node id="MILP Model">
  <data key="d0">MILP Model</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">为DFJSP建立的混合整数线性规划模型，包含目标函数和约束(2)-(8)。&lt;SEP&gt;一种混合整数线性规划模型，用于捕捉DRFJSP-OJP的特征，包含目标函数和约束条件。&lt;SEP&gt;混合整数线性规划模型，通过引入惩罚项反映优先级约束。&lt;SEP&gt;为DRFJSP-OJP建立的混合整数线性规划模型，用于精确映射所有约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (2)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (2)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件-工厂分配约束，强制每个工件恰好分配到一个工厂。&lt;SEP&gt;当为工序$O_{ji}$选择资源时，准备与加工时间随之确定。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (3)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (3)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">双重约束：要求同一工件的所有操作在同一工厂加工，且每个操作只分配给一台机器。&lt;SEP&gt;任何工序的准备和加工时间约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraint (4)">
  <data key="d0">Constraint (4)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">时序优先约束，确保工件操作按照预定技术顺序依次加工。&lt;SEP&gt;作业的各工序操作时间需满足顺序约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Constraints (5) and (6)">
  <data key="d0">Constraints (5) and (6)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器能力约束，共同防止同一台机器上安排的操作在时间上重叠。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subproblem: Job Allocation">
  <data key="d0">Subproblem: Job Allocation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP的子问题之一：将工件分配到不同的工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subproblem: Operation Sequencing">
  <data key="d0">Subproblem: Operation Sequencing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP的子问题之一：安排每个工厂中每个操作的操作序列。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Subproblem: Machine Selection">
  <data key="d0">Subproblem: Machine Selection</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP的子问题之一：为每个操作选择一台机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HOA with Dual-Cache Synced Tuning Mechanism for DFJSP">
  <data key="d0">HOA with Dual-Cache Synced Tuning Mechanism for DFJSP</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇已被接收即将发表的期刊文章，提出HOA-DSTM算法解决DFJSP。&lt;SEP&gt;本文标题所示的文章，提出了针对分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSP)的带有双缓存同步调节机制的分层优化算法(HOA)。作者包括赵付清等。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assumption 1: All machines ready at the beginning">
  <data key="d0">Assumption 1: All machines ready at the beginning</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP假设所有工厂中的所有机器在加工开始时都处于可用状态。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assumption 2: Machine processes one job at a time, operation selects one machine">
  <data key="d0">Assumption 2: Machine processes one job at a time, operation selects one machine</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">每台机器一次只能加工一个工件，每个操作只能从给定工厂的机器集合M_f中选择一台机器加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assumption 3: No preemption of jobs">
  <data key="d0">Assumption 3: No preemption of jobs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">已经开始在机器上加工的工件不允许抢占或中断。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assumption 4: Deterministic processing times">
  <data key="d0">Assumption 4: Deterministic processing times</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">所有加工时间都是确定性的已知值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assumption 5: Each job processed in only one factory">
  <data key="d0">Assumption 5: Each job processed in only one factory</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">每个工件只能在一个工厂中完成所有加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assumption 6: Same machine types in each factory">
  <data key="d0">Assumption 6: Same machine types in each factory</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">每个工厂中的机器类型相同。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Assumption 7: Excludes setup times, breakdowns, dynamic events, transportation constraints">
  <data key="d0">Assumption 7: Excludes setup times, breakdowns, dynamic events, transportation constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP不考虑设置时间、机器故障、动态事件、运输约束等其他制约因素。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ZHAO">
  <data key="d0">ZHAO</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">论文作者，提出HOA-DSTM算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Nomenclature">
  <data key="d0">Nomenclature</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">DFJSP中定义的符号列表所在的术语表部分。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IAHA">
  <data key="d0">IAHA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种先进算法，引入混合解码策略，采用双层编码方案同时表示工厂和作业，并在局部优化中自适应集成可变邻域搜索机制。&lt;SEP&gt;一种优化算法，作为对比算法之一参与性能评估。&lt;SEP&gt;IAHA是一种对比算法，在Wilcoxon检验中其R^+高于R^-，Z值绝对值超过5，表明HOA-DSTM显著优于IAHA。&lt;SEP&gt;改进的自适应混合算法，由Wang et al. [18]提出，采用双层编码混合解码规则和自适应变邻域搜索策略，优化跨工厂任务分配，在标准测试算例中取得了突破记录的最优解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HGTSA">
  <data key="d0">HGTSA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种结合遗传算法全面探索能力和禁忌搜索集中开发潜力的算法，包含两个定制的遗传算子以增加种群异质性，并提出新的邻域框架以在更广泛的探索域中寻求最优解。&lt;SEP&gt;一种优化算法，作为对比算法之一参与性能评估。&lt;SEP&gt;HGTSA是一种对比算法，在Wilcoxon检验中其R^+高于R^-，Z值绝对值超过5，表明HOA-DSTM显著优于HGTSA。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="GA-VNS-CP">
  <data key="d0">GA-VNS-CP</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种分两阶段执行的方法，在混合元启发式阶段结合遗传算法与可变邻域搜索以增强局部搜索，随后进入约束规划阶段以扩展和细化解。&lt;SEP&gt;一种优化算法，作为对比算法之一参与性能评估。&lt;SEP&gt;GA-VNS-CP是一种对比算法，在Wilcoxon检验中其R^+值较低，Z值较小，整体表现逊于HOA-DSTM。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-011&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wilcoxon检验">
  <data key="d0">Wilcoxon检验</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Wilcoxon检验是一种非参数统计方法，通过秩分析比较两组相关或独立数据的中位数差异，并评估分布差异的显著性。&lt;SEP&gt;一种统计检验方法，用于比较算法性能的显著性差异，结果显示IWOA的Avg指标在所有实例中不显著劣于对比算法，且在大多数实例中表现出显著优势。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P值">
  <data key="d0">P值</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">P值是Wilcoxon检验中用于判断差异显著性的概率值，当P值小于 α 时表示存在显著差异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="α">
  <data key="d0">α</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">α 是显著性水平，在统计检验中作为阈值，文中取0.05或0.1以判断差异显著性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="R^+">
  <data key="d0">R^+</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">R^+表示Wilcoxon检验中HOA-DSTM优于对比算法的秩和。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="R^-">
  <data key="d0">R^-</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">R^-表示Wilcoxon检验中HOA-DSTM劣于对比算法的秩和。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Z值">
  <data key="d0">Z值</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Z值是Wilcoxon检验中的标准化统计量，其绝对值越大表明差异越显著。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Friedman检验">
  <data key="d0">Friedman检验</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Friedman检验用于验证多种算法的同质性，并通过后验检验和临界差异(CD)区分算法之间的差异。&lt;SEP&gt;一种非参数统计检验方法，用于对六种算法在20个实例上的Makespan平均值进行整体排名比较。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="后验检验">
  <data key="d0">后验检验</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">后验检验是Friedman检验的一部分，用于区分不同算法之间的差异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="临界差异(CD)">
  <data key="d0">临界差异(CD)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">临界差异(CD)是Friedman检验中判断算法差异是否显著的阈值，通过公式(22)计算。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="公式(22)">
  <data key="d0">公式(22)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">公式(22)给出了计算临界差异(CD)的表达式：CD = q_α * sqrt(k(k+1)/(6N))，其中q_α 是临界值，k是算法数，N是实例数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="q_α">
  <data key="d0">q_α</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">q_α 是从表格中查得的临界值，用于计算临界差异(CD)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="置信水平">
  <data key="d0">置信水平</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">置信水平(1-α)表示差异显著性的可信度，文中使用了95%和90%置信水平。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ZHAO et al.">
  <data key="d0">ZHAO et al.</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">ZHAO et al. 是本文的作者，提出了HOA-DSTM算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="HOA WITH DUAL-CACHE SYNCED TUNING MECHANISM FOR DFJSP">
  <data key="d0">HOA WITH DUAL-CACHE SYNCED TUNING MECHANISM FOR DFJSP</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">本文的标题为 'HOA WITH DUAL-CACHE SYNCED TUNING MECHANISM FOR DFJSP'，介绍了HOA-DSTM算法及其性能验证。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dual-RL Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Dual-RL Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">方法</data>
  <data key="d2">双重强化学习机制，应用于进化算子中动态调节Pc和Pm，以平衡探索与利用，降低早熟收敛风险，提升搜索多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="43个知名基准实例">
  <data key="d0">43个知名基准实例</data>
  <data key="d1">数据</data>
  <data key="d2">用于验证HOA-DSTM性能的43个知名基准测试实例，实验结果表明HOA-DSTM在求解质量和计算效率方面优于三种最新算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="求解质量">
  <data key="d0">求解质量</data>
  <data key="d1">概念</data>
  <data key="d2">HOA-DSTM算法在基准测试中表现出的性能指标之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785844629</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="计算效率">
  <data key="d0">计算效率</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">HOA-DSTM算法在基准测试中表现出的另一性能指标。&lt;SEP&gt;算法计算的效率，IWOA在求解过程中保持有竞争力的计算效率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多目标优化框架">
  <data key="d0">多目标优化框架</data>
  <data key="d1">概念</data>
  <data key="d2">未来的研究方向之一，旨在同时优化能耗、机器利用率和交货期满意度等性能指标，需要高效的基于帕累托的求解方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c111335adb177428c1a51cb7f78bd2c0-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A_Hierarchical_Optimization_Algorithm_With_Dual-Cache_Synced_Tuning_Mechanism_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling_Problem-b3b661fe.pdf</data>
