  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">为求解MO-DFFJSPT而构建的混合整数线性规划模型，包含参数、变量、目标函数和约束条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="三角模糊数(TFN)">
  <data key="d0">三角模糊数(TFN)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种表示不确定性数值的模糊数，在MO-DFFJSPT中用于表示加工时间和运输时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大完工时间(OF1)">
  <data key="d0">最大完工时间(OF1)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MO-DFFJSPT的第一个目标函数，定义为所有工件完成时间的最大值，用于衡量工厂的生产效率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大工厂负荷(OF2)">
  <data key="d0">最大工厂负荷(OF2)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MO-DFFJSPT的第二个目标函数，定义为所有工厂中负荷的最大值，用于衡量工厂间的负载平衡。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总工作负荷(OF3)">
  <data key="d0">总工作负荷(OF3)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">MO-DFFJSPT的第三个目标函数，定义为所有机器上加工时间的总和，用于衡量机器的总磨损。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(5)">
  <data key="d0">方程(5)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">定义最大完工时间OF1的数学表达式：OF1 = max{C_i | i=1,2,…,n}。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(6)">
  <data key="d0">方程(6)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">定义最大工厂负荷OF2的数学表达式：OF2 = max{W_l | l=1,2,…,f}。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(7)">
  <data key="d0">方程(7)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">计算工厂l的负荷W_l的数学表达式：W_l = Σ_i Σ_j Σ_k V_{i,j}^l * X_{i,j}^k * P_{i,j}^k。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(8)">
  <data key="d0">方程(8)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">定义总工作负荷OF3的数学表达式：OF3 = Σ_i Σ_j Σ_l Σ_k V_{i,j}^l * X_{i,j}^k * P_{i,j}^k。&lt;SEP&gt;表示当N_{ij}和N_{i'j'}均为0时，工序(i,j)与(i',j')在共享设备e上的先后顺序约束，通过二元变量B_{ij i'j'}确定优先关系。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(9)">
  <data key="d0">方程(9)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件：Σ_l Σ_k V_{i,j}^l * X_{i,j}^k = 1，保证每个工件的每个工序只能由一台机器加工。&lt;SEP&gt;表示涉及特定资源k和k'的工序调度约束，使用二元变量C_{ij i'j'}来决定工序(i,j)与(i',j')的先后顺序，并考虑资源分配变量X和Z。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(10)">
  <data key="d0">方程(10)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件：C_{i,j} - C_{i,j-1} ≥ V_{i,j}^l * X_{i,j}^k * P_{i,j}^k，保证同一工件的前后工序加工顺序。&lt;SEP&gt;表示当N_{ij}与N_{i'j'}之和为1时的混合约束，结合了设备e和资源k的分配，通过二元变量D_{ij i'j'}确定优先关系。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(11)">
  <data key="d0">方程(11)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件：C_{i,j} - C_{u,v} ≥ Y_{i,j,u,v,k}^l * P_{i,j}^k + L*(Y_{i,j,u,v,k}^l - 1)，保证一台机器同一时间只能加工一个工序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(12)">
  <data key="d0">方程(12)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">约束条件：Z_{i,j}^M + Z_{i,j}^F ∈ {0,1}，保证一个工序只能在工厂间或机器间转运一次。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
