<node id="三角模糊数">
  <data key="d0">三角模糊数</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种模糊数，由最早处理时间、最可能处理时间和最晚处理时间三个值组成，广泛用于调度活动。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="模糊数">
  <data key="d0">模糊数</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">处理不确定时间框架的数学概念，当某些值比其他值更可能时，置信区间扩展为模糊数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="隶属度函数">
  <data key="d0">隶属度函数</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">用于描述三角模糊数中变量x的隶属程度的函数，其公式在文中给出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="加法操作">
  <data key="d0">加法操作</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">模糊数的加法操作，定义了两个三角模糊数相加的规则。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="排序操作">
  <data key="d0">排序操作</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">模糊数的排序操作，定义了比较两个三角模糊数的三个准则。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大值操作">
  <data key="d0">最大值操作</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">模糊数的最大值操作，用于确定两个三角模糊数中的最大值，有Sakawa准则和Lei准则两种方式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sakawa等人">
  <data key="d0">Sakawa等人</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Sakawa及其合作者，在1990年代首次定义了模糊数的操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="准则1">
  <data key="d0">准则1</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">排序操作中的第一比较准则，计算公式为F1~(X) = (x1+2x2+x3)/4。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="准则2">
  <data key="d0">准则2</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">排序操作中的第二比较准则，计算公式为F2~(X) = x2。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="准则3">
  <data key="d0">准则3</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">排序操作中的第三比较准则，计算公式为F3~(X) = x3 - x1。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sakawa准则">
  <data key="d0">Sakawa准则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Sakawa提出的最大值准则，通过取每个对应分量的最大值来确定两个三角模糊数的最大值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lei准则">
  <data key="d0">Lei准则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Lei提出的最大值准则，通过直接比较两个三角模糊数的大小来确定最大值，若X&gt;Y则取X，否则取Y。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工件模糊处理开始时间">
  <data key="d0">工件模糊处理开始时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件的模糊处理开始时间，本文采用Lei准则来确定。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="算法2：插入解码方法">
  <data key="d0">算法2：插入解码方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种将操作序列向量解码为调度方案的解码算法，包含模糊传输时间和插入标准的判断。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作序列向量(OS)">
  <data key="d0">操作序列向量(OS)</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">算法2的输入，一个包含工件操作排序信息的向量。&lt;SEP&gt;染色体编码中的一部分，表示作业的操作顺序，由作业编号组成，每个作业编号出现的次数等于该作业的操作总数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="插入标准">
  <data key="d0">插入标准</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(13)和(14)所代表的用于判断是否可以将操作插入机器空闲时间段的规则。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
