  <data key="d0">工件加工开始时间T_a</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">当前工件加工的开始时间，由方程(13)计算，为前序操作完成时间加传输时间与空闲时间段开始时间的较大值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="模糊传输时间T_T">
  <data key="d0">模糊传输时间T_T</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工件从其他机器或工厂传输到当前机器所需的时间，表示为模糊数，初始为[0,0,0]。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工厂间传输时间T_F">
  <data key="d0">工厂间传输时间T_F</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工件从一个工厂传输到另一个工厂所需的模糊时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器间传输时间T_M">
  <data key="d0">机器间传输时间T_M</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工件在同一个工厂内不同机器间传输所需的模糊时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
