  <data key="d0">空闲时间段开始时间T_s</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器空闲时间段的开始时间，用于插入标准的判断。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="空闲时间段结束时间T_e">
  <data key="d0">空闲时间段结束时间T_e</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器空闲时间段的结束时间，用于确保操作在空闲时间内完成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="加工时间P_{i,j}^k">
  <data key="d0">加工时间P_{i,j}^k</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">操作O_{i,j}在机器M_k上的加工时间，用于判断插入条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作O_{i,j}">
  <data key="d0">操作O_{i,j}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工件i的第j道操作，是调度中的基本单元。&lt;SEP&gt;作业J_i的第j个操作，需要在候选机器集合中选择一台机器进行加工，具有加工时间和准备时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工厂F_l">
  <data key="d0">工厂F_l</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式调度中的一个工厂，操作可能在不同的工厂间转移。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器M_k">
  <data key="d0">机器M_k</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">工厂内的一台机器，用于执行操作。&lt;SEP&gt;机器集合M中的一台加工设备，具有特定的生产能力。&lt;SEP&gt;用于处理操作的机器资源，关键操作可能需要机器加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="空闲时间段">
  <data key="d0">空闲时间段</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器上未被占用的时间段，允许插入操作，具有开始和结束时间。&lt;SEP&gt;机器或工人在调度过程中无任务的时间区间。&lt;SEP&gt;在机器或工人日程中，可用于插入关键操作的空闲时间区间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-017&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
