  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变异策略">
  <data key="d0">变异策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于种群进化的变异操作策略。&lt;SEP&gt;差分进化算法中选择的变异方案，影响算法性能。&lt;SEP&gt;差分进化算法中变异算子的具体实施方案，如rand/1/bin、best/1/bin等，通过不同方式选择父代个体计算差分向量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="权重分配策略">
