  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多目标分布式模糊柔性作业车间调度模型(MO-DFFJSPT)">
  <data key="d0">多目标分布式模糊柔性作业车间调度模型(MO-DFFJSPT)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文首次提出的调度模型，同时考虑分布式制造、工件转移、时间模糊性和多目标优化，目标是最小化最大完工时间、最大工厂负荷和总工作量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总工作量">
  <data key="d0">总工作量</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">调度模型的目标之一，表示所有机器的总加工工作量，需最小化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分解变邻域搜索算子(DVNS)">
