  <data key="d0">Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer (MO-DFFJSPT)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">首次在本文中提出的考虑模糊处理时间和模糊传输时间的多目标分布式柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
