</node>
<node id="Hybrid Decomposition Variable Neighborhood Memetic Algorithm (HDVMA)">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Decomposition Variable Neighborhood Memetic Algorithm (HDVMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">为解决MO-DFFJSPT而提出的混合分解变邻域模因算法，目标是最小化Makespan、最大工厂负载和总工作量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
