<node id="Fuzzy Processing Time">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy Processing Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">模糊处理时间，调度问题中不确定的加工时间。&lt;SEP&gt;操作的模糊加工时间，表示加工时间的不确定性，用于柔性作业车间调度环境。&lt;SEP&gt;模糊处理时间，指操作加工时间的不确定性，通常用模糊数表示。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
