  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population Initialization">
  <data key="d0">Population Initialization</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种生成高质量初始种群的方法，包含四种初始化规则：全局规则、工厂负载规则、工作量规则和随机规则。最后，这四种初始化规则的概率分别确定为0.5、0.1、0.1和0.3。&lt;SEP&gt;一种采用随机初始化策略生成初始种群的方法。针对操作序列(OS)编码，解被随机初始化；针对机器选择(MS)编码，以等概率使用三种不同的初始化方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Global Rule">
  <data key="d0">Global Rule</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种初始化规则，通过维护机器负载数组来平衡机器负载，以减少调度完成时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Machine Load Array">
  <data key="d0">Machine Load Array</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">全局规则中使用的数组，存储每台机器的总加工时间，用于选择负载最小的机器分配操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Factory Load Rule">
  <data key="d0">Factory Load Rule</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种初始化规则，通过维护工厂负载数组来平衡工厂间工作量，以减少最大工厂负载。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Factory Load Array">
  <data key="d0">Factory Load Array</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工厂负载规则中使用的数组，存储每个工厂的总负载，用于平衡工厂间工作量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Workload Rule">
  <data key="d0">Workload Rule</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种初始化规则，将每个操作分配到加工时间最短的机器上，以减少总工作量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845002</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Random Rule">
  <data key="d0">Random Rule</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种初始化规则，随机分配操作到机器，以维持种群的多样性，防止陷入局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006</data>
