<node id="Equation (15)">
  <data key="d0">Equation (15)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">权重函数公式，定义F(x,λ)为三个目标函数值与权重向量的线性组合，用于评估个体。&lt;SEP&gt;定义交叉参数CRi的自适应控制公式：CRi = CR + (Ψi - Ψbest) / (Ψworst - Ψbest)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equation (16)">
  <data key="d0">Equation (16)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">权重向量约束公式，定义λ1+λ2+λ3=I，其中I=23，生成300组权重向量。&lt;SEP&gt;用于在迁移操作中选择示例个体的公式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-e630becb450dcca79375a56384053225-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Hybrid Memetic Algorithm to Solve Multiobjective Distributed Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Transfer-71a8369b.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
