<node id="最大完工时间(Makespan, F1)">
  <data key="d0">最大完工时间(Makespan, F1)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">完成所有作业加工所需的时间，直接反映工业生产效率，计算公式为: min F1 = Cmax = max FT_{i,j,f}。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845179</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总能耗(TEC, F2)">
  <data key="d0">总能耗(TEC, F2)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">完成所有作业加工所需的总能耗，直接反映工业生产成本，由加工能耗(P1)和空闲能耗(P2)组成，计算公式为: min F2 = TEC = P1 + P2。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
