</node>
<node id="负迁移">
  <data key="d0">负迁移</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">知识迁移中可能导致性能下降的现象，是知识迁移优化的关键挑战之一。&lt;SEP&gt;知识迁移中导致性能下降的现象，在迭代后期可能增加并导致陷入局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-035</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
