<node id="Multi-Factory-Based Greedy Population Initialization Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Factory-Based Greedy Population Initialization Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于多工厂的贪婪种群初始化策略，通过计算每个工件在各工厂的平均总加工时间，优先分配到最小时间的工厂，部分个体采用贪婪生成，其余随机生成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845234</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dynamic Neighborhood Search Structure Based on Critical Factory">
  <data key="d0">Dynamic Neighborhood Search Structure Based on Critical Factory</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于关键工厂的动态邻域搜索结构，利用资格向量Qual评估当前Pareto前沿，自适应地进行邻域探索。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845234</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Knowledge Transfer Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge Transfer Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">知识迁移机制，利用工厂分配概率模型引导种群优化，实现跨工厂的知识共享。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845234</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Factory Allocation Probability Model">
  <data key="d0">Factory Allocation Probability Model</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">工厂分配概率模型(PM)，用于知识迁移机制中，指导工件在工厂间的分配概率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845234</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Elite Archive A">
  <data key="d0">Elite Archive A</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">精英档案A，存储种群中的优秀个体，用于邻域搜索和保存Pareto最优解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Qualification Vector Qual">
  <data key="d0">Qualification Vector Qual</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">资格向量Qual，用于评估当前Pareto前沿的质量，指导动态邻域搜索。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Crossover and Mutation">
  <data key="d0">Crossover and Mutation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">交叉和变异操作，用于种群的全局搜索，包括操作序列交叉、机器选择和工厂分配交叉，以及操作位置交换和机器重分配变异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-Dominated Sorting">
  <data key="d0">Non-Dominated Sorting</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">非支配排序，用于环境选择中对解进行分层排序，确定支配关系。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Priority Operation Crossover (POX)">
  <data key="d0">Priority Operation Crossover (POX)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">优先级操作交叉算子，用于操作序列的交叉操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Universal Crossover (UX)">
  <data key="d0">Universal Crossover (UX)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">均匀交叉算子，用于机器选择和工厂分配的交叉操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Average Total Processing Time AT">
  <data key="d0">Average Total Processing Time AT</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">平均总加工时间，某个工件在所有工厂上的平均加工时间之和，用于贪婪初始化策略中的工厂选择。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845236</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population P0">
  <data key="d0">Population P0</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">初始种群P0，由贪婪初始化策略生成的个体集合，用于进化搜索的起点。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parameter ps">
  <data key="d0">Parameter ps</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">种群大小ps，KTCE算法的一个输入参数，控制种群中个体的数量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parameter Pc">
  <data key="d0">Parameter Pc</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">交叉率Pc，KTCE算法的一个输入参数，控制交叉操作发生的概率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parameter Pm">
  <data key="d0">Parameter Pm</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">变异概率Pm，KTCE算法的一个输入参数，控制变异操作发生的概率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parameter MaxNFEs">
  <data key="d0">Parameter MaxNFEs</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">最大函数评价次数MaxNFEs，KTCE算法的一个输入参数，终止条件之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parameter ε">
  <data key="d0">Parameter ε</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">最大邻域搜索次数ε，KTCE算法的一个输入参数，控制邻域搜索的深度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Parameter σ">
  <data key="d0">Parameter σ</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">学习强度σ，KTCE算法的一个输入参数，用于知识学习中对概率模型的更新步长。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
