<node id="Dynamic Neighborhood Search Framework">
  <data key="d0">Dynamic Neighborhood Search Framework</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种动态邻域搜索框架，用于在优化的不同阶段自适应地分配计算资源，以平衡全局搜索和邻域搜索。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LST">
  <data key="d0">LST</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">表示邻域搜索的频率的变量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="maxLST">
  <data key="d0">maxLST</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">当前允许的最大邻域搜索次数，根据公式(12)计算。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Qual vector">
  <data key="d0">Qual vector</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">资格向量，用于筛选适合进行邻域搜索的个体，大小与精英种群A相同，元素初始化为1。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="end_f">
  <data key="d0">end_f</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">终止指示器，当邻域搜索未能产生更好的解时增加。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="end_max">
  <data key="d0">end_max</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">end_f的最大阈值，由maxLST根据公式(13)计算得出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NFEs">
  <data key="d0">NFEs</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">当前函数评估次数，用于计算maxLST。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="精英种群A">
  <data key="d0">精英种群A</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">精英种群，包含高质量的解，用于邻域搜索和更新。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845239</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="种群P'">
  <data key="d0">种群P'</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">种群，包含所有候选解，用于全局搜索和替换操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
