<node id="Small-Scale Instances">
  <data key="d0">Small-Scale Instances</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">小规模实例是六个生成的测试实例，包含4至6个作业、5个操作、2或3个工厂、每个工厂5台机器，用于验证模型正确性和算法收敛性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="20 Instances of Varying Scales">
  <data key="d0">20 Instances of Varying Scales</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">20个不同规模的实例用于评估KTCE，作业数量取自{10,20,30,40,50,100,150,200}，工厂数量区间[2,7]，每个工厂配备5台机器，每台机器加工功耗4kWh，空闲功耗1kWh。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
