<node id="Knowledge Transfer-Based Co-Evolutionary Search for Energy-Saving Distributed Heterogeneous">
  <data key="d0">Knowledge Transfer-Based Co-Evolutionary Search for Energy-Saving Distributed Heterogeneous</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇关于知识转移协同进化搜索的论文，用于节能分布式异构调度。&lt;SEP&gt;该论文提出了KTCE算法，用于解决节能分布式异构调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-001</data>
