<node id="参数敏感性分析表">
  <data key="d0">参数敏感性分析表</data>
  <data key="d1">数据</data>
  <data key="d2">一张记录不同工件与工厂数量配置下多项性能指标结果的参数敏感性分析数据表。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845244</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MFLEDA">
  <data key="d0">MFLEDA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">MFLEDA 是一种基于概率建模的多目标分布估计进化算法（EDA），同时可作为一种调度算法应用于相关优化问题。在消融实验中，其参数设置为 β_max=0.5 和 ℓ=10。在多目标优化算法的对比研究中，MFLEDA 作为参与性能比较的对比算法之一，其性能通过超体积（HV）和反世代距离（IGD）两项指标进行定量评估，并在对比表格中以优化算法的身份进行性能测试。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-034&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-024&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-029&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-030&lt;SEP&gt;doc-78fb975a62b0ae0a55602842d9892197-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">Knowledge_Transfer-Based_Co-Evolutionary_Search_for_Energy-Saving_Distributed_Heterogeneous_Flexible_Job_Shop_Scheduling-6c8dcb66.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785845246</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="启发式种群初始化">
  <data key="d0">启发式种群初始化</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种利用启发式规则生成初始种群的方法，包含多种变异策略。&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于生成初始种群的策略，通过重新定义操作序列向量和资源分配向量的生成方法，基于作业高优先级和外包约束原则，以加速算法收敛并获得更多可行解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资源分配向量">
  <data key="d0">资源分配向量</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">染色体的另一层，表示每个操作分配的资源编号，值为0到1之间的随机数。&lt;SEP&gt;染色体中表示每道工序所分配的机器或工人的部分。&lt;SEP&gt;染色体中表示资源选择方案的向量，在种群初始化中按启发式规则生成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="随机生成方法">
  <data key="d0">随机生成方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">初始种群生成的一种基本方法，操作序列和资源分配向量随机产生，能保证种群多样性，但可能产生大量不可行解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="外包约束">
  <data key="d0">外包约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在柔性作业车间调度中，某些工序可能需要外包处理的限制条件，影响解的可行性。&lt;SEP&gt;允许作业外包的约束条件&lt;SEP&gt;将部分工序外包给外部资源时产生的限制条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="不可行解">
  <data key="d0">不可行解</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">不满足所有约束条件的解，在外包约束下随机生成可能导致大量不可行解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="算法收敛">
  <data key="d0">算法收敛</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法在迭代过程中向最优解逼近的速度和程度，启发式策略旨在加速收敛。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="可行解">
  <data key="d0">可行解</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">满足所有约束条件的解，启发式策略旨在获得更多可行解。&lt;SEP&gt;满足所有约束条件的调度方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-027</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="启发式策略">
  <data key="d0">启发式策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于改进初始染色体生成、消除不可行解的经验规则，帮助获得高质量初始种群。&lt;SEP&gt;用于生成额外初始可行染色体的方法。&lt;SEP&gt;用于种群初始化的特定启发式方法，基于作业高优先级和外包约束原则，优化工序加工顺序和资源选择规则。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业高优先级">
  <data key="d0">作业高优先级</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业的一种属性，表示该作业在调度中的优先程度，启发式策略中优先选择高优先级作业的操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工序加工顺序">
  <data key="d0">工序加工顺序</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">各作业工序的排列次序，是调度方案的重要组成部分。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资源号选择规则">
  <data key="d0">资源号选择规则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">确定每个工序所使用的具体资源编号的规则，在启发式初始化中用于资源分配向量的生成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="集合O_f">
  <data key="d0">集合O_f</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">用于启发式种群初始化的集合，存放每个作业的第一个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="集合R_t">
  <data key="d0">集合R_t</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">用于启发式种群初始化的集合，保存所有资源的可用开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最早开始时间">
  <data key="d0">最早开始时间</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">操作的最早可能开始时间，在启发式策略中用于选择操作和计算准备开始时间。&lt;SEP&gt;工序可开始加工的最早时间点,计算时需考虑前序工序完成时间、运输时间、机器设置时间等约束。&lt;SEP&gt;操作在不违反约束条件下的最早可开始加工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="资源可用开始时间">
  <data key="d0">资源可用开始时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">资源变为可用状态的时间点，从集合R_t获取，用于确定操作的准备开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="优先级">
  <data key="d0">优先级</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业或操作的优先程度，高于启发式策略中作为选择操作的依据之一。&lt;SEP&gt;作业的一个属性，用于在调度中区分作业的重要性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="外包需求">
  <data key="d0">外包需求</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">操作是否需要外包处理的要求，在启发式策略中作为选择操作的依据之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="空闲资源">
  <data key="d0">空闲资源</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">当前未被占用的机器、工人等资源，可用于分配工序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="附件">
  <data key="d0">附件</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">加工特定工序时所需的辅助装置或工具，如刀具和夹具。&lt;SEP&gt;加工过程中需要的辅助工具或设备，其占用时间需要管理。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="等待时间">
  <data key="d0">等待时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">资源或附件变为可用所需等待的时间，用于资源选择决策。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束">
  <data key="d0">约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">调度问题中必须满足的限制条件，如公式(3)和(6)所表示的时间约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="准备开始时间">
  <data key="d0">准备开始时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工序在分配的资源上开始准备工作的时间点。&lt;SEP&gt;操作开始准备的时间点，通过比较最早开始时间和资源可用开始时间，取较大者确定。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="进化算子">
  <data key="d0">进化算子</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">差分进化算法中的基本操作集合，包括交叉、变异和选择算子，用于生成新个体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="差分进化算法">
  <data key="d0">差分进化算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于种群的随机优化算法，通过变异、交叉和选择操作迭代搜索最优解，本研究中采用自适应控制参数提高性能。&lt;SEP&gt;一种基于种群的优化算法，采用实数编码、差分变异和一对一竞争生存策略，用于求解柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="选择算子">
  <data key="d0">选择算子</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">采用一对一竞争生存策略，比较新个体与目标个体的适应度，保留较优者。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="实数编码">
  <data key="d0">实数编码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">差分进化算法中使用的编码方式，个体表示为实数向量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="差分变异算子">
  <data key="d0">差分变异算子</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">利用父代个体间的差异向量来扰动目标向量的变异方法，有多种实现策略如rand/1/bin等。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="一对一竞争生存策略">
  <data key="d0">一对一竞争生存策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">选择操作中，新个体与目标个体比较适应度，仅当新个体更优时才进入下一代的策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变异参数F">
  <data key="d0">变异参数F</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">控制差分向量缩放比例的变异参数，用于变异算子中。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848105</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
