</node>
<node id="Self-adaptive Control Method">
  <data key="d0">Self-adaptive Control Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出的方法，结合突变策略的随机选择以及突变参数和交叉参数的自适应控制，以平衡全局和局部搜索能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Equation (14)">
  <data key="d0">Equation (14)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">定义突变参数Fi的自适应控制公式：Fi = F * (Ψi - Ψbest) / (γs (Ψworst - Ψbest))。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
