<node id="Hybrid Differential Evolution Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Hybrid Differential Evolution Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种混合差分进化算法，用于解决柔性作业车间调度问题&lt;SEP&gt;Yuan和Xu在2013年提出的混合差分进化算法，采用转换机制和局部搜索求解柔性作业车间调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Outsourcing Operations">
  <data key="d0">Outsourcing Operations</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">外包操作约束</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job Priority Constraints">
  <data key="d0">Job Priority Constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业优先级约束&lt;SEP&gt;与作业优先级相关的约束条件，必须在调度方案中满足。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints">
  <data key="d0">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇论文，标题为《A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints》，研究带有外包操作和作业优先级约束的柔性作业车间调度问题，提出一种混合差分进化算法&lt;SEP&gt;由H. Li, X. Wang, J.J.E.S.W.A. Peng撰写的论文，发表在Expert. Syst. Appl., 201, 2022, 117182, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.eswa.2022.117182。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-063</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="航空研发企业">
  <data key="d0">航空研发企业</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">航空领域从事研发与生产的企业，其生产特点为多品种、小批量、变批量，常需外包协作。&lt;SEP&gt;从事航空研发的企业，其面临的实际问题为本研究提供了背景。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="带外包作业和作业优先级约束的柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSP)">
  <data key="d0">带外包作业和作业优先级约束的柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种考虑了外包作业和作业优先级约束的柔性作业车间调度问题，是本文研究的核心问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="实例生成程序">
  <data key="d0">实例生成程序</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于实际生产条件生成测试实例的程序，其步骤在表4中描述。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业优先级">
  <data key="d0">作业优先级</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业的优先级属性，设置为1、2、3或4，其中1和4分别表示最高和最低优先级。&lt;SEP&gt;作业在调度中的优先处理顺序，影响资源分配和调度决策。&lt;SEP&gt;因经济效益和交付紧急程度不同而导致作业间存在重要度差异的特性。&lt;SEP&gt;在作业调度中用于划分作业子集的属性，迁移算子基于作业优先级划分子集，以保持优先级段结构；交叉算子通常不区分作业优先级。&lt;SEP&gt;在生产调度中对不同作业赋予的重要程度，影响调度决策。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="订单数量">
  <data key="d0">订单数量</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">每个作业的订单数量，为[1,3]范围内的随机整数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="实例集1">
  <data key="d0">实例集1</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">第一组测试问题集，包含20个规模为20×10×5×5的实例，用于验证带外包作业和作业优先级约束的柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="实例集2">
  <data key="d0">实例集2</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">第二组测试问题集，包含20个规模为30×20×10×5的实例，用于验证带外包作业和作业优先级约束的柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
