  <data key="d0">目标值Ψ*</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">目标函数的最优值或求解结果，用于衡量算法性能的指标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="计算时间">
  <data key="d0">计算时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">求解算法运行所需的时间，以秒为单位。&lt;SEP&gt;求解模型找到最优解所需的时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="相同资源组内机器加工时间相等条件">
  <data key="d0">相同资源组内机器加工时间相等条件</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">对于同一资源组内的任何机器，任何操作的加工时间均相同的假设条件，即t^m_{jib} = t^m_{jib}。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="实例1 (9×10×5×5)">
  <data key="d0">实例1 (9×10×5×5)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">一个具体测试实例，规模为9个作业、10个操作、5种资源类型、每种资源5台机器，属于实例集1，并满足相同资源组内机器加工时间相等的条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-012</data>
