<node id="A Genetic Algorithm For The Hybrid Flow Shop Scheduling With Unrelated Machines And Machine Eligibility">
  <data key="d0">A Genetic Algorithm For The Hybrid Flow Shop Scheduling With Unrelated Machines And Machine Eligibility</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该文献由Yu C., Semeraro Q., Matta A.于2018年发表，刊登于Computers Operations Research，第100卷，页码211-229。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="外包工序">
  <data key="d0">外包工序</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在柔性作业车间调度中，部分工序需要由外部车间或企业协作完成，完成后可能返回原车间继续加工，且外包时间固定。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工件优先级">
  <data key="d0">工件优先级</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在实际生产中，不同工件具有不同的优先级，高优先级工件对订单交付时间有严格要求且逾期成本高。&lt;SEP&gt;指在调度问题中，不同工件具有不同的加工紧急程度或重要等级，需要优先安排加工。&lt;SEP&gt;用于确定局部关键路径的优先级规则。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="逾期天数">
  <data key="d0">逾期天数</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">生产调度优化目标之一，指工件实际完工日期超出预定交付日期的天数，本研究以加权逾期天数最小化为目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="序列式数学模型">
  <data key="d0">序列式数学模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本研究提出的考虑外包约束和不同优先级工件逾期权重的数学模型，旨在最小化加权逾期天数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="染色体编码与解码方法">
  <data key="d0">染色体编码与解码方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在HSDE中设计的染色体表示方式，用于将调度方案编码为染色体以及从染色体解码出可行的调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="惩罚项">
  <data key="d0">惩罚项</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">添加到目标函数中的项，用于惩罚不满足外包约束的个体，从而引导搜索可行解。&lt;SEP&gt;MILP模型目标函数中用于处理工件优先级约束的项。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-027</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="初始染色体生成">
  <data key="d0">初始染色体生成</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">采用启发式策略生成初始种群的染色体，以提高初始解的质量和可行性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NP难问题">
  <data key="d0">NP难问题</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">非确定性多项式时间困难问题，指在多项式时间内难以找到最优解的组合优化问题，柔性作业车间调度问题属于此类。&lt;SEP&gt;非确定性多项式时间难问题，FJSP-JPC-TST属于此类，传统精确算法难以在合理时间内求解。&lt;SEP&gt;经典的NP难问题，本文的研究问题是对其的扩展</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
