<node id="加工时间不等约束">
  <data key="d0">加工时间不等约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一个约束条件，表达式为$t_{jib}^{m} \neq t_{jib}^{m}, \forall j \in J, i \in I, r \in R, n, n' \in r, n \neq n'$，要求不同工件的加工时间互不相同</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
