</node>
<node id="有效解码方法">
  <data key="d0">有效解码方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种将染色体解码为可行调度方案的方法，包含读取基因、处理外包和本厂加工、进行工序插入等步骤。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工人">
  <data key="d0">工人</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">车间中执行或辅助加工操作的人员资源。&lt;SEP&gt;工人是加工离线工序的资源，也可以操作机器。&lt;SEP&gt;可分配到操作上进行作业的人力资源。&lt;SEP&gt;操作工人，WS层变异时分配工人。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854084</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="外包">
  <data key="d0">外包</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">将工序委托给外部企业进行加工的处理方式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
