<node id="Job Shop Scheduling Problem (JSP)">
  <data key="d0">Job Shop Scheduling Problem (JSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业车间调度问题，是生产调度的一个重要类型，包括静态JSP、及时制JSP等多种形式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexible Job Shop Scheduling (FJSP)">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Job Shop Scheduling (FJSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题，增加了机器柔性，是当前调度研究的热点，许多智能算法被开发用于求解该问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Heuristic Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Heuristic Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">基于启发式规则的调度策略，通过参数和规则引导搜索，计算高效但性能依赖问题类型，常与其他方法结合使用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Intelligent Optimization Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Intelligent Optimization Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">针对复杂工程调度问题出现的智能搜索算法，能在有限时间内找到近似最优解，包括遗传算法、模拟退火、粒子群等。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Differential Evolution Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Differential Evolution Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Storn和Price于1995年提出的基于种群的全局优化算法，包含变异、交叉和选择操作，结构简单、易实现、收敛快，被广泛应用于各种领域。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Simulated Annealing Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Simulated Annealing Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种智能优化算法，Cruz-Chavez等通过部分调度机制和冷却机制加速了该算法并应用于柔性作业车间调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Tabu Search Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Tabu Search Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种智能优化算法，Vela等将其应用于生产调度问题，并可与遗传算法结合形成混合算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ant Colony Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Ant Colony Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种智能优化算法，Ebrahimi等将其应用于生产调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;蚁群算法，一种模仿蚂蚁觅食行为的启发式优化算法，用于求解组合优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Particle Swarm Optimization Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Particle Swarm Optimization Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种智能优化算法，Ding和Gu将其应用于生产调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c8d4aded27e72d48668c384b0a9eb7ec-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A hybrid differential evolution algorithm for flexible job shop scheduling with outsourcing operations and job priority constraints-d5367fa8.pdf</data>
