<node id="优先级作业">
  <data key="d0">优先级作业</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题中需优先处理的作业，其数量按总作业数的四分之一向上取整确定。&lt;SEP&gt;承诺提供高额经济补偿以换取加急交付的作业，是生产车间中最受关注的作业。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
