<node id="Job Priority">
  <data key="d0">Job Priority</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件优先级，指生产调度中不同工件的优先程度&lt;SEP&gt;作业优先级，指在调度中某些作业具有较高的优先加工等级，需尽早完成。&lt;SEP&gt;一种开放约束，要求尽可能早地处理高优先级作业，未直接给出约束表达式，而是通过惩罚机制间接处理。&lt;SEP&gt;工件加工的优先级顺序，在基于作业的迁移中用于将工件集划分为不同优先级段。&lt;SEP&gt;工件优先级，指在生产调度中某些工件必须优先加工的要求，对后续装配和运输工作有重要影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-objective Optimization">
  <data key="d0">Multi-objective Optimization</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">多目标优化，同时优化多个目标的方法</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Total Tardiness">
  <data key="d0">Total Tardiness</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">总延迟时间，所有工件延迟时间的总和&lt;SEP&gt;总延迟时间，即所有作业延迟时间的总和。&lt;SEP&gt;总拖期时间，是FJSPJP的优化目标之一</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Completion Time of Priority Jobs">
  <data key="d0">Completion Time of Priority Jobs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优先工件完成时间，针对优先级工件设定的完工时间目标&lt;SEP&gt;优先级作业的完成时间，即需要优先完成的关键作业的完工时间。&lt;SEP&gt;优先作业的完成时间，是FJSPJP的优化目标之一</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
