</node>
<node id="快速非支配排序函数">
  <data key="d0">快速非支配排序函数</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于Pareto支配的多目标优化排序方法，参考Deb et al. (2002)，用于对种群进行分层并计算拥挤距离。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="LSA">
  <data key="d0">LSA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">第3.3节介绍的局部搜索算法，用于对选出的部分个体进行优化以改善解的质量。&lt;SEP&gt;提出的局部搜索算法，旨在改进模因算法在柔性作业车间调度问题上的性能。&lt;SEP&gt;提出的局部搜索算法，通过移动关键路径上的工序、改变机器分配和调整优先作业的工序，提升收敛性与多样性</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-021</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P(k)">
  <data key="d0">P(k)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">MA中的当前种群，在第k代由N个个体组成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_I(k)">
  <data key="d0">P_I(k)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">由交叉算子生成的中间种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_2(k)">
  <data key="d0">P_2(k)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">由变异算子生成的中间种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_3(k)">
  <data key="d0">P_3(k)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">由P(k)和P_2(k)组合而成的中间种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_4(k)">
  <data key="d0">P_4(k)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">对P_3(k)执行快速非支配排序和拥挤距离计算后得到的种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_5(k)">
  <data key="d0">P_5(k)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">从P_4(k)中选择0.2×N个个体生成的中间种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_6(k)">
  <data key="d0">P_6(k)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">对P_5(k)执行LSA后生成的中间种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_E">
  <data key="d0">P_E</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">精英种群，由从P_6(k)中选出的E个精英个体组成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P_7(k)">
  <data key="d0">P_7(k)</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">由从P_4(k)中选取的N-E个个体与精英种群P_E组合生成的中间种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="非支配层级">
  <data key="d0">非支配层级</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由快速非支配排序函数分配的等级，用于区分个体的优劣。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大计算时间">
  <data key="d0">最大计算时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作为停止准则的具体条件，当计算时间达到该值时算法终止。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gen">
  <data key="d0">Gen</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">当前代数计数器，初始设为1，每代增加1。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="N">
  <data key="d0">N</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">种群大小参数，表示每代个体的数量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DI">
  <data key="d0">DI</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">标记为重复的个体，在消除重复时生成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Deb et al., 2002">
  <data key="d0">Deb et al., 2002</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇参考文献，提出了快速非支配排序方法，用于多目标优化中的种群排序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem (FJSP)">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem (FJSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种广义的作业车间调度问题，其中每道操作可在一组机器中选择一台进行加工，且各工件的操作须按预定顺序执行，具有重要的实际应用价值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Brucker and Schlie (1990)">
  <data key="d0">Brucker and Schlie (1990)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Brucker和Schlie于1990年发表的论文，首次提出了柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSP)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Rossi and Dini (2007)">
  <data key="d0">Rossi and Dini (2007)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Rossi和Dini于2007年发表的论文，研究了具有序列相关准备时间的柔性作业车间调度问题，并采用蚁群算法求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Machine Maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Machine Maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器维护，指在调度过程中某些机器可能因维护而不可用的约束条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Discrete Chemical-Reaction Optimization Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Discrete Chemical-Reaction Optimization Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">离散化学反应优化算法，一种模拟化学反应过程的元启发式算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Demir and Isleyen (2014)">
  <data key="d0">Demir and Isleyen (2014)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Demir和Isleyen于2014年发表的论文，研究了操作间存在重叠的柔性作业车间调度问题，并提出了一种有效的遗传算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Birgin et al. (2015)">
  <data key="d0">Birgin et al. (2015)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">Birgin等人于2015年发表的论文，研究了操作优先关系由任意有向无环图给出的柔性作业车间调度扩展问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
