<node id="Proposed Memetic Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Proposed Memetic Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出的新型模因算法，用于求解所提出的多目标柔性作业车间调度问题(MO-FJSPJP)，包含精心设计的染色体编码算子和局部搜索方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
