  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maximal completion time">
  <data key="d0">Maximal completion time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优先作业的最大完工时间，用于评估调度方案对优先级作业的响应。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
