<node id="FJSPJP (带优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题)">
  <data key="d0">FJSPJP (带优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSPJP是一个考虑作业优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题的数学模型，包含多个目标函数和约束条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="目标函数f1: 最小化最大完工时间">
  <data key="d0">目标函数f1: 最小化最大完工时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">目标函数f1的表达式为min f1 = max Ci，其中Ci为作业i的完工时间，i=1,...,n，旨在最小化所有作业中的最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="目标函数f2: 最小化总延迟时间">
  <data key="d0">目标函数f2: 最小化总延迟时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">目标函数f2表示为min f2 = Σ_{i=1}^n max(0, Ci - di)，其中di为作业i的交货期，旨在最小化所有作业的总延迟时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="目标函数f3: 最小化优先级作业的完成时间">
  <data key="d0">目标函数f3: 最小化优先级作业的完成时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">目标函数f3表示为min f3 = max_{1≤i≤n'} (Ci)，其中n'为具有优先级的作业总数，旨在最小化优先级作业的完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(4): 操作顺序约束">
  <data key="d0">约束(4): 操作顺序约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束(4)为不等式COij - COi(j-1) ≥ Pijk * Xijk，确保每个作业内的操作按顺序执行，即后续操作必须在前序操作完成后才能开始。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(5): 机器容量约束">
  <data key="d0">约束(5): 机器容量约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束(5)通过逻辑或不等式确保每台机器在同一时刻只能处理一个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(6): 操作唯一处理约束">
  <data key="d0">约束(6): 操作唯一处理约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束(6)为等式Σ_{j=1}^r Xijk = 1，确保每个操作仅被处理一次。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(7): 机器唯一选择约束">
  <data key="d0">约束(7): 机器唯一选择约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束(7)为等式Σ_{k=1}^m Xijk = 1，确保每个操作只能选择一台机器进行处理。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="n'">
  <data key="d0">n'</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">参数n'，表示具有优先级的作业总数，满足n' ≤ n。&lt;SEP&gt;参数：提前给定的该批次工件的总优先级。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Oij">
  <data key="d0">Oij</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">参数Oij，表示作业i的第j个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Pijk">
  <data key="d0">Pijk</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">参数Pijk，表示操作Oij在机器k上的处理时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ci">
  <data key="d0">Ci</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">参数Ci，表示作业i的完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="COij">
  <data key="d0">COij</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">参数COij，表示操作Oij的完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="di">
  <data key="d0">di</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">参数di，表示作业i的交货期。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Xijk">
  <data key="d0">Xijk</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">决策变量Xijk，若操作Oij选择在机器k上处理则取值为1，否则为0。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848303</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(6): 机器与作业操作分配约束">
  <data key="d0">约束(6): 机器与作业操作分配约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束(6)为等式 Σ_{j=1}^{r} X_{ijk} = 1，∀i,k，确保对于每个作业i和机器k，该作业在该机器上最多只分配一个操作，即每个机器对每个作业只能处理一个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a38007468276a270c1727d6c565d8aa3-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A memetic algorithm for the flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-f303156f.pdf</data>
