  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="T12">
  <data key="d0">T12</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">针对FJSP-JPC-TST问题生成的测试实例，包含50个作业、220个操作和9台机器。&lt;SEP&gt;用于算法测试的柔性作业车间调度问题实例，属于复杂实例。&lt;SEP&gt;考虑工件优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题对比实验中使用的一个测试算例</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-014&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FISA_RWPS">
  <data key="d0">FISA_RWPS</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种启发式算法，考虑作业优先级，但不考虑运输时间和设置时间，在比较实验中用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题。&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于求解考虑工件优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题的算法，在对比实验中与其他算法进行性能比较&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题的对比算法，在比较实验中作为基准算法之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ABC_MSE">
  <data key="d0">ABC_MSE</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种启发式算法，考虑作业优先级，但不考虑运输时间和设置时间，在比较实验中用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题。&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于求解考虑工件优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题的算法，在对比实验中与其他算法进行性能比较&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题的对比算法，在比较实验中作为基准算法之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ISA-VCLDC">
  <data key="d0">ISA-VCLDC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于求解考虑工件优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题的算法，在对比实验中与其他算法进行性能比较&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题的对比算法，在比较实验中作为基准算法之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-023</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MAS_HGWO">
  <data key="d0">MAS_HGWO</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种应用于类似调度问题的算法，在比较实验中用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题，并使用二元树修复机制保证作业优先级约束。&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于求解考虑工件优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题的算法，在对比实验中与其他算法进行性能比较&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题的对比算法，在比较实验中作为基准算法之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="WOA">
  <data key="d0">WOA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">鲸鱼优化算法，由Mirjalili和Lewis提出，模拟鲸鱼群体搜索行为，具有结构简单、收敛快、鲁棒性强等特点，能平衡探索和开发，但易陷入局部最优和收敛速度慢。&lt;SEP&gt;标准鲸鱼优化算法(Whale Optimization Algorithm)，在比较实验中用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题，并使用二元树修复机制保证作业优先级约束。&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于求解考虑工件优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题的算法，在对比实验中与其他算法进行性能比较&lt;SEP&gt;用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题的基准算法之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-021&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Whale Optimization Algorithm (WOA)">
  <data key="d0">Whale Optimization Algorithm (WOA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种主要用于连续优化问题的元启发式算法，需要通过转换规则适应离散调度问题。&lt;SEP&gt;原始的鲸鱼优化算法，一种群体智能优化算法，惯性权重是其位置更新过程中的关键参数。&lt;SEP&gt;一种元启发式优化算法，但其存在易于陷入局部最优的问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cross-Population Differential Evolution Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Cross-Population Differential Evolution Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">为克服WOA局部最优问题而提出的跨种群差分进化策略，融合了差分进化变异算子和跨种群通信机制，并利用高斯函数在种群停滞时引入多方向扰动。&lt;SEP&gt;IWOA中使用的一种跨种群差分进化策略，用于增强种群多样性。&lt;SEP&gt;一种辅助增强机制，在复杂问题中提供关键变异以逃离局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Differential Evolution (DE) Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Differential Evolution (DE) Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种进化算法，其核心变异过程通过对个体位置的定向扰动实现全局探索与局部开发的平衡。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DE Mutation Operator">
  <data key="d0">DE Mutation Operator</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">采用的“DE/current-to-best/1”变异算子，利用当前种群最优解和随机个体的差分向量引导变异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Gaussian Function">
  <data key="d0">Gaussian Function</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">用于对位置向量施加随机扰动的数学函数，其分布为均值为0、自适应标准差的高斯分布。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Reflection Method">
  <data key="d0">Reflection Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">当扰动后个体位置超出可行域时，通过反射映射将其修正回可行域的边界处理方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cross-Population Communication">
  <data key="d0">Cross-Population Communication</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">跨种群信息交互机制，通过引入其他子种群的精英解信息构造梯度式搜索方向，扩大全局探索范围。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adaptive Standard Deviation">
  <data key="d0">Adaptive Standard Deviation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">高斯扰动的自适应标准差σ=e^{-λ(t/T_max)}，随迭代次数衰减，控制扰动范围。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Random Scaling Factor F">
  <data key="d0">Random Scaling Factor F</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在[0,0.5]区间内的随机缩放因子，控制差分向量对变异的影响程度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Predefined Probability Threshold p">
  <data key="d0">Predefined Probability Threshold p</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">预定义的概率阈值，用于控制DE变异算子中选择当前种群最优信息还是跨种群精英信息的概率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population Stagnation">
  <data key="d0">Population Stagnation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">种群进化停滞的状态，此时触发高斯扰动引入以增加多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP-JPC-TST模型">
  <data key="d0">FJSP-JPC-TST模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">考虑准备时间和运输时间的柔性作业车间调度模型，用于优化多品种小批量生产线的调度。&lt;SEP&gt;一种考虑作业优先级、运输时间和设置时间的柔性作业车间调度问题模型，目标是最小化最大完工时间</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="产品P">
  <data key="d0">产品P</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">一个产品，根据其树形物料清单被分解为多个作业。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业J_i">
  <data key="d0">作业J_i</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">作业集合J中的一个作业，包含一系列需要顺序执行的操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="候选机器集合CM_{i,j}">
  <data key="d0">候选机器集合CM_{i,j}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">操作O_{i,j}可选择的机器子集，包含能够加工该操作的机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="加工时间T_{i,j,k}^{proc}">
  <data key="d0">加工时间T_{i,j,k}^{proc}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">操作O_{i,j}在机器M_k上加工所需的时间，取决于机器的生产能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="运输时间TR_{k,q}^{trans}">
  <data key="d0">运输时间TR_{k,q}^{trans}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">作业从机器M_k转移到机器M_q所需的固定运输时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="准备时间T_{i,j,k}^{setup}">
  <data key="d0">准备时间T_{i,j,k}^{setup}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器M_k在加工操作O_{i,j}前需要的准备时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="物料清单BOM">
  <data key="d0">物料清单BOM</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">产品的树形结构清单，定义了作业之间的层级约束关系。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="树状加工工艺结构">
  <data key="d0">树状加工工艺结构</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">基于物料清单形成的作业间层级约束关系，父节点作业必须等待所有子节点作业完成后才能开始加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="父子作业层级约束">
  <data key="d0">父子作业层级约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业之间基于树形工艺结构的约束，子作业为前置作业，父作业为后继作业。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="自动导引车或机器人">
  <data key="d0">自动导引车或机器人</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">用于在机器之间运输作业的自动化设备，假设数量充足且无竞争等待。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="模型假设">
  <data key="d0">模型假设</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSP-JPC-TST模型的一系列简化假设，包括操作不可中断、机器单次单操作、运输设备充足等。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="示例问题实例">
  <data key="d0">示例问题实例</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">一个用于说明问题模型的具体实例，包含作业J_1、J_2、J_5及其操作和机器分配。&lt;SEP&gt;一个包含7个作业、3台机器和4名工人的具体DRFJSP-OJP调度问题实例，用于阐明问题特征。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="运输时间计算规则">
  <data key="d0">运输时间计算规则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">运输时间的计算规则：若为首道操作且作业由多个子作业组成，运输时间为各子作业独立运输时间的最大值；否则为从前道加工机器到当前加工机器的运输时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="子作业">
  <data key="d0">子作业</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在一个作业由多个部分组成的场景下，每个独立部分称为子作业，在计算运输时间时需考虑其独立运输。&lt;SEP&gt;在作业层次约束(方程(11))中，其完成是父作业开始的前提条件的作业。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业J_2">
  <data key="d0">作业J_2</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">示例问题实例中的一个作业，是作业J_5的前置作业，其最后操作为O_{2,2}。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作O_{1,3}">
  <data key="d0">操作O_{1,3}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">作业J_1的最后一个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作O_{2,2}">
  <data key="d0">操作O_{2,2}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">作业J_2的最后一个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作O_{5,1}">
  <data key="d0">操作O_{5,1}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">作业J_5的第一个操作，计划在机器M_1上加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作加工不可中断且连续约束">
  <data key="d0">操作加工不可中断且连续约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">每个操作一旦开始加工，必须连续完成，不允许抢占或中断。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器单任务约束">
  <data key="d0">机器单任务约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">每台机器在同一时间只能加工一个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AGV数量充足且无等待约束">
  <data key="d0">AGV数量充足且无等待约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">AGV或机器人数量充足，所有作业可由任何可用运输设备立即运输，无竞争或等待时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="准备时间独立性约束">
  <data key="d0">准备时间独立性约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">操作在机器上的准备时间仅取决于机器和操作，不受其他因素影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="无干扰生产环境约束">
  <data key="d0">无干扰生产环境约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">不考虑设备故障、订单插入和订单取消等干扰情况。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IWOA">
  <data key="d0">IWOA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">改进鲸鱼优化算法，融合了两层编码、基于优先级的修复机制、主动调度解码、多层子种群优化、自适应惯性权重和交叉种群差分进化等策略，用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST。&lt;SEP&gt;改进鲸鱼优化算法，本文基于三个针对性改进策略提出，具有更强搜索能力，用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题。&lt;SEP&gt;一种用于柔性作业车间调度问题的改进鲸鱼优化算法，在消融实验中作为比较基准。&lt;SEP&gt;一种针对柔性作业车间调度问题的改进鲸鱼优化算法，集成了多种增强策略。&lt;SEP&gt;改进鲸鱼优化算法(Improved Whale Optimization Algorithm)，本文提出的用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题的元启发式算法。&lt;SEP&gt;一种改进的鲸鱼优化算法，在12个案例的9个中取得了最小最佳值，在所有实例中取得了最小平均值，表现出比标准WOA和其他算法更高的解质量。&lt;SEP&gt;针对带作业优先级约束的柔性作业车间调度问题(FJSP-JPC-TST)提出的改进鲸鱼优化算法。在比较实验中，IWOA在12个测试实例中的7个上取得最小的标准差，表现出最优稳定性；其收敛速度较快且在迭代后期保持持续改进，最终收敛质量显著优于对比算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-023&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="标准WOA">
  <data key="d0">标准WOA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">标准的鲸鱼优化算法，作为基准算法与IWOA进行比较，IWOA的CPU时间高于标准WOA，但解质量更优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分层子种群优化策略">
  <data key="d0">分层子种群优化策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA采用的一种策略，通过分层子种群的协同搜索和停滞重启机制来减轻局部搜索停滞，从而增强整体收敛性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="跨种群差分进化策略">
  <data key="d0">跨种群差分进化策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA采用的一种策略，通过对高质量个体应用变异扰动来丰富种群多样性。&lt;SEP&gt;一种跨子种群引入差分进化的策略，对高质量个体应用变异扰动并整合自适应惯性权重。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="自适应惯性权重">
  <data key="d0">自适应惯性权重</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA采用的一种权重调整机制，在搜索早期优先全局探索，后期转向局部开发，以改进收敛能力和解精度。&lt;SEP&gt;在差分进化策略中自适应调整的权重，以增强收敛能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="停滞重启机制">
  <data key="d0">停滞重启机制</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">分层子种群优化策略中的一种机制，用于在搜索停滞时重新启动搜索。&lt;SEP&gt;一种在检测到停滞时重新启动搜索的机制。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="变异扰动">
  <data key="d0">变异扰动</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在跨种群差分进化策略中应用的扰动操作，用于增强种群多样性。&lt;SEP&gt;在差分进化策略中对高质量个体施加的扰动。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-024</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="适应度评估">
  <data key="d0">适应度评估</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA中用于评估解质量的函数，其计算负担是运行时间增加的主要来源。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="正交实验">
  <data key="d0">正交实验</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">用于优化IWOA参数的实验设计方法，在当前测试规模下通过正交实验优化了IWOA的参数。&lt;SEP&gt;基于田口实验设计的实验，通过正交表安排参数组合，以确定最优参数设置。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="表9">
  <data key="d0">表9</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">展示IWOA与对比算法之间Wilcoxon秩和检验结果的表格。&lt;SEP&gt;一张展示Wilcoxon检验结果的数据表，表明IWOA的Avg指标在所有实例中不显著劣于对比算法，且在多数实例中具有显著优势。&lt;SEP&gt;包含六种算法在多个实例上最大完工时间均值实验数据的表格，用于Friedman检验的整体比较。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
