  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在优化算法中可能出现的搜索过程停滞现象，被IWOA的分层子种群优化策略所减轻。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="收敛性能">
  <data key="d0">收敛性能</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法整体收敛的表现，通过分层子种群优化策略得到增强。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="全局探索">
  <data key="d0">全局探索</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">搜索过程中对解空间的广泛探索，在搜索早期被自适应惯性权重所优先。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="局部开发">
  <data key="d0">局部开发</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">搜索过程中对局部最优区域的精细搜索，在搜索后期被自适应惯性权重所侧重。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="收敛能力">
  <data key="d0">收敛能力</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法的收敛能力，通过自适应惯性权重得到改善。</data>
