</node>
<node id="IWOA (Improved Whale Optimization Algorithm)">
  <data key="d0">IWOA (Improved Whale Optimization Algorithm)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种改进的鲸鱼优化算法，用于求解考虑作业优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题，结合分层子种群进化、交叉种群差分进化等策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="考虑作业优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题">
  <data key="d0">考虑作业优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种制造调度问题，作业按照优先级约束在机器上加工，目标是最小化最大完工时间C_max。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="物料清单(BOM)树结构">
  <data key="d0">物料清单(BOM)树结构</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">定义作业之间层次约束的树状结构，用于优先级约束修复。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="编码方案">
  <data key="d0">编码方案</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">生成初始种群时使用的个体编码方法，包含操作序列等信息。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="优先级约束修复机制">
  <data key="d0">优先级约束修复机制</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">对个体操作序列进行修复的方法，以确保其符合物料清单树结构定义的作业层次约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="主动调度解码策略">
  <data key="d0">主动调度解码策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种主动调度解码方法,采用不严格遵循操作编码序列,而是优先选择能使工序最早开始加工的方案,同时遵守混合优先级约束。&lt;SEP&gt;一种将个体编码解码为主动调度的策略，用于计算适应度值，内部使用二进制搜索和最早开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="全局最优解">
  <data key="d0">全局最优解</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">到目前为止搜索到的适应度最高的个体调度方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="子种群">
  <data key="d0">子种群</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">通过分层随机采样将整个种群划分成的多个子群，每个子群包含来自不同适应度层次的个体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="WOA (Whale Optimization Algorithm)">
  <data key="d0">WOA (Whale Optimization Algorithm)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">模拟座头鲸气泡网狩猎行为的元启发式优化算法，IWOA的核心位置更新策略基于此。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="交叉种群差分进化策略">
  <data key="d0">交叉种群差分进化策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种对精英个体应用的变异策略，通过引入不同子种群间的信息交换来增强探索能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="分层子种群构建方法">
  <data key="d0">分层子种群构建方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">根据适应度值将种群排序并分层，然后从各个层次中均匀采样以构建多个子种群的方法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="种群重组">
  <data key="d0">种群重组</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">当全局最优解无改善时，合并所有子种群为统一种群并重新分层的操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
