<node id="Improved Whale Optimization Algorithm (IWOA)">
  <data key="d0">Improved Whale Optimization Algorithm (IWOA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">为解决生产作业车间调度问题而提出的改进鲸鱼优化算法。&lt;SEP&gt;一种改进的鲸鱼优化算法，用于解决具有工件优先级的柔性作业车间调度问题，其参数实验中涉及四个关键参数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population size NP">
  <data key="d0">Population size NP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA的关键参数之一，表示种群大小，在实验中设置水平为100、150、200、250。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Number of subpopulations n">
  <data key="d0">Number of subpopulations n</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA的关键参数之一，表示子种群数量，在实验中设置水平为2、3、4、5。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-inertial weight coefficient w_min">
  <data key="d0">Non-inertial weight coefficient w_min</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA的关键参数之一，为非惯性权重系数的最小值，在实验中设置水平为0.2、0.3、0.4、0.5。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Non-inertial weight coefficient w_max">
  <data key="d0">Non-inertial weight coefficient w_max</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA的关键参数之一，为非惯性权重系数的最大值，在实验中设置水平为0.6、0.7、0.8、0.9。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Taguchi orthogonal experimental design">
  <data key="d0">Taguchi orthogonal experimental design</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种实验设计方法，用于确定IWOA参数的最优值，采用四因素四水平设计。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="L_16(4^4) orthogonal array">
  <data key="d0">L_16(4^4) orthogonal array</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">由四个因素各四个水平形成的正交阵列，如表6所示，用于IWOA参数实验。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
