  <data key="d0">Figure 8</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">基于表6数据得出的结果图，用于分析各参数水平对性能的影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Optimal parameter combination">
  <data key="d0">Optimal parameter combination</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">通过参数实验分析确定的IWOA最佳参数组合，具体为NP=250, n=4, w_min=0.3, w_max=0.9。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="C_max (makespan)">
  <data key="d0">C_max (makespan)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">最大完工时间，作为IWOA的优化目标，在实验中记录每个实验的C_max值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-015</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
