</node>
<node id="开始时间(s_{i,j})">
  <data key="d0">开始时间(s_{i,j})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业i的第j个操作的开始时间变量，在数学模型中为非负实数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作完成时间(c_{i,j})">
  <data key="d0">操作完成时间(c_{i,j})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业i的第j个操作的完成时间变量，由开始时间与处理时间计算得出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业完成时间(c_i)">
  <data key="d0">作业完成时间(c_i)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业i的完成时间，定义为最后一个操作的完成时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="处理时间(T_{i,j,k}^{proc})">
  <data key="d0">处理时间(T_{i,j,k}^{proc})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业i的第j个操作在机器k上所需处理时间的参数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器分配变量(x_{i,j,k})">
  <data key="d0">机器分配变量(x_{i,j,k})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二进制决策变量，若操作(i,j)分配给机器k则为1，否则为0。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器间运输时间(T_{k',k}^{trans})">
  <data key="d0">机器间运输时间(T_{k',k}^{trans})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">从机器k' 到机器k之间的运输时间参数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业内运输变量(z_{i,j,k',k})">
  <data key="d0">作业内运输变量(z_{i,j,k',k})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">辅助二进制变量，指示作业i中操作j-1和j分别在机器k' 和k上执行，用于计算作业内运输时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器可执行参数(a_{i,j,k})">
  <data key="d0">机器可执行参数(a_{i,j,k})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二进制参数，若操作(i,j)能在机器k上执行则为1，否则为0。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业间运输变量(v_{i,i',k',k})">
  <data key="d0">作业间运输变量(v_{i,i',k',k})</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">辅助二进制变量，指示有优先关系的两个作业i和i' 的最后操作与第一个操作分别在机器k' 和k上执行，用于计算作业间运输时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-005</data>
