<node id="Improved Harris Hawk Optimization Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Improved Harris Hawk Optimization Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种改进的哈里斯鹰优化算法，用于求解柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-026</data>
