<node id="Whale Optimization Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Whale Optimization Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种模拟座头鲸狩猎行为的群智能优化算法，通过迭代更新解来逼近全局最优解。狩猎过程包括包围猎物、气泡网攻击和搜索猎物三个阶段，并通过自适应切换策略平衡全局探索与局部开发。&lt;SEP&gt;一种群智能优化算法，灵感来源于座头鲸的气泡网捕食行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
