<node id="IWOA1">
  <data key="d0">IWOA1</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA的变体算法，移除了多层次子种群优化策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IWOA2">
  <data key="d0">IWOA2</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA的变体算法，移除了自适应惯性权重。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="IWOA3">
  <data key="d0">IWOA3</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">IWOA的变体算法，移除了跨种群差分进化策略。&lt;SEP&gt;IWOA的一种变体，移除了交叉种群差分进化策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-level Sub-population Optimization Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Multi-level Sub-population Optimization Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">多层子种群优化策略，将种群分为多个子种群进行优化。&lt;SEP&gt;一种在IWOA中使用的改进策略，通过多层次子种群优化提升算法性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adaptive Inertia Weight">
  <data key="d0">Adaptive Inertia Weight</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">自适应惯性权重，在IWOA中用于平衡全局勘探和局部开发。&lt;SEP&gt;引入的自适应惯性权重，用于增强探索与利用之间的平衡。&lt;SEP&gt;一种自适应调整惯性权重的技术，在算法初期采用较大权重增强全局探索，后期采用较小权重提高局部开发，通过余弦衰减和指数衰减两种系数实现。&lt;SEP&gt;IWOA中使用的一种自适应惯性权重策略，用于平衡算法的全局和局部搜索能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Objective Function">
  <data key="d0">Objective Function</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">用于评估调度方案优劣的目标函数，实验中以最小值和平均值作为评价指标。&lt;SEP&gt;模型的目标函数，旨在最小化最大完工时间以及基于作业优先级的惩罚项之和。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Evaluation Metrics">
  <data key="d0">Evaluation Metrics</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">评价算法性能的指标，包括独立运行10次所得目标函数的最小值(Best)和平均值(Avg)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wilcoxon Rank-Sum Test">
  <data key="d0">Wilcoxon Rank-Sum Test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种非参数统计检验方法，用于比较IWOA与变体算法在95%置信水平下的显著性差异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="P-Value">
  <data key="d0">P-Value</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">统计检验中用于判断显著性的概率值，小于0.05表示算法间存在显著差异。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
