<node id="设置时间">
  <data key="d0">设置时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在机器加工序列约束(方程(15)-(17))中，连续加工时需要添加的机器准备时间。&lt;SEP&gt;机器为准备加工下一个工序所需的准备时间,如换刀、调整夹具等。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
