  <data key="d0">运输指示变量</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二进制变量，由方程(8)-(10)定义，指示连续两道操作是否需要在不同机器上运输。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
