<node id="机器唯一性约束">
  <data key="d0">机器唯一性约束</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(5)表示的约束，确保每道操作只能在一台机器上完成加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="候选机器约束">
  <data key="d0">候选机器约束</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(6)表示的约束，要求每道操作必须由其候选机器加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作序列约束">
  <data key="d0">操作序列约束</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(7)表示的约束，规定同一作业内非首道操作的开始时间必须在前道操作结束并加上运输时间之后。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="运输指示逻辑约束">
  <data key="d0">运输指示逻辑约束</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由方程(8)-(10)共同构成的逻辑，用于设置运输指示变量的值，当连续操作的机器分配跨不同机器时激活。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业层次约束">
  <data key="d0">作业层次约束</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(11)表示的约束，定义父作业的首道操作必须在所有子作业完成并加上运输时间之后才能开始。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="运输变量激活逻辑约束">
  <data key="d0">运输变量激活逻辑约束</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由方程(12)-(14)构成的约束，根据子作业末道操作的完成机器和父作业首道操作的分配机器，激活运输变量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
