  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Repair Mechanism Based on Job Priorities">
  <data key="d0">Repair Mechanism Based on Job Priorities</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于作业优先级的修复机制，旨在确保解的可行性并满足作业优先级约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hierarchical Sub-Population Collaboration Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Hierarchical Sub-Population Collaboration Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种分层子种群协作策略，用于在子种群内实现集中局部优化，并实现高质量解在子种群间的迁移。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Crosspopulation Differential Evolution Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Crosspopulation Differential Evolution Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">引入的跨种群差分进化策略，用于增强探索与利用之间的平衡。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Production Job-Shop Scenario">
  <data key="d0">Production Job-Shop Scenario</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">实际的生产作业车间场景，被转换为数学表示。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
