  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Exploration-Exploitation Balance">
  <data key="d0">Exploration-Exploitation Balance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优化算法中探索与利用之间的平衡，通过自适应惯性权重和跨种群差分进化策略得到增强。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Two-Vector Encoding Scheme">
  <data key="d0">Two-Vector Encoding Scheme</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于柔性作业车间调度问题编码的方案，由操作序列向量(OS)和机器选择向量(MS)组成，两者长度相同，等于总操作数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Operation Sequence Vector (OS)">
  <data key="d0">Operation Sequence Vector (OS)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于确定工件操作加工顺序的编码层，通过重复整数表示同一工件的不同操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Machine Selection Vector (MS)">
  <data key="d0">Machine Selection Vector (MS)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于为每个操作从可用设备集中选择指定机器的编码层。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ranked Order Value (ROV) Rule">
  <data key="d0">Ranked Order Value (ROV) Rule</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种通过排序操作编码向量元素值并分配排序值来生成操作序列的规则。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Example 1">
  <data key="d0">Example 1</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">一个来自第3.1节的7工件4机器柔性作业车间调度实例，用于演示编码方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job Priority Tree">
  <data key="d0">Job Priority Tree</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种定义工件间优先级约束的树形结构，其中箭头从子工件指向父工件，表示子工件必须在父工件之前加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Binary Search Tree">
  <data key="d0">Binary Search Tree</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在基于工件优先级的修正机制中使用的一种数据结构，用于根据优先级关系插入和排序操作序列元素。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Correction Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Correction Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于工件优先级修正违反混合约束的不可行解的机制，通过构建二叉搜索树并中序遍历生成符合优先级约束的新操作序列。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Normalization Constant ε">
  <data key="d0">Normalization Constant ε</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在公式(18)中使用的归一化常数，用于将连续值映射到离散机器索引，实验中设置为8。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Machine Position Vector">
  <data key="d0">Machine Position Vector</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在机器编码转换过程中，包含连续值的向量，其值通过公式(18)转换为离散的机器索引，以确定最终机器分配。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Operation Encoding Vector">
  <data key="d0">Operation Encoding Vector</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在操作编码转换过程中，包含连续值的向量，其元素值通过排序值(ROV)规则排序并转换为操作序列。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-008</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-level sub-population optimization strategy">
  <data key="d0">Multi-level sub-population optimization strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种通过分层采样和重组机制维持种群多样性并避免过早收敛的优化策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adaptive Inertia Weight strategy">
  <data key="d0">Adaptive Inertia Weight strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种通过动态调整搜索步长来改善算法全局探索与局部开发平衡的策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wilcoxon test">
  <data key="d0">Wilcoxon test</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于统计检验IWOA与变体算法性能差异显著性的威尔科克森符号秩检验。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Hierarchical sampling">
  <data key="d0">Hierarchical sampling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">多级子种群优化策略中用于维持种群多样性的分层采样技术。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recombination mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Recombination mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">多级子种群优化策略中通过重组操作避免过早收敛的机制。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Search step size">
  <data key="d0">Search step size</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">自适应惯性权重策略中动态调整的参数，影响算法的搜索行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Population diversity">
  <data key="d0">Population diversity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优化算法中种群的多样性程度，影响算法搜索能力和收敛行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Premature convergence">
  <data key="d0">Premature convergence</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法过早收敛到局部最优解而未能充分探索搜索空间的现象。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Global exploration">
  <data key="d0">Global exploration</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法在全局范围内搜索新解的能力，维持探索未知区域。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local exploitation">
  <data key="d0">Local exploitation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法对已知优质解的邻域进行细致搜索以改进解的质量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Local optima traps">
  <data key="d0">Local optima traps</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在复杂问题结构中，算法陷入局部最优解而无法逃脱的情况。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-018</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作编码">
  <data key="d0">操作编码</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">在柔性作业车间调度中,用于表示所有工件工序排列顺序的编码,记为OS。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器选择编码">
  <data key="d0">机器选择编码</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">为每个工序分配加工机器的编码方式,记为MS。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="混合优先级约束">
  <data key="d0">混合优先级约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">调度中考虑工件之间优先级关系的约束条件,如父工件必须等待子工件完成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="空闲窗口">
  <data key="d0">空闲窗口</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器时间线上两个已调度任务之间的空闲时间段,可用于插入新工序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工作时间窗">
  <data key="d0">工作时间窗</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器上已调度工序的时间段集合,每个窗口由开始时间和结束时间定义。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总生产完工时间">
  <data key="d0">总生产完工时间</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">最后一个工件完成加工的时间,即最大完工时间,用作调度优化的适应度值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="父工件">
  <data key="d0">父工件</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">具有子工件的工件,其首道工序必须等所有子工件加工和运输完成后才能开始。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="子工件">
  <data key="d0">子工件</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">隶属于父工件的工件,需在父工件首工序开始前完成自身的全部加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="前序工序">
  <data key="d0">前序工序</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在工件加工序列中,位于当前工序之前且紧邻的已完成工序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="前置工件">
  <data key="d0">前置工件</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在柔性作业车间调度中，对于无父子关系的工件，可能需要在目标工件首工序之前完成的某个工件。如果工件没有前置工件，其首工序的最早开始时间只考虑机器设置约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器任务队列">
  <data key="d0">机器任务队列</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器上按时间顺序排列的已调度工序列表，当没有合适的空闲窗口容纳新工序时，新工序被追加到该队列的尾端。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time">
  <data key="d0">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出了一种考虑作业优先级、运输时间和准备时间的柔性作业车间调度问题，建立了优化模型，提出了改进鲸鱼优化算法以最小化完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
