<node id="Setup Time">
  <data key="d0">Setup Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器为加工新作业所需的准备时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job Priorities">
  <data key="d0">Job Priorities</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">基于物料清单的层次结构赋予作业的优先级，约束作业依赖关系。&lt;SEP&gt;DRFJSP-OJP中作业具有不同优先级，需优先调度高优先级任务。&lt;SEP&gt;作业优先级，用于确保高价值订单的及时完成。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-041&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="BOM">
  <data key="d0">BOM</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">物料清单，组织中间组件和最终产品的层次结构，约束作业开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NP-hard problem">
  <data key="d0">NP-hard problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一类至少与NP中最难问题同等难度的问题；FJSP-JPC-TST属于NP-hard问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
