<node id="ISA_VCLDC">
  <data key="d0">ISA_VCLDC</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种启发式算法，考虑作业优先级，但不考虑运输时间和设置时间，在比较实验中用于求解FJSP-JPC-TST问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
