</node>
<node id="FJSP-JPC-TST问题">
  <data key="d0">FJSP-JPC-TST问题</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">考虑作业优先级、运输时间和设置时间的柔性作业车间调度问题(Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities, Transportation Time, and Setup Time)。</data>
