  <data key="d0">Bubble-net Attacking</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">鲸鱼优化算法中个体沿对数螺旋路径向最优解移动并缩紧包围圈的攻击行为阶段。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Searching for Prey">
  <data key="d0">Searching for Prey</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">鲸鱼优化算法中个体随机选择另一个体并向其移动以探索新区域的行为阶段。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Adaptive Switching Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Adaptive Switching Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">鲸鱼优化算法中基于动态参数的绝对值控制全局探索与局部开发切换的策略，早期促进探索，后期加强开发。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="eFJSP">
  <data key="d0">eFJSP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">扩展柔性作业车间调度问题，由Birgin等人定义，同时处理工作优先级约束和操作顺序约束，并建立了混合整数规划模型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP-JPC">
  <data key="d0">FJSP-JPC</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">考虑工作优先级约束的柔性作业车间调度问题，是FJSP的重要扩展之一。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器设置时间">
  <data key="d0">机器设置时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器在加工不同工件前进行准备所需的时间，包括调整、更换工具等，影响生产计划的效率和流畅性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="离散灰狼算法嵌入细胞结构">
  <data key="d0">离散灰狼算法嵌入细胞结构</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Zhu和Zhou提出，采用三向量编码结合二叉排序树优先级修正机制，并设计嵌入细胞结构的离散灰狼算法求解FJSP-JPC。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基于新遗传算子和局部搜索的改进遗传算法">
  <data key="d0">基于新遗传算子和局部搜索的改进遗传算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Gao等人提出，设计新的遗传算子以确保编码合法性，并基于机器的局部搜索增强优化能力，用于求解FJSP-JPC。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基于操作关系矩阵表的改进遗传算法">
  <data key="d0">基于操作关系矩阵表的改进遗传算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Lei等人提出，基于动态关系矩阵设计编码以确保序列约束，设计新的交叉和变异算子，以及矩阵表解码方法，求解FJSP-JPC。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="洗牌细胞进化灰狼优化器">
  <data key="d0">洗牌细胞进化灰狼优化器</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Zhu等人提出，通过三向量编码和二叉排序树修复机制处理工作优先级约束，利用细胞邻域结构实现并行优化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基于多微群领导层次的优化算法">
  <data key="d0">基于多微群领导层次的优化算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Zhu等人提出，针对具有区间灰处理时间的FJSP-JPC，通过建立多微群领导层次、划分多个独立微群系统并行搜索，并设计双向定量编码和启发式主动灰解码方法，实现机器分配动态决策和不确定灰调度方案构建。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="混合自适应差分进化算法">
  <data key="d0">混合自适应差分进化算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Li等人提出，针对考虑外包策略的FJSP-JPC，最小化不同优先级权重下的加权逾期日数，引入约束处理机制确保外包条件满足。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="改进模因算法">
  <data key="d0">改进模因算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Zhang等人提出，针对考虑运输时间的作业车间调度，构建精英库区分对待解，对一般解进行模拟退火，对局部最优解进行变异以增强多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="改进动物迁徙优化算法">
  <data key="d0">改进动物迁徙优化算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Jiang等人提出，同时考虑运输时间和恶化过程，改进动物迁徙优化算法求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基于多智能体系统的分散调度">
  <data key="d0">基于多智能体系统的分散调度</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Pal等人提出，通过拍卖机制动态分配机器资源，结合灰狼优化与基于关键路径的邻域搜索优化操作序列。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基于遗传规划的协同进化算法">
  <data key="d0">基于遗传规划的协同进化算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Chen等人提出，使用超启发式生成调度规则，结合自适应局部搜索，用于求解考虑运输时间的FJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="蒙特卡洛树搜索算法">
  <data key="d0">蒙特卡洛树搜索算法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由He等人提出，针对工业生产中不确定性动态事件，建立基于运输时间的时间补偿重调度模型，并使用蒙特卡洛树搜索求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
