<node id="基于层次约束的交叉和变异算子">
  <data key="d0">基于层次约束的交叉和变异算子</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Zou等人设计的算子，用于求解FJSP-JPC，基于层次约束的交叉算子和变异算子，但导致大规模问题解过于复杂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="蚁群算法结合仿真与Neo4j语义图方法">
  <data key="d0">蚁群算法结合仿真与Neo4j语义图方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">由Zhu等人提出的方法，结合蚁群算法、仿真和Neo4j语义图处理带优先级约束的FJSP，但频繁修改图形数据导致计算效率降低。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Improved IWOA">
  <data key="d0">Improved IWOA</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种改进的鲸鱼优化算法，结合多层级子种群优化策略和自适应惯性权重来平衡全局探索与局部开发能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Level Sub-Population Optimization Strategy">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Level Sub-Population Optimization Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种受生态协同进化启发的分层子种群协同优化策略，通过分层随机抽样将种群分为多个子种群独立进化，并利用重组机制交换信息以避免局部最优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cosine Decay Inertia Weight Coefficient w">
  <data key="d0">Cosine Decay Inertia Weight Coefficient w</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由公式(33)定义的余弦衰减惯性权重系数，用于局部开发阶段的包围猎物和气泡网攻击行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Exponential Inertia Weight Coefficient v">
  <data key="d0">Exponential Inertia Weight Coefficient v</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">由公式(34)定义的指数衰减惯性权重系数，用于全局探索阶段的随机搜索猎物行为。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Recombination Mechanism">
  <data key="d0">Recombination Mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在多层级子种群优化策略中，当优化停滞时将子种群合并并重新分层抽样以促进信息交换的机制。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Stratified Random Sampling">
  <data key="d0">Stratified Random Sampling</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于适应度值分层的抽样方法，从各层抽取等量个体构成子种群，确保子种群包含不同水平的个体。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Position Update Formulas">
  <data key="d0">Position Update Formulas</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">改进鲸鱼优化算法中融入惯性权重后的个体位置更新公式，如公式(35)所示，根据条件选择不同模式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-011</data>
  <data key="d4">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785848814</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP_{PIS}^{+Batching}">
