<node id="FJSP^{+Batching}">
  <data key="d0">FJSP^{+Batching}</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题的批处理变体，要求所有作业均需调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP^{+Batching}_{Selective}">
  <data key="d0">FJSP^{+Batching}_{Selective}</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">柔性作业车间调度问题的选择性批处理变体，仅优先作业必须调度，普通作业可选择性调度以最大化总产量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJS{\bar{P}}_{PJS}^{+Batching}">
  <data key="d0">FJS{\bar{P}}_{PJS}^{+Batching}</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种数学规划模型，用于计算优先作业的X-factor，支持选择性调度策略。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Raw Process Time">
  <data key="d0">Raw Process Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">原始加工时间，指作业的理论加工时间，是计算X-factor的关键组成部分。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Total Amount Of Production">
  <data key="d0">Total Amount Of Production</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">总产量，即被调度的作业总数，是选择性调度中需要最大化的性能指标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Semiconductor Manufacturing">
  <data key="d0">Semiconductor Manufacturing</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">半导体制造行业，涉及复杂的晶圆加工流程。&lt;SEP&gt;半导体制造行业，PJS问题的一个典型应用领域。&lt;SEP&gt;半导体制造业，是X-factor指标被广泛用于评估运营水平的行业领域。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fattahi等人">
  <data key="d0">Fattahi等人</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">生成FJSP测试实例的研究人员群体，其创建的实例被本研究借用。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="批量处理">
  <data key="d0">批量处理</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在机器上同时处理多个作业的调度要求。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP_Selective+Batching模型">
  <data key="d0">FJSP_Selective+Batching模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本研究提出的选择性作业调度模型，在批量处理的基础上允许选择部分作业进行调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
