  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">由Fattahi等人随机生成的中大规模柔性作业车间调度问题实例集合，共10个实例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
