</node>
<node id="A. Ham/Applied Mathematical Modelling 45 (2017) 551–562">
  <data key="d0">A. Ham/Applied Mathematical Modelling 45 (2017) 551–562</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一篇学术论文，报告了灵活作业车间调度问题的计算实验结果。&lt;SEP&gt;由A. Ham撰写的学术论文，发表于Applied Mathematical Modelling期刊2017年第45卷，页码551-562，研究并行批处理机的柔性作业车间调度问题，包含优先级作业调度测试实例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
