<node id="Priority Job">
  <data key="d0">Priority Job</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">半导体制造中因财务补偿而需加急处理的紧急作业。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="NP-hard Structure">
  <data key="d0">NP-hard Structure</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">问题的计算复杂性类别，难以在多项式时间内求得最优解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job-dependent Processing Time">
  <data key="d0">Job-dependent Processing Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器的处理时间因作业类型不同而变化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job-independent Processing Time">
  <data key="d0">Job-independent Processing Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">假设机器对所有作业的处理时间相同，以简化计算。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Priority Job Scheduler">
  <data key="d0">Priority Job Scheduler</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">用于调度优先作业的系统，以避免因紧急作业导致的生产力损失。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Wet-diffusion Area Scheduling Problem">
  <data key="d0">Wet-diffusion Area Scheduling Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">湿法扩散区域的调度问题，包含2-4个连续步骤和并行批处理机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Compatible Job Families">
  <data key="d0">Compatible Job Families</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">可以一起在同一批处理机器上加工的作业族。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Modified MIP Formulation">
  <data key="d0">Modified MIP Formulation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">原MIP模型的修改版本，可以选择性调度作业，优先对高优先级作业的整数变量进行分支，假设机器处理时间与作业无关。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Computational Time">
  <data key="d0">Computational Time</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">求解问题所需的计算时间，模型修改后显著减少。&lt;SEP&gt;求解问题所需的计算时间，PJS问题关注其优化。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Process Plan Flexibility">
  <data key="d0">Process Plan Flexibility</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在作业车间调度中，允许作业选择替代工艺路线的灵活性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sequence Dependent Setup Times">
  <data key="d0">Sequence Dependent Setup Times</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器准备时间依赖于前一作业的类型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexible Preventive Maintenance">
  <data key="d0">Flexible Preventive Maintenance</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">可灵活安排的预防性设备维护计划。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
