  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families">
  <data key="d0">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">本文标题，提出了一种针对带有并行批处理机和兼容作业族的柔性作业车间调度问题的MIP模型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Applied Mathematical Modelling 45">
  <data key="d0">Applied Mathematical Modelling 45</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">期刊Applied Mathematical Modelling的第45卷，发表了一篇关于调度问题的论文。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(3.2)">
  <data key="d0">约束(3.2)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">根据作业优先级区分强制调度和选择性调度的约束条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(3.3)">
  <data key="d0">约束(3.3)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">计算与目标X因子偏差的约束条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="目标(3.4)">
  <data key="d0">目标(3.4)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">最大化按优先级加权的生产总量的目标函数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="目标(3.5)">
  <data key="d0">目标(3.5)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">惩罚与目标相比X因子未完成量的目标函数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="X因子">
  <data key="d0">X因子</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一个度量标准，用于衡量调度性能，其偏差和未完成量受到惩罚。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(3.1)">
  <data key="d0">约束(3.1)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">与约束(3.2)一起根据作业优先级区分强制调度和选择性调度的约束条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="强制调度">
  <data key="d0">强制调度</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">必须按照调度计划进行的作业安排。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="选择性调度">
  <data key="d0">选择性调度</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">可以根据情况选择性进行的作业安排。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Classical Job-Shop Scheduling Problem (JSP)">
  <data key="d0">Classical Job-Shop Scheduling Problem (JSP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">经典的作业车间调度问题，要求在预定义的机器上按顺序加工操作，目标是最小化所有作业的最大完成时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Maximum Completion Time (Cmax)">
  <data key="d0">Maximum Completion Time (Cmax)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">所有作业全部完成所需的最短时间，是JSP和FJSP的主要优化目标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Heuristics">
  <data key="d0">Heuristics</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于经验和规则的优化方法，常用于求解FJSP，速度快但需要精细调参。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Mathematical Modeling Approach">
  <data key="d0">Mathematical Modeling Approach</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">将问题表示和求解策略分离的建模方法，本文探索使用该方法处理FJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Demir and Isleyen">
  <data key="d0">Demir and Isleyen</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">研究人员，创建了FJSP数学模型的文献概览表(表1)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP Mathematical Models">
  <data key="d0">FJSP Mathematical Models</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于表示和求解FJSP的数学公式集合，可分为不同类型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Sequence-Position Variable Based">
  <data key="d0">Sequence-Position Variable Based</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于序列-位置变量的FJSP数学公式类型，本文提出的模型基于此类型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
