<node id="Proposed Model">
  <data key="d0">Proposed Model</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出的数学模型，基于序列-位置变量，首次以数学规划形式处理带批处理的FJSP，并对PJS问题进行修改以降低计算时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Priority Job Scheduler (PJS)">
  <data key="d0">Priority Job Scheduler (PJS)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种调度系统或方法，旨在使高优先级的作业尽快通过工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Business Requirements">
  <data key="d0">Business Requirements</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">驱动优先作业快速完成需求的业务条件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Priority Jobs">
  <data key="d0">Priority Jobs</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">需要优先处理、快速完成的作业，其处理优先级高于普通作业。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Manual and Automated Schemes">
  <data key="d0">Manual and Automated Schemes</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">防止优先作业在机器前排队的手动和自动化方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Cycle Time">
  <data key="d0">Cycle Time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业在工厂中从开始到完成所经历的时间，是衡量处理效率的指标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PJS Problem">
  <data key="d0">PJS Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在半导体制造中遇到的优先作业调度问题，涉及快速完成优先作业并降低计算时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
