  <data key="d0">FJSP Instance with 5 Jobs, 6 Machines, and 3 Steps</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">一个包含5个作业、6台机器、3个步骤的带批处理FJSP具体实例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Plan Flexibility">
  <data key="d0">Plan Flexibility</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSP的一个变体，涉及计划柔性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Setup">
  <data key="d0">Setup</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSP的一个变体，考虑装设时间或活动。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Overlapping">
  <data key="d0">Overlapping</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSP的一个变体，允许操作重叠执行。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器利用率">
  <data key="d0">机器利用率</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器被利用程度的度量，在优先作业调度中常常与作业周期时间进行权衡。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="问题表示">
  <data key="d0">问题表示</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在优化方法中，对问题结构进行编码的方式，启发式方法将其与求解策略整合，而数学建模方法将其分离。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="求解策略">
  <data key="d0">求解策略</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在优化方法中，寻找问题解决方案的算法或方法，启发式方法将其与问题表示整合，而数学建模方法将其分离。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP^+Batching模型">
  <data key="d0">FJSP^+Batching模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种柔性作业车间调度模型，整合了批处理操作。在初步实验中，对于大规模实例，该模型在数小时计算时间内未能生成有效解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型">
  <data key="d0">FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSP^+Batching模型的一种变体，允许选择性作业调度，专注于优先级作业，并允许部分作业不被调度。通过修改路径约束和目标函数来实现。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="行业领域专家">
  <data key="d0">行业领域专家</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">来自行业的领域专家，通过访谈提供了关于选择性作业调度和加工时间假设的关键见解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="二进制变量$X_{jsmk}$">
  <data key="d0">二进制变量$X_{jsmk}$</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">FJSP模型中的二进制决策变量，表示作业j的操作s被分配到机器m的位置k上。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(2.1)">
  <data key="d0">约束(2.1)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">修改后的路径约束，确保每个作业的每个操作最多被分配到一个机器和一个位置。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(2.2)">
  <data key="d0">约束(2.2)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">新增约束，强制一旦作业被选择调度，则必须完成其所有操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="目标(2.3)">
  <data key="d0">目标(2.3)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">最大化目标函数，对每个被调度的作业给予大额奖励，以防止求解器丢弃所有作业。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(2.4)">
  <data key="d0">约束(2.4)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">定义作业完成时间的约束，基于机器在特定位置的完成时间和大M法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(2.5)">
  <data key="d0">约束(2.5)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">定义最大完工时间(Cmax)为所有作业完成时间中的最大值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束(2.6)">
  <data key="d0">约束(2.6)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">在假设加工时间与作业无关的情况下，计算机器完成时间的约束，替代原始约束(1.6)。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="加工时间假设">
  <data key="d0">加工时间假设</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">假设一台机器在不同作业上具有相等的加工时间，除微小变化外，这种假设可减少计算时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
