</node>
<node id="A. Ham, Applied Mathematical Modelling 45 (2017) 551–562">
  <data key="d0">A. Ham, Applied Mathematical Modelling 45 (2017) 551–562</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">包含所提出模型和计算研究的学术论文。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP_{Selective}^{+Batching}模型">
  <data key="d0">FJSP_{Selective}^{+Batching}模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于柔性作业车间调度的选择性批量处理模型，包含路径选择、调度和测量约束，目标为最小化Cmax并最大化总L值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FJSP_{PIS}^{+Batching}模型">
  <data key="d0">FJSP_{PIS}^{+Batching}模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种考虑X因子控制的柔性作业车间调度模型，引入优先级、目标X因子和理论周期时间等参数，并生成X因子未达标量变量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最小化Cmax">
  <data key="d0">最小化Cmax</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一个优化目标，旨在最小化最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785850067</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大化∑L(X)">
  <data key="d0">最大化∑L(X)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一个优化目标，旨在最大化所有X变量的某种函数和。</data>
