</node>
<node id="Distributed FJSP">
  <data key="d0">Distributed FJSP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，涉及多个地理位置分散的工厂或车间的协同调度。&lt;SEP&gt;分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(Distributed Flexible Job-shop Scheduling Problem)的缩写，扩展了FJSP，将生产任务分配到多个分布式工厂中。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Fuzzy FJSP">
  <data key="d0">Fuzzy FJSP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">模糊柔性作业车间调度问题(Fuzzy Flexible Job-shop Scheduling Problem)的缩写，在FJSP中引入模糊处理时间等不确定因素。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工人柔性">
  <data key="d0">工人柔性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指生产系统中工人具备多种技能，可以在不同机器或工序间灵活调配的能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="加工顺序柔性">
  <data key="d0">加工顺序柔性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指在调度问题中，工序的加工顺序可以根据优化需要灵活调整，而不完全固定。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工人协作柔性">
  <data key="d0">工人协作柔性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指工人之间可以通过协作完成同一任务，任务可能由多个工人共同处理的灵活性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="学习-遗忘效应">
  <data key="d0">学习-遗忘效应</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工人的学习曲线和遗忘曲线对生产效率的影响。&lt;SEP&gt;指工人执行任务时，随着经验积累效率提高(学习效应)，而长时间不执行同一任务时效率下降(遗忘效应)的现象。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="离线操作">
  <data key="d0">离线操作</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">无需在加工线上使用机器资源，但必须由具备相应技能的工人完成的工序，如低温处理、时效和标记等。&lt;SEP&gt;不需要机器资源的工序，可在加工线之外进行，无需同时分配机器和工人。&lt;SEP&gt;指某些工序可以在机器之外独立进行，不占用机器资源，可以与机器加工并行执行的操作模式。&lt;SEP&gt;不需要机器加工，工人需要离开加工线执行的操作类型，由符号^c0^c表示。&lt;SEP&gt;一种不需要机器资源、仅由工人执行的操作类型，工人处于离线处理模式。&lt;SEP&gt;需要在固定工作站上由工人独立完成的工序，包括时效、喷砂、打标和去毛刺等。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-006&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-036</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="单关键路径">
  <data key="d0">单关键路径</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指在调度方案中，仅识别并使用一条关键路径来指导优化，通常用于缩短最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="双关键路径">
  <data key="d0">双关键路径</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指在调度方案中，同时识别并利用两条关键路径进行协同优化，以解决更复杂的调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多关键路径">
  <data key="d0">多关键路径</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指在调度方案中，识别并利用多条关键路径共同驱动进化算法，以应对双资源约束等复杂场景。&lt;SEP&gt;调度问题中的多个关键路径概念，是问题特定邻域搜索的设计基础。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="主动解码">
  <data key="d0">主动解码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种解码方法，在将编码转换为调度方案时，尽可能将工序安排在最早可行的时刻，以生成主动调度方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="半主动解码">
  <data key="d0">半主动解码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种解码方法，在生成调度方案时，在不延迟其他工序的前提下，将工序向左移动，但不强制生成主动调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="三层分段编码">
  <data key="d0">三层分段编码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种改进的三层编码方法，将编码分为多个段，分别适应不同的约束或资源，以提高算法性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多段主动解码">
  <data key="d0">多段主动解码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种结合多段编码的主动解码方法，在解码过程中针对不同的编码段分别进行主动调度安排。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="五层编码">
  <data key="d0">五层编码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种编码方法，使用五层结构表示调度信息，常用于分布式调度等复杂场景。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="两层编码">
  <data key="d0">两层编码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种简化的编码方法，使用两层结构表示调度信息，通常用于约束较少的问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="随机键编码">
  <data key="d0">随机键编码</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种使用随机键来表示调度解的方法，常用于连续优化算法如遗传算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器速度">
  <data key="d0">机器速度</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">机器运行的速度，直接影响工序的加工时间。&lt;SEP&gt;指在调度问题中，机器的加工速度可以调整，以影响生产效率和能耗。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器布局">
  <data key="d0">机器布局</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指车间中机器的物理布局方式，影响物料运输时间和生产流程。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="运输">
  <data key="d0">运输</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指在调度问题中需要考虑工件或物料在机器之间的运输时间或资源约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="AGV分配">
  <data key="d0">AGV分配</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指自动导引车(Automated Guided Vehicles)的分配问题，在调度中需要决定AGV的路径和任务。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="二型模糊处理时间">
  <data key="d0">二型模糊处理时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指使用二型模糊集来表示工序处理时间的不确定性，用于模糊调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器耐久性">
  <data key="d0">机器耐久性</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指机器在连续长时间工作中的耐久程度，需要考虑机器疲劳和维护对调度的影响。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多任务工人">
  <data key="d0">多任务工人</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指工人可以同时处理多个任务，即工人具备多任务并行处理能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工人班次">
  <data key="d0">工人班次</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指工人的工作班次安排，包括不同班次的工作时间和休息，影响工人的可用时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="辅助资源">
  <data key="d0">辅助资源</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">指生产过程中除机器和工人外所需的额外资源，如工具、夹具等，调度时需考虑其分配。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ZQL17">
  <data key="d0">ZQL17</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ZQL17是一个基准测试实例，其特征数值包括：26、10、8、区间[7,8]、194、7.46、26.29%和295。&lt;SEP&gt;基准实例ZQL17，属于ZQL测试套件，详细参数未在本文给出。&lt;SEP&gt;一种算法变体，在消融实验中报告了Makespan和PSD指标数据&lt;SEP&gt;用于实验的双资源柔性作业车间调度问题实例。&lt;SEP&gt;一个调度问题实例，在表格中列出了其在不同算法下的性能指标数值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-033</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ZQL18">
  <data key="d0">ZQL18</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ZQL18是一个基准测试实例，其特征数值包括：28、11、7、区间[4,9]、172、6.14、16.28%和260。&lt;SEP&gt;基准实例ZQL18，属于ZQL测试套件，详细参数未在本文给出。&lt;SEP&gt;一种算法变体，在消融实验中报告了Makespan和PSD指标数据&lt;SEP&gt;用于实验的双资源柔性作业车间调度问题实例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ZQL19">
  <data key="d0">ZQL19</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ZQL19是一个基准测试实例，其特征数值包括：30、11、9、区间[7,7]、210、7.00、20.95%和315。&lt;SEP&gt;基准实例ZQL19，属于ZQL测试套件，详细参数未在本文给出。&lt;SEP&gt;在消融实验分析中特别提及的基准测试实例。&lt;SEP&gt;一种算法变体，在消融实验中报告了Makespan和PSD指标数据&lt;SEP&gt;ZQL测试套件中的一个测试实例，MCPEA在该实例上平均完工时间优于KMA。&lt;SEP&gt;用于实验的双资源柔性作业车间调度问题实例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-020&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-022</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="ZQL20">
  <data key="d0">ZQL20</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">ZQL20是一个基准测试实例，其特征数值包括：30、12、10、区间[6,10]、234、7.80、22.22%和355。&lt;SEP&gt;基准实例ZQL20，属于ZQL测试套件，详细参数未在本文给出。&lt;SEP&gt;一种算法变体，在消融实验中报告了Makespan和PSD指标数据&lt;SEP&gt;用于实验的双资源柔性作业车间调度问题实例。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-026&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-020</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PSD指标">
  <data key="d0">PSD指标</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种性能指标，在表中与Makespan并列出现，具体含义可能为正向标准差或类似度量</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-026</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Global Critical Path">
  <data key="d0">Global Critical Path</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">全局关键路径是针对调度问题中所有作业集合定义的关键路径，用于识别影响整体最大完工时间的关键操作序列。&lt;SEP&gt;DRFJSP-OJP问题中定义的唯一全局关键路径。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-016&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-041</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Highest Priority Local Critical Path">
  <data key="d0">Highest Priority Local Critical Path</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">最高优先级局部关键路径是针对具有最高优先级的作业集合定义的局部关键路径，其最大完工时间与全局关键路径相同。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Second Priority Local Critical Path">
  <data key="d0">Second Priority Local Critical Path</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">次优先级局部关键路径是针对具有第二优先级的作业集合定义的局部关键路径。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Critical Operation">
  <data key="d0">Critical Operation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">关键操作是关键路径上的操作，如果某个操作满足特定条件(如时间连续)，则被定义为关键操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Common Critical Operation Set">
  <data key="d0">Common Critical Operation Set</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">公共关键操作集合是通过比较全局关键路径和各局部关键路径抽取出的共同关键操作集合。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="All Jobs Set">
  <data key="d0">All Jobs Set</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">全体作业集合是调度问题中涉及的所有作业的集合，用于定义全局关键路径。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Highest Priority Job Set">
  <data key="d0">Highest Priority Job Set</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">最高优先级作业集合包含作业J_3、J_5和J_7，是用于定义最高优先级局部关键路径的作业集合。</data>
