<node id="Worker Time Continuity">
  <data key="d0">Worker Time Continuity</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工人时间连续性是在识别DRFJSP-OJP关键路径时考虑的一个因素，如果工人执行的先前操作与当前关键操作在时间上连续，则先前操作也可定义为关键操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Lowest Priority Local Critical Path">
  <data key="d0">Lowest Priority Local Critical Path</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">最低优先级局部关键路径是针对具有最低优先级的作业集合定义的局部关键路径，其所有关键操作都包含在全局关键路径中，因为它们共享相同的最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-016</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854001</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
