<node id="操作不可中断约束">
  <data key="d0">操作不可中断约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一道操作一旦开始加工，不允许中断，必须连续进行直至完成。&lt;SEP&gt;方程(21)：规定每个操作一旦开始就不能中断，即非抢占式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="忽略转移时间假设">
  <data key="d0">忽略转移时间假设</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件或工人在机器间的转移时间可忽略不计，不影响调度安排。</data>
