  <data key="d0">机器工人同时空闲约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一道操作只有在所分配的机器和工人均处于空闲状态时才能开始加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854046</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基于共同关键操作的邻域结构">
  <data key="d0">基于共同关键操作的邻域结构</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种在多关键路径协同进化算法中用于双资源约束调度问题的邻域结构，通过重新定位关键操作来减少最大完工时间，优化资源利用率并提升调度效率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
