  <data key="d0">插入条件</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">判断关键操作O_{ij} 是否可以移动到某个空闲时间段的条件，要求操作开始时间加处理时间不超过后继操作的最小最早开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-017</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
