</node>
<node id="DFSPJP">
  <data key="d0">DFSPJP</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(Distributed Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem)，一种涉及多工厂、多车间、多机器的复杂制造调度优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="DFSPJP数学模型">
  <data key="d0">DFSPJP数学模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">针对DFSPJP建立的数学规划模型，包含优化目标、约束条件，节选自A. He等人的论文，用于描述调度问题的数学关系。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="优化目标">
  <data key="d0">优化目标</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">此处指除最大完工时间外的其他优化目标，具体为f1、f2和f3，分别由方程(3)-(5)计算，其详细定义未在输入文本中给出。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器位置分配约束">
  <data key="d0">机器位置分配约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(6)：确保每个操作必须分配到一个机器上的一个位置。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器位置顺序约束">
  <data key="d0">机器位置顺序约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(7)：规定每个机器上的加工位置必须按顺序分配给操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业工序顺序约束">
  <data key="d0">作业工序顺序约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(8)：确保各作业操作之间的加工顺序约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作不重叠约束">
  <data key="d0">操作不重叠约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(9)-(11)：确保每台机器在每个位置最多安排一个操作，以避免操作重叠。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="开始时间与处理持续时间关联">
  <data key="d0">开始时间与处理持续时间关联</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(12)-(13)：描述机器上每个位置的开始时间与分配操作的处理持续时间之间的数学关联。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="完成时间与开始时间关联">
  <data key="d0">完成时间与开始时间关联</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(14)-(15)：建立操作完成时间与开始时间之间的联系。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="运输次数限制">
  <data key="d0">运输次数限制</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(17)：限制每个操作最多在两个工厂、车间或机器之间进行一次运输。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="非负约束">
  <data key="d0">非负约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">方程(18)-(20)：保证开始时间、完成时间以及机器上每个位置的所有后续操作的开始时间大于或等于0。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="图4">
  <data key="d0">图4</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A. He等人在论文中给出的流程图，展示了所提出的NMA算法的流程。&lt;SEP&gt;展示优先权驱动的多层主动解码方案中操作插入两种情况的示意图，包括操作插入空闲时间段和操作调度在末尾。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-007&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf&lt;SEP&gt;A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
