  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-046&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-027&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-019&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-038&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-055&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-057</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="CEM编码算子">
  <data key="d0">CEM编码算子</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种用于分布式柔性作业车间调度的编码算子，具有五个级别，是负载均衡初始化规则的基础。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="负载均衡初始化规则">
  <data key="d0">负载均衡初始化规则</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种新颖的种群初始化规则，基于CEM编码算子，通过优先分配高优先级作业至相同工厂、车间和机器以减少运输，或基于最小累积处理时间选择资源。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工作优先级">
  <data key="d0">工作优先级</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">分配给作业的优先级，用于决定作业操作的排序顺序，高优先级作业被优先处理以优化加权平均时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="作业操作">
  <data key="d0">作业操作</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">作业中的操作，需要分配工厂、车间和机器进行加工，是调度中的基本单元。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854069</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
