<node id="Semi-active decoding">
  <data key="d0">Semi-active decoding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种生成半主动调度的解码方法，其中任何操作都不能通过不延迟其他操作而提前开始。&lt;SEP&gt;半活跃解码，一种解码策略，尽可能提前工序的开始时间，但不一定生成最紧凑的调度方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Active decoding">
  <data key="d0">Active decoding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种生成主动调度的解码方法，任何操作都不能在不改变顺序的情况下提前开始。&lt;SEP&gt;活跃解码，一种解码策略，不延迟任何可调度的工序，生成活跃调度方案。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854073</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Critical-block">
  <data key="d0">Critical-block</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种基于交换关键路径上关键块内操作的邻域结构。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
