<node id="Optimised Scheduling Scheme">
  <data key="d0">Optimised Scheduling Scheme</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">通过MCPEA算法得到的优化调度方案，将生产周期从623缩短至314，延迟率降低33.33%，并且提高了设备利用率，尤其减少了M1、M3、M4的空闲时间，优先保证了高优先级订单J8的生产。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-040</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
