  <data key="d0">S_{ij}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工序(i,j)的开始时间变量，所有调度约束围绕该变量建立先后顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="p_{ije}">
  <data key="d0">p_{ije}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工序(i,j)在设备e上的加工时间参数，直接影响约束中的时间不等式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="B_{ij i'j'}">
  <data key="d0">B_{ij i'j'}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">二元优先变量，用于在方程(8)中决定工序(i,j)与(i',j')在共享设备上的先后顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Y_{ije}">
  <data key="d0">Y_{ije}</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">二元分配变量，表示工序(i,j)是否分配到设备e上执行。</data>
