  <data key="d0">工人分配约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工人分配约束确保如果机器被分配，则必定有一个工人被分配给该机器。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="发布时间约束">
  <data key="d0">发布时间约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">发布时间约束要求每个工件只能在释放之后才能加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="工序顺序约束">
  <data key="d0">工序顺序约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工序顺序约束规定操作的结束时间不能超过其后继操作的开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大完工时间约束">
  <data key="d0">最大完工时间约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">最大完工时间约束规定最后操作的完成时间不能超过最大完工时间Cmax。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="同机在线工序加工约束">
  <data key="d0">同机在线工序加工约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">当两个在线工序在同一台机器上加工时，规定其加工顺序的约束集合。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="同工人独立加工离线工序约束">
  <data key="d0">同工人独立加工离线工序约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">当同一个工人独立加工两个离线工序时，规定其加工顺序的约束集合。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="同工人操作不同机器约束">
  <data key="d0">同工人操作不同机器约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">当同一个工人操作不同机器加工工序时，规定其操作顺序的约束集合。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="同工人混合加工与操作约束">
  <data key="d0">同工人混合加工与操作约束</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">当同一个工人既独立加工一个工序又操作机器加工另一工序时，规定其顺序的约束集合。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="大L方法">
  <data key="d0">大L方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">标准的大L方法通过引入大正数L来确保约束的逻辑正确性，当对应的二元变量为1时激活约束，为0时取消约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="二元变量A">
  <data key="d0">二元变量A</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二元变量A用于建模同一机器上不同工序的加工顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="二元变量B">
  <data key="d0">二元变量B</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二元变量B用于建模同一工人独立加工不同工序的顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="二元变量C">
  <data key="d0">二元变量C</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二元变量C用于建模同一工人操作不同机器的顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854091</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="二元变量D">
  <data key="d0">二元变量D</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">二元变量D用于建模同一工人独立加工工序与操作机器加工工序之间的顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-010</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
