  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工人协作柔性，在DRFJSP中允许处理复杂操作时机器可需要多个工人。&lt;SEP&gt;工人协作灵活性，指多个工人可以协同操作同一台机器或共同完成复杂任务的能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Limited flexible workers">
  <data key="d0">Limited flexible workers</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">有限柔性工人，在DRFJSP中考量工人过度工作可能导致生产力下降。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
