  <data key="d0">Hybrid genetic PSO algorithm based on teaching and learning</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于教与学的混合遗传PSO算法，将遗传算法与粒子群优化结合，用于求解多目标FJSP。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-002</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
