  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="启发式策略1：考虑资源连续性的全局最小工作量启发式">
  <data key="d0">启发式策略1：考虑资源连续性的全局最小工作量启发式</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">随机生成OS层染色体，然后为每个操作选择累计工作量最小的机器和工人，并优先保持与前一操作相同的机器或工人以维持连续性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="启发式策略2：基于工件的局部最小工作量启发式">
  <data key="d0">启发式策略2：基于工件的局部最小工作量启发式</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">按工件顺序为每个操作选择累计工作量最小的机器和工人，并在每个工件完成后将机器和工人的工作量重置为零。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="启发式策略3：最短加工时间启发式">
  <data key="d0">启发式策略3：最短加工时间启发式</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">随机生成OS层染色体，为每个操作选择可选机器中加工时间最短的机器，并从该机器的可用工人集中随机分配工人。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-012</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854094</data>
