<node id="带作业优先级的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSPJP)">
  <data key="d0">带作业优先级的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSPJP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">本文首次提出的DFJSP变体，考虑作业优先级，目标为最小化最大完工时间、总能耗及带优先级作业的加权平均时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="带优先级作业的加权平均时间">
  <data key="d0">带优先级作业的加权平均时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">综合考虑作业优先级和完成时间的调度性能指标。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="新模因算法(NMA)">
  <data key="d0">新模因算法(NMA)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">为解决DFJSPJP而设计的模因算法，结合遗传算法和局部搜索，包含CEM和LSO组件。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="染色体编码方法(CEM)">
  <data key="d0">染色体编码方法(CEM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">NMA中用于生成高质量初始种群的编码方法，充分利用DFJSPJP的结构信息。&lt;SEP&gt;精心设计的染色体编码方法，充分利用DFJSPJP的信息和结构，确保NMA获得高质量初始种群。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="局部搜索方法(LSO)">
  <data key="d0">局部搜索方法(LSO)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">NMA中提出的有效局部搜索策略，用于提高收敛速度和挖掘解空间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854096</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
