<node id="Memetic Algorithm Based on Non-dominated Levels for Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Learn-Forgetting Efect and Worker Cooperation">
  <data key="d0">Memetic Algorithm Based on Non-dominated Levels for Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Learn-Forgetting Efect and Worker Cooperation</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一种基于非支配排序层次的模因算法，用于解决具有学习遗忘效应和工人合作问题的柔性作业车间调度问题。发表于《Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering》2025年第200卷，文章编号110845。DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cie.2024.110845。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-044</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854098</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="A Novel Ga-Cp Method for Fixed-Type Multi-robot Collaborative Scheduling in Flexible Job Shop">
  <data key="d0">A Novel Ga-Cp Method for Fixed-Type Multi-robot Collaborative Scheduling in Flexible Job Shop</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一种新颖的GA-CP方法，用于解决柔性作业车间中固定类型多机器人协作调度问题。发表于《IEEE Transactions on Automation Science and Engineering》2025年第22卷，页码13531-13543。DOI: https://doi.org/10.1109/TASE.2025.3554019。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-044</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854098</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="An Enhanced Memetic Algorithm with Hierarchical Heuristic Neighborhood Search for Type-2 Green Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling">
  <data key="d0">An Enhanced Memetic Algorithm with Hierarchical Heuristic Neighborhood Search for Type-2 Green Fuzzy Flexible Job Shop Scheduling</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一种增强型模因算法，结合分层启发式邻域搜索，用于解决二型绿色模糊柔性作业车间调度问题。发表于《Engineering Applications of Artificial Intelligence》2024年第130卷，文章编号107762。DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.engappai.2023.107762。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-044</data>
