<node id="An Iterated Greedy Algorithm with Acceleration of Job Allocation Probability for Distributed Heterogeneous Permutation Flowshop Scheduling Problem">
  <data key="d0">An Iterated Greedy Algorithm with Acceleration of Job Allocation Probability for Distributed Heterogeneous Permutation Flowshop Scheduling Problem</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一种带有作业分配概率加速的迭代贪婪算法，用于解决分布式异构排列流水车间调度问题。发表于《Swarm and Evolutionary Computation》2024年第88卷，文章编号101580。DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.swevo.2024.101580。</data>
