  <data key="d0">An Efficient Two-Stage Optimization Algorithm for a Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Worker Shift Arrangement</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一种高效的两阶段优化算法，用于解决具有工人轮班安排的柔性作业车间调度问题。发表于《Computers &amp; Operations Research》2024年第171卷，文章编号106785。DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cor.2024.106785。</data>
