  <data key="d0">An Efficient Problem-Specific Evolutionary Algorithm for Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Specific Workers in Highly Customised Manufacturing Systems</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文提出了一种高效的问题特异性进化算法，用于解决高度定制制造系统中具有特定工人的柔性作业车间调度问题。发表于《International Journal of Production Research》2025年第63卷第19期，页码7238-7259。DOI: https://doi.org/10.1080/00207543.2025.2496971。</data>
