<node id="Integrating Machine Layout, Transporter Allocation and Worker Assignment into Job-Shop Scheduling Solved by an Improved Non-dominated Sorting Genetic Algorithm">
  <data key="d0">Integrating Machine Layout, Transporter Allocation and Worker Assignment into Job-Shop Scheduling Solved by an Improved Non-dominated Sorting Genetic Algorithm</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文将机器布局、运输工具分配和工人指派集成到作业车间调度问题中，并使用改进的非支配排序遗传算法进行求解。发表于《Computers &amp; Industrial Engineering》2023年第179卷，文章编号109169。DOI: https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cie.2023.109169。</data>
