  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束2">
  <data key="d0">约束2</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束：每台机器在任何时刻最多只能加工一个操作。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束3">
  <data key="d0">约束3</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">假设：各工件相互独立。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束4">
  <data key="d0">约束4</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">假设：各机器相互独立。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束5">
  <data key="d0">约束5</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">假设：忽略操作间的移动时间和机器的设置时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束6">
  <data key="d0">约束6</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">假设：提前已知工件、操作、工厂、车间、机器对应的加工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束7">
  <data key="d0">约束7</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">假设：提前已知两台机器间、两车间间、两工厂间的运输时间及能耗。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束8">
  <data key="d0">约束8</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">假设：提前已知该批次工件的总优先级n'。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束9">
  <data key="d0">约束9</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束：每个操作必须连续加工，中途不得中断。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="约束10">
  <data key="d0">约束10</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">约束：任何工件的任何操作必须在其前序操作完成后才能开始加工。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="五种类型编码方法(CEM)">
  <data key="d0">五种类型编码方法(CEM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于表示FS、WS、MS、OS和PS向量的编码方法，可表征分布式柔性作业车间调度问题中的工厂选择、车间选择、机器选择、操作顺序和作业优先级。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="FS向量">
  <data key="d0">FS向量</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">工厂选择向量，由对应每个作业操作的工厂编号组成，指示每项操作分配的工厂。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="WS向量">
  <data key="d0">WS向量</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">车间选择向量，由对应每个作业操作的车间编号组成，指示每项操作在所选工厂内的车间分配。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="MS向量">
  <data key="d0">MS向量</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">机器选择向量，由对应每个作业操作的机器编号组成，指示每项操作在所选车间内的机器分配。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="PS向量">
  <data key="d0">PS向量</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">作业优先级向量，记录每个作业的优先级数值，用于确定调度中的作业优先顺序。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="增强型空闲时间插入解码技术">
  <data key="d0">增强型空闲时间插入解码技术</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种解码染色体的方法，通过考虑机器空闲区间，使操作尽可能早地开始加工，以最大化利用机器空闲时间，从而生成主动调度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854106</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(24)">
  <data key="d0">方程(24)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于计算操作最早可加工时间T_p的公式，考虑了前序操作完工时间和运输时间以及空闲区间开始时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854107</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="BBO">
  <data key="d0">BBO</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">生物地理学优化算法，一种基于物种迁移策略的全局优化算法。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(25)">
  <data key="d0">方程(25)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">判断操作是否可以插入空闲区间的条件公式，即最早加工时间加上加工时间是否小于等于区间结束时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="离散迁移算子">
  <data key="d0">离散迁移算子</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">本文提出的基于BBO迁移策略的离散迁移算子，用于辅助种群全局搜索并提高算法收敛速度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方程(26)">
  <data key="d0">方程(26)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">当操作不能插入空闲区间时，用于确定操作可插入开始时间T_b的公式，考虑前序操作完工时间、运输时间和机器上最后操作的完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="余弦迁移率模型">
  <data key="d0">余弦迁移率模型</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">基于余弦函数的迁移率计算模型，用于计算每个个体的迁入率，在中等物种数的个体处产生平缓曲线，在最优和最差个体处变化陡峭。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="主动调度">
  <data key="d0">主动调度</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">一种调度类型，其中每个操作都根据优先级、操作约束和机器约束尽可能早地开始加工，确保生成的调度是主动的。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-009</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="范例学习策略">
  <data key="d0">范例学习策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">用于确定迁出个体的策略，从排序优于当前个体的个体中随机选择一个作为迁出个体，确保共享特征的个体更优。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priorities">
  <data key="d0">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priorities</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">该论文研究了考虑完工时间、总能耗和加权平均工件优先级时间的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题，提出了NMA算法进行求解。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="物种数量">
  <data key="d0">物种数量</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">栖息地内物种的数量，反映栖息地适合物种生存的程度，与适应度值相关。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="栖息地">
  <data key="d0">栖息地</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法中将每个个体视为一个栖息地，物种数量越多代表越适合生存，适应度值越好。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="操作交换方法(OEM)">
  <data key="d0">操作交换方法(OEM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">局部搜索算子中的一种方法，复杂度为O(K·T1·T2)，擅长优化总完工时间和加权工件优先级时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="移民率">
  <data key="d0">移民率</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">个体采纳其他个体特征的概率，即迁入率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="机器交换方法(MEM)">
  <data key="d0">机器交换方法(MEM)</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">局部搜索算子中的一种方法，复杂度为O(K·L1)，擅长优化总能耗。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="迁出率">
  <data key="d0">迁出率</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">个体分享自身特征给其他个体的概率，即迁出率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="移民个体">
  <data key="d0">移民个体</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在迁移过程中采纳其他个体遗传信息的个体，即特征接受方。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="迁出个体">
  <data key="d0">迁出个体</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在迁移过程中提供遗传信息给他人的个体，即特征提供方。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="带工件优先级的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSPJP)">
  <data key="d0">带工件优先级的分布式柔性作业车间调度问题(DFJSPJP)</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">在DFJSP基础上考虑工件优先级的扩展问题，目标包括最小化完工时间、总能耗和加权平均工件优先级时间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="总完工时间">
  <data key="d0">总完工时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优化目标之一，即所有作业完成制造的时间，亦称makespan。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="加权平均工件优先级时间">
  <data key="d0">加权平均工件优先级时间</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">优化目标之一，根据工件优先级加权平均的完成时间，用于衡量高优先级工件的准时交付程度。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854112</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="方案质量">
  <data key="d0">方案质量</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法求解方案的质量，通常通过目标函数值或与最优解的接近程度衡量。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="基准实例">
  <data key="d0">基准实例</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">基于经典FJSP基准实例构建的60个测试实例，用于评估算法性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Taguchi方法">
  <data key="d0">Taguchi方法</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">田口方法，用于校准NMA和比较算法的关键参数。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="计算复杂度">
  <data key="d0">计算复杂度</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">算法资源消耗的衡量指标，NMA的整体计算复杂度为O(max{MN², K·T1·T2, K·L1})。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多层编码机制">
  <data key="d0">多层编码机制</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">NMA中采用的独特编码机制，有助于解决多目标优化问题。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="多目标协同优化策略">
  <data key="d0">多目标协同优化策略</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">NMA中采用的多目标协同优化策略，提升算法在多个目标间的平衡能力。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Flying Fox Optimizer">
  <data key="d0">Flying Fox Optimizer</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">飞狐优化器，一种新型元启发式算法，在未来的工作中可能被引入以增强NMA的性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Dynamic Scheduling Scenario">
  <data key="d0">Dynamic Scheduling Scenario</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">动态调度场景，例如考虑机器故障与计划停机，是未来将工件优先级调度问题扩展的方向。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-032</data>
  <data key="d4">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854119</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="等式(14)">
  <data key="d0">等式(14)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">计算物种数量的公式：S_i = S_max - i，其中S_max为最大物种数，i为个体按适应度排序后的序号。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="等式(15)">
  <data key="d0">等式(15)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">计算移民率的余弦模型公式：λ_i = I/2 (cos(π·S_i/S_max) + 1)，其中I为最大移民率。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="等式(16)">
  <data key="d0">等式(16)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">范例学习策略的公式：x_j: j = randi(1, i)，用于从排序优于当前个体的索引中随机选择迁出个体j。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大物种数">
  <data key="d0">最大物种数</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">参数S_max，表示最大物种数量，设置为种群大小Ps。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="最大移民率">
  <data key="d0">最大移民率</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">参数I，表示最大移民率，设置为1。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Ma (2010)">
  <data key="d0">Ma (2010)</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">一项研究，表明复杂迁移率模型的优化性能优于简单模型。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="种群规模(Ps)">
  <data key="d0">种群规模(Ps)</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">种群中个体的数量，在等式(14)中作为i的上限和最大物种数S_max的值。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-013</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854125</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="生产效率">
  <data key="d0">生产效率</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">生产调度中追求的核心目标之一，通常通过缩短制造周期来实现，MCPEA在提升生产效率的同时满足了优先级约束。</data>
