<node id="Exemplar Learning Method">
  <data key="d0">Exemplar Learning Method</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">一种根据个体排名直接选择迁出者而无需计算迁出率的学习方法，为OS、MS和WS层染色体设计了不同的迁移模式。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job-Based Migration">
  <data key="d0">Job-Based Migration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">针对OS层染色体的迁移模式，根据作业优先级进行分段迁移，每个段内迁移步骤相同，保证新解的可行性并有效遍历解空间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Generalised Position Migration">
  <data key="d0">Generalised Position Migration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">针对OS层染色体的迁移模式，随机选择子序列复制到新个体，并删除迁出个体中对应元素后顺序插入空位，确保可行性并遍历解空间。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Multi-Point Migration">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Point Migration</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">同时用于MS和WS层染色体的迁移模式，通过0-1向量R控制基因点来源，确保资源耦合关系，并增强调度方案的多样性。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
