</node>
<node id="Worker fatigue">
  <data key="d0">Worker fatigue</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工人疲劳，指工人在连续工作后身体和心理状态下降的现象，影响生产效率和调度性能。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Transfer time">
  <data key="d0">Transfer time</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">转移时间，指工件在机器间或车间内移动所需的时间，是调度中需考虑的实际约束。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Worker learning effect">
  <data key="d0">Worker learning effect</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工人学习效应，指工人通过重复作业提升熟练度，从而减少加工时间的现象。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Job priority">
  <data key="d0">Job priority</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">工件优先级，指为不同工件分配不同紧急程度或重要性，影响调度排序的规则。</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d4">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1785854126</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Outsourcing">
