<edge source="带有维护活动的柔性作业车间调度问题" target="机器可用性约束">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">机器可用性约束是该问题的核心限制之一，机器因维护而不可用。</data>
  <data key="d9">约束条件</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785299068</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="带有维护活动的柔性作业车间调度问题" target="维护资源约束">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">维护资源约束限制了可同时进行的维护活动数量。</data>
  <data key="d9">约束条件</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-0366a0700c144941e3596414c0dfb191-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d11">An effective heuristic for flexible job-shop scheduling problem with maintenance activities-3d02380f.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785299068</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
