<edge source="INEH2_dp" target="NEH2_en">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">INEH2_dp受NEH2_en启发，结合了丢弃操作和基于P_j的交换机制。&lt;SEP&gt;INEH2_dp与NEH2_en进行性能比较。&lt;SEP&gt;INEH2_dp及其各个dropout率变体在平均RPD和总CPU时间方面均优于NEH2_en。</data>
  <data key="d9">借鉴,启发,启发式算法,性能优势,支配,比较</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d11">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785300137</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="INEH2_dp" target="NEH2">
  <data key="d7">3.0</data>
  <data key="d8">INEH2_dp是NEH2的一种改进变体，专门为带有PM的分布式调度问题设计。&lt;SEP&gt;INEH2_dp与NEH2进行性能比较。&lt;SEP&gt;INEH2_dp及其各个dropout率变体在平均RPD和总CPU时间方面均优于NEH2。</data>
  <data key="d9">变体,启发式算法,基于,性能优势,支配,比较</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-009&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-014</data>
  <data key="d11">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785300137</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="INEH2_dp" target="Dropout Operation">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">INEH2_dp方法中引入了丢弃操作，以增加随机性并生成不同的初始解。</data>
  <data key="d9">使用,包含</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f86558f312309579bc8dcc17877dd712-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d11">An effective multi-start iterated greedy algorithm to minimize makespan for the distributed permutation flowshop scheduling problem with preventive ma-e4fc2e6d.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785300137</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="INEH2_dp" target="LPT Sequence">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">INEH2_dp首先将所有工件按总加工时间降序排列为LPT序列，然后依次取出。</data>
  <data key="d9">使用,初始排序</data>
