<edge source="V-CM" target="SADE-QD">
  <data key="d7">5.0</data>
  <data key="d8">在实例10J2F上，SADE-QD的RPI为0.064，显著低于V-CM的0.322†，表明SADE-QD性能更优。&lt;SEP&gt;在实例20J2F上，SADE-QD的RPI为0.031，显著低于V-CM的0.157†。&lt;SEP&gt;在实例20J3F上，SADE-QD的RPI为0.040，显著低于V-CM的0.261†。&lt;SEP&gt;在实例30J3F上，SADE-QD的RPI为0.046，显著低于V-CM的0.190†。&lt;SEP&gt;根据Wilcoxon检验，SADE-QD在所有实例上的RPI、MEAN和BEST指标均显著优于V-CM，p值大多小于0.05。</data>
  <data key="d9">10J2F,20J2F,20J3F,30J3F,RPI比较,性能比较,显著优势</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-022&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-019</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
