<edge source="$C_{i,j}$" target="属性3">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">属性3陈述了操作$O_{i,j}$的完成时间$C_{i,j}$可以通过前驱完成时间$C_{i,j-1}$、机器可用时间$M_t$、运输时间$TR_{i,j,k,k'}$和处理时间$\bar{T}_{i,j,k'}$定量计算</data>
  <data key="d9">公式,定量关系,属性</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$C_{i,j}$" target="$M_t$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">在$C_{i,j}$的计算公式$C_{i,j} = \max\{M_t, C_{i,j-1} + TR_{i,j,k,k'}\} + \bar{T}_{i,j,k'}$中，$M_t$是最大项的一个选项，直接影响$C_{i,j}$</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,最大项,机器可用时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$C_{i,j}$" target="$C_{i,j-1}$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$C_{i,j}$的计算依赖于前驱操作完成时间$C_{i,j-1}$，它在最大项中与运输时间相加</data>
  <data key="d9">依赖关系,公式输入,前驱完成时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$C_{i,j}$" target="$TR_{i,j,k,k'}$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">运输时间$TR_{i,j,k,k'}$与$C_{i,j-1}$相加后作为$\max$的一项，影响$C_{i,j}$的值</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,最大项,运输时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$C_{i,j}$" target="$\bar{T}_{i,j,k'}$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$C_{i,j}$的计算公式在最大项结果后加上处理时间$\bar{T}_{i,j,k'}$，因此它直接增加完成时间</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,加法,处理时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$C_{i,j}$" target="$S_{i,j}$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$C_{i,j}$由开始时间$S_{i,j}$加上处理时间$T_{i,j,k'}$得到，即$C_{i,j} = S_{i,j} + T_{i,j,k'}$</data>
  <data key="d9">处理时间,等式,计算关系</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$C_{i,j}$" target="$T_{i,j,k'}$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">在重新公式化中，$C_{i,j}$直接加上处理时间$T_{i,j,k'}$，该时间取决于操作和所分配的机器</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,加法,处理时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$C_{i,j}$" target="$O_{i,j}$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$C_{i,j}$是操作$O_{i,j}$的完成时间</data>
  <data key="d9">完成时间,属性</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$S_{i,j}$" target="$M_t$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">在等式$S_{i,j} = M_t + I_O$中，$S_{i,j}$被表示为机器可用时间加上机器空闲时间</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,机器可用时间,空闲时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$S_{i,j}$" target="$I_O$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$S_{i,j}$的计算包含机器空闲时间$I_O$，当作业迟到时$I_O &gt; 0$</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,加法,空闲时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$S_{i,j}$" target="$C_{i,j-1}$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">在另一种表示$S_{i,j} = (C_{i,j-1} + TR_{i,j,k,k'}) + W_O$中，$S_{i,j}$依赖于$C_{i,j-1}$</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,前驱完成时间,运输时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$S_{i,j}$" target="$TR_{i,j,k,k'}$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$S_{i,j}$的计算间接使用了运输时间$TR_{i,j,k,k'}$，它与$C_{i,j-1}$相加构成作业到达时间</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,运输时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$S_{i,j}$" target="$W_O$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$S_{i,j}$可以表示为作业到达时间加上作业等待时间$W_O$</data>
  <data key="d9">公式输入,加法,等待时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
