  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$M_t$" target="$I_O$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$I_O$的定义中，$M_t$作为被减数，决定机器空闲时间的值</data>
  <data key="d9">定义,空闲时间,输入</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836008</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="$M_t$" target="机器$k'$">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">$M_t$表示机器$k'$的可用时间，即该机器可以开始新操作的时间点</data>
  <data key="d9">可用时间,属性</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-005</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
