<edge source="C_{i,j}" target="M_t">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C_{i,j}受M_t影响：若M_t大于作业到达时间，则C_{i,j} = M_t + T_{i,j,k'}，直接延迟完成；否则M_t不影响C_{i,j}但产生空闲间隔I_O。总体C_{i,j}关于M_t非递减。</data>
  <data key="d9">依赖,单调非递减</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C_{i,j}" target="TR_{i,j,k,k'}">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C_{i,j}受TR_{i,j,k,k'}影响：运输时间增加直接延长等待或空闲间隔，从而延迟完成时间。总体C_{i,j}关于TR非递减。</data>
  <data key="d9">依赖,单调非递减</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C_{i,j}" target="T_{i,j,k'}">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C_{i,j}由开始时间S_{i,j}加上处理时间T_{i,j,k'}计算得到，因此T直接决定完成时间的长度。</data>
  <data key="d9">处理时间,组成</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C_{i,j}" target="C_{i,j-1}">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C_{i,j}依赖C_{i,j-1}，因为作业到达时间等于C_{i,j-1}加运输时间，C_{i,j-1}的延迟可能导致本操作开始时间延迟。</data>
  <data key="d9">依赖,前序完成</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C_{i,j}" target="S_{i,j}">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C_{i,j} = S_{i,j} + T_{i,j,k'}，完成时间由开始时间加上处理时间得到。</data>
  <data key="d9">定义关系,计算</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C_{i,j}" target="单调性">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C_{i,j}具有关于M_t和TR的单调性：增加这两个自变量不会导致C_{i,j}减小。</data>
  <data key="d9">单调性,性质</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C_{i,j}" target="加法影响">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C_{i,j}与无延迟完成时间的差异体现了加法影响：该差异等于由机器引起的延迟和运输延迟中的较大值。</data>
  <data key="d9">加法影响,性质</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C_{i,j}" target="O_{i,j}">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">C_{i,j} 表示操作O_{i,j} 的完工时间</data>
  <data key="d9">完工时间,表示</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-004</data>
  <data key="d11">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785848880</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="C_{i,j-1}" target="S_{i,j}">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">S_{i,j}依赖C_{i,j-1}，因为作业到达时间基于C_{i,j-1}。</data>
  <data key="d9">依赖,前序完成</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="M_t" target="S_{i,j}">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">S_{i,j}取机器可用时间M_t与作业到达时间的较大值，因此M_t是决定开始时间的因素之一。</data>
  <data key="d9">决定因素</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="TR_{i,j,k,k'}" target="S_{i,j}">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">S_{i,j}取决于作业到达时间C_{i,j-1}+TR_{i,j,k,k'}，因此运输时间影响开始时间的选择。</data>
  <data key="d9">决定因素</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
