<edge source="机器闲置时间(I_O)" target="工件等待时间(W_O)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">在任一调度场景中，I_O和W_O有且仅有一个非零：于机器先等待场景I_O&gt;0, W_O=0；于工件先等待场景W_O&gt;0, I_O=0。</data>
  <data key="d9">互斥,调度场景</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="机器闲置时间(I_O)" target="统一公式">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">统一公式中显式包含机器闲置时间项I_O，当机器先等待时该项非零。</data>
  <data key="d9">包含,项</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="工件等待时间(W_O)" target="统一公式">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">统一公式中显式包含工件等待时间项W_O，当工件先等待时该项非零。</data>
  <data key="d9">包含,项</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="完成时间(C_{i,j})" target="统一公式">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">完成时间C_{i,j}通过统一公式精确定义，该公式整合了两种场景下的延迟因素。</data>
  <data key="d9">定义,计算</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="完成时间(C_{i,j})" target="瓶颈">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">当机器繁忙成为瓶颈时，运输时间的变化可能不会导致完成时间增加，直到运输时间超过工件等待时间W_O。</data>
  <data key="d9">延迟,影响</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="运输时间(TR_{i,j,k,k'})" target="统一公式">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">统一公式通过前序完成时间与运输时间的和C_{i,j-1}+TR间接包含运输时间，其值影响工序的到达时刻。</data>
  <data key="d9">影响,隐含</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="运输时间(TR_{i,j,k,k'})" target="瓶颈">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">若运输时间是瓶颈(即运输时间大于原工件等待时间)，则C_{i,j}会直接受到运输时间增加的影响。</data>
  <data key="d9">延迟,影响</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="加工时间(T_{i,j,k'})" target="统一公式">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">统一公式中最后一项为加工时间T_{i,j,k'}，无论哪种场景均需完整加工。</data>
  <data key="d9">包含,项</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="性质3" target="统一公式">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">性质3明确给出了完成时间的统一公式，并论证了该公式如何正确反映机器闲置与运输时间的影响。</data>
  <data key="d9">提供,支撑</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-f0490d27025df4a1e3094e5246569dcc-chunk-007</data>
  <data key="d11">Self-Adaptive_Differential_Evolution-Enhanced_Quality-Diversity_Optimization_for_Distributed_Flexible_Job-Shop_Scheduling_With_Transportation-1158bd89.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785836007</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
