  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">该约束利用机器序列指示变量y来确保相邻操作的加工时间不重叠，并规定后序操作的等待条件。</data>
  <data key="d9">使用,核心变量</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-4e81bd487dda5925119fd6cffd61c849-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Research on the Flexible Job Shop Scheduling Problem with Job Priorities Considering Transportation Time and Setup Time-efb19039.pdf</data>
