<edge source="FJSP^+Batching模型" target="FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">在计算研究中，将FJSP^+Batching模型与FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型进行了比较，以测试其有效性。&lt;SEP&gt;FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型是FJSP^+Batching模型的一种变体，专为选择性作业调度而设计。</data>
  <data key="d9">变体,比较,继承,评估</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785850090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型" target="行业领域专家">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">行业领域专家在访谈中提供了选择性作业调度的关键见解，促使了该模型的修改。</data>
  <data key="d9">启发,提供见解</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785850090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型" target="约束(2.1)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">该模型将原始路径约束修改为约束(2.1)，以允许作业不被调度。</data>
  <data key="d9">修改,包含</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785850090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型" target="约束(2.2)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">该模型新增约束(2.2)，以确保被选中的作业完成所有操作。</data>
  <data key="d9">添加</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785850090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型" target="目标(2.3)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">该模型使用目标(2.3)来奖励被调度的作业，防止求解器丢弃所有作业。</data>
  <data key="d9">优化,采用</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-a9dfd659064575aec5a7501a69f9cd4d-chunk-003</data>
  <data key="d11">Flexible job shop scheduling problem for parallel batch processing machine with compatible job families-8085d806.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785850090</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="FJSP_Selective^+Batching模型" target="约束(2.4)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">该模型采用约束(2.4)计算每个作业的完成时间，并通过约束(2.5)定义最大完工时间。</data>
  <data key="d9">定义,计算</data>
