<edge source="eGA" target="MCPEA">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">为验证MCPEA在复杂约束下的改进显著优于通用算法，将其与eGA进行对比实验。&lt;SEP&gt;MCPEA在最大完工时间与作业优先级满足度上均优于eGA，Friedman检验中MCPEA排名第一，eGA排名第五。</data>
  <data key="d9">基准算法,对比实验,性能对比,进化算法</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d11">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854166</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="eGA" target="Table 8">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">表8列出了eGA的参数设置，包括Ps=100, r_GS=0.6, r_LS=0.3, r_RS=0.1, Pc=0.7, Mp=0.01。</data>
  <data key="d9">参数设置</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028</data>
  <data key="d11">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854166</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="HDPSO" target="MCPEA">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">为验证MCPEA在机器和工人协调调度方面的性能，将其与专门针对DRFJSP的HDPSO进行对比。&lt;SEP&gt;MCPEA在所有评估指标上超越HDPSO，Friedman检验中HDPSO排名第四。</data>
  <data key="d9">同领域先进,对比实验,性能对比,粒子群优化</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d11">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854166</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="HDPSO" target="双资源柔性作业车间调度问题(DRFJSP)">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">HDPSO算法专门设计用于解决双资源柔性作业车间调度问题。</data>
  <data key="d9">应用,问题解决</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028</data>
  <data key="d11">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854166</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="KMA" target="MCPEA">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">为验证MCPEA整体框架设计的优势，将其与最新算法KMA进行对比；KMA在个别实例上表现出竞争力。&lt;SEP&gt;MCPEA整体性能优于KMA，虽然在三个实例上KMA的Makespan最佳，但MCPEA在更多实例上排名第一。</data>
  <data key="d9">复杂资源受限,对比实验,性能对比,知识挖掘</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-034</data>
  <data key="d11">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854166</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="KMA" target="ZQL测试套件">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">KMA在ZQL测试套件上测试，在部分实例(ZQL05, ZQL06, ZQL19)上取得与MCPEA相当或更好的最佳完工时间，但整体不如MCPEA。</data>
  <data key="d9">性能评估,测试</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028</data>
  <data key="d11">A multi-critical-path co-driven evolutionary algorithm addressing the dual-resource flexible job shop scheduling problem with offline operations and j-8f6b0523.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854166</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="ZQL测试套件" target="MCPEA">
  <data key="d7">2.0</data>
  <data key="d8">MCPEA被用于求解ZQL测试套件中的20个实例以评估算法性能。&lt;SEP&gt;MCPEA在ZQL测试套件上进行测试，在大多数实例上取得最佳完工时间和最小平均值。</data>
  <data key="d9">性能评估,求解,测试</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-028&lt;SEP&gt;doc-49755fa14becf5cd2da17cfb1053b33b-chunk-021</data>
