<edge source="Start Time ST_ij" target="Completion Time CT_ij">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">根据方程(14)，完成时间CT_{ij} 不小于开始时间ST_{ij} 加上在各可选机器上的加工时间与运输时间之和。</data>
  <data key="d9">时间关系,约束</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Start Time ST_ij" target="Position Start Time S_fwm_p">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">方程(12)-(13)通过二进制变量X_{ijfwm_p} 约束：当工序(i,j)被分配到机器m的位置p时，ST_{ij} 等于S_{fwm_p}。</data>
  <data key="d9">分配,约束</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Start Time ST_ij" target="Assignment Variable X_ijfwm_p">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">变量X_{ijfwm_p} 决定工序(i,j)与机器位置的分配，从而影响开始时间ST_{ij}。</data>
  <data key="d9">分配关系</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Start Time ST_ij" target="Big M">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">在方程(12)-(13)中，大M用于确保当X=0时约束自动满足。</data>
  <data key="d9">大M法,约束</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Completion Time CT_ij" target="Processing Time PT_ijfwm">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">完成时间CT_{ij} 的计算包含工序在指定机器上的加工时间PT_{ijfwm}。</data>
  <data key="d9">加工时间,包含</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Completion Time CT_ij" target="Transport Time T_f">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">完成时间CT_{ij} 的计算包含乘积T_f * TF_{ij}，其中TF_{ij} 是工厂运输指示变量。已纠正原输出中忽略TF_{ij} 的错误。</data>
  <data key="d9">乘积,约束,运输时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Completion Time CT_ij" target="Transport Time T_w">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">完成时间CT_{ij} 的计算包含乘积T_w * TW_{ij}，其中TW_{ij} 是工作站运输指示变量。已纠正原输出中忽略TW_{ij} 的错误。</data>
  <data key="d9">乘积,约束,运输时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Completion Time CT_ij" target="Transport Time T_m">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">完成时间CT_{ij} 的计算包含乘积T_m * TM_{ij}，其中TM_{ij} 是机器运输指示变量。已纠正原输出中忽略TM_{ij} 的错误。</data>
  <data key="d9">乘积,约束,运输时间</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Completion Time CT_ij" target="Transport Indicator TF_ij">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">方程(14)中，TF_{ij} 与T_f相乘影响完成时间。</data>
  <data key="d9">依赖,约束</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Completion Time CT_ij" target="Transport Indicator TW_ij">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">方程(14)中，TW_{ij} 与T_w相乘影响完成时间。</data>
  <data key="d9">依赖,约束</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d12">1785854448</data>
  <data key="d13"></data>
</edge>
<edge source="Completion Time CT_ij" target="Transport Indicator TM_ij">
  <data key="d7">1.0</data>
  <data key="d8">方程(14)中，TM_{ij} 与T_m相乘影响完成时间。</data>
  <data key="d9">依赖,约束</data>
  <data key="d10">doc-b4a2ee09a275fc5e20453805c0167e0d-chunk-006</data>
  <data key="d11">Multi-objective optimization for distributed flexible job shop scheduling problem with job priority-91df90f1.pdf</data>
